ovation path of trustworthy AI in the Union.","neg=0.038,neu=0.721,pos=0.241,compound=0.8834,span=The European Artificial Intelligence Board (the ‘Board’) should support the Commission, to promote AI literacy tools, public awareness and understanding of the benefits, risks, safeguards, rights and obligations in relation to the use of AI systems.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=In cooperation with the relevant stakeholders, the Commission and the Member States should facilitate the drawing up of voluntary codes of conduct to advance AI literacy among persons dealing with the development, operation and use of AI."],["order","the greatest benefits","AI systems","fundamental rights","health","safety","democratic control","AI literacy","providers","deployers","affected persons","the necessary notions","informed decisions","AI systems","Those notions","regard","the relevant context","the correct application","technical elements","the AI system’s development phase","the measures","its use","the suitable ways","which","the AI system’s output","the case","affected persons","decisions","the assistance","AI","an impact","them","the context","the application","this Regulation","AI literacy","all relevant actors","the AI value chain","the insights","the appropriate compliance","its correct enforcement","the wide implementation","AI literacy measures","the introduction","appropriate follow-up actions","working conditions","the consolidation","innovation path","trustworthy AI","the Union","The European Artificial Intelligence Board","the ‘Board","the Commission","AI literacy tools","public awareness","understanding","the benefits","risks","safeguards","rights","obligations","relation","the use","AI systems","cooperation","the relevant stakeholders","the Commission","the Member States","the drawing","voluntary codes","conduct","AI literacy","persons","the development","operation","use","AI"],["",["20","NUM","","CARDINAL",["ROOT","20"]],"",["In","ADP","in","",["prep","eq