iders","AI systems","a non-discriminatory manner","they","the Union","a third country","deployers","AI systems","the Union"],["",["21","NUM","","CARDINAL",["ROOT","21"]],"",["In","ADP","in","",["prep","apply"]],["order","NOUN","","",["pobj","in"]],["to","PART","","",["aux","ensure"]],["ensure","VERB","","",["acl","order"],[1.6,""]],["a","DET","","",["det","field"]],"",["level","NOUN","","",["compound","field"]],["playing","NOUN","","",["compound","field"],[0.8,""]],["field","NOUN","","",["dobj","ensure"]],["and","CCONJ","","",["cc","field"]],["an","DET","","",["det","protection"]],["effective","ADJ","","",["amod","protection"],[2.1,""]],["protection","NOUN","","",["conj","field"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","protection"]],["rights","NOUN","right","",["pobj","of"]],["and","CCONJ","","",["cc","right"]],["freedoms","NOUN","freedom","",["conj","right"],[1.2,""]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","right"]],["individuals","NOUN","individual","",["pobj","of"]],["across","ADP","","",["prep","individual"]],["the","DET","","",["det","Union"]],["Union","PROPN","","",["pobj","across"]],"",["the","DET","","",["det","rule"]],["rules","NOUN","rule","",["nsubj","apply"]],["established","VERB","establish","",["acl","rule"]],["by","ADP","","",["agent","establish"]],["this","DET","","",["det","Regulation"]],["Regulation","PROPN","","",["pobj","by"]],["should","AUX","","",["aux","apply"]],["apply","VERB","","",["ROOT","apply"]],["to","ADP","","",["prep","apply"]],["providers","NOUN","provider","",["pobj","to"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","provider"]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["pobj","of"]],["in","ADP","","",["prep","provider"]],["a","DET","","",["det","manner"]],"",["non","ADJ","","",["amod","manner"]],"",["discriminatory","ADJ","","",["amod","manner"]],["manner","NOUN","","",["pobj","in"]],"",["irrespective","ADV","","",["advmod","apply"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","irrespective"]],["whether","SCONJ","","",["mark","establish"]],["they","PRON","","",["nsubjpass","establish"]],["are","AUX","be","",["auxpass","establish"]],["established","VERB","establish","",["pcomp","of"]],["within","ADP","","",["prep","establish"]],["the","DET","","",["det","Union"]],["Union","PROPN","","",["pobj","within"]],["or","CCONJ","","",["cc","within"]],["in","ADP","","",["conj","within"]],["a","DET","","",["det","country"]],"",["third","ADJ","","ORDINAL",["amod","country"]],["country","NOUN","","",["pobj","in"]],"",["and","CCONJ","","",["cc","establish"]],["to","ADP","","",["conj","establish"]],["deployers","NOUN","deployer","",["pobj","to"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","deployer"]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["pobj","of"]],["established","VERB","establish","",["acl","system"]],["within","ADP","","",["prep","establish"]],["the","DET","","",["det","Union"]],["Union","PROPN","","",["pobj","within"]],""],"neg=0.0,neu=0.437,pos=0.063,compound=0.4136"],[["neg=0.0,neu=0.95,pos=0.05,compound=0.2732,span=(22) In light of their digital nature, certain AI systems should fall within the scope of this Regulation even when they are not placed on the market, put into service, or used in the Union.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=This is the case, for example, where an operator established in the Union contracts certain services to an operator established in a third country in relation to an activity to be performed by an AI system that would qualify as high-risk.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=In those circumstances, the AI system used in a third country by the operator could process data lawfully collected in and transferred from the Union, and provide to the contracting operator in the Union the output of that AI system resulting from that processing, without that AI system being placed on the market, put into service or used in the Union.","neg=0.0,neu=0.858,pos=0.142,compound=0.8074,span=To prevent the circumvention of this Regulation and to ensure an effective protection of natural persons located in the Union, this Regulation should also apply to providers and deployers of AI systems that are established in a third country, to the extent the output produced by those systems is intended to be used in the Union.","neg=0.0,neu=0.862,pos=0.138,compound=0.9081,span=Nonetheless, to take into account existing arrangements and special needs for future cooperation with foreign partners with whom information and evidence is exchanged, this Regulation should not apply to public authorities of a third country and international organisations when acting in the framework of cooperation or international agreements concluded at Union or national level for law enforcement and judicial cooperation with the Union or the Member States, provided that the relevant third country or international organisation provides adequate safeguards with respect to the protection of fundamental rights and freedoms of individuals.","neg=0.0,neu=0.857,pos=0.143,compound=0.5423,span=Where relevant, this may cover activities of entities entrusted by the third countries to carry out specific tasks in support of such law enforcement and judicial cooperation.","neg=0.0,neu=0.94,pos=0.06,compound=0.2732,span=Such framework for cooperation or agreements have been established bilaterally between Member States and third countries or between the European Union, Europol and other Union agencies and third countries and international organisations.","neg=0.0,neu=0.714,pos=0.286,compound=0.9001,span=The authorities competent for supervision of the law enforcement and judicial authorities under this Regulation should assess whether those frameworks for cooperation or international agreements include adequate safeguards with respect to the protection of fundamental rights and freedoms of individuals.","neg=0.0,neu=0.92,pos=0.08,compound=0.3818,span=Recipient national authorities and Union institutions, bodies, offices and agencies making use of such outputs in the Union remain accountable to ensure their use complies with Union law.","neg=0.0,neu=0.813,pos=0.187,compound=0.7096,span=When those international agreements are revised or new ones are concluded in the future, the contracting parties should make utmost efforts to align those agreements with the requirements of this Regulation."],["light","their digital nature","certain AI systems","the scope","this Regulation","they","the market","service","the Union","This","the case","example","an operator","the Union","certain services","an operator","a third country","relation","an activity","an AI system","that","high-risk","those circumstances","the AI system","a third country","the operator","data","the Union","the contracting operator","the Union","the output","that AI system","that processing","that AI system","the market","service","the Union","the circumvention","this Regulation","an effective protection","natural persons","the Union","this Regulation","providers","deployers","AI systems","that","a third country","the extent","the output","those systems","the Union","account","existing arrangements","special needs","future cooperation","foreign partners","whom","information","evidence","this Regulation","public authorities","a third country","international organisations","the framework","cooperation","international agreements","Union","national level","law enforcement","judicial cooperation","the Union","the Member States","the relevant third country","international organisation","adequate safeguards","respect","the protection","fundamental rights","freedoms","individuals","this","activities","entities","the third countries","specific tasks","support","such law enforcement","judicial cooperation","Such framework","cooperation","agreements","Member States","third countries","the European Union","Europol","other Union agencies","third countries","international organisations","The authorities","supervision","the law enforcement","judicial authorities","this Regulation","those frameworks","c