ible harm and its probability of occurrence and they are used in a number of specifically pre-defined areas specified in this Regulation.","neg=0.031,neu=0.913,pos=0.056,compound=0.1779,span=The identification of those systems is based on the same methodology and criteria envisaged also for any future amendments of the list of high-risk AI systems that the Commission should be empowered to adopt, via delegated acts, to take into account the rapid pace of technological development, as well as the potential changes in the use of AI systems."],["stand-alone AI systems","namely high-risk AI systems","those","that","safety components","products","that","themselves","products","it","them","high-risk","light","their intended purpose","they","a high risk","harm","the health","safety","the fundamental rights","persons","account","both the severity","the possible harm","its probability","occurrence","they","a number","specifically pre-defined areas","this Regulation","The identification","those systems","the same methodology","criteria","any future amendments","the list","high-risk AI systems","that","the Commission","delegated acts","account","the rapid pace","technological development","the potential changes","the use","AI systems"],["",["52","NUM","","CARDINAL",["meta","regard"]],"",["As","SCONJ","as","",["mark","regard"]],["regards","NOUN","regard","",["advcl","be"]],["stand","VERB","","",["amod","system"]],"",["alone","ADJ","","",["prt","stand"],[-1,""]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["dobj","regard"]],"",["namely","ADV","","",["advmod","system"]],["high","ADJ","","",["amod","risk"]],"",["risk","NOUN","","",["compound","AI"],[-1.1,""]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["appos","regard"]],["other","ADJ","","",["amod","system"]],["than","ADP","","",["prep","other"]],["those","PRON","","",["pobj","than"]],["that","PRON","","",["nsubj","be"]],["are","AUX","be","",["relcl","those"]],["saf