replace it: the final decision-making must remain a human-driven activity.","neg=0.034,neu=0.882,pos=0.083,compound=0.4588,span=The classification of AI systems as high-risk should not, however, extend to AI systems intended for purely ancillary administrative activities that do not affect the actual administration of justice in individual cases, such as anonymisation or pseudonymisation of judicial decisions, documents or data, communication between personnel, administrative tasks."],["Certain AI systems","the administration","justice","democratic processes","high-risk","their potentially significant impact","democracy","law",", individual freedoms","the right","an effective remedy","a fair trial","the risks","potential biases","errors","opacity","it","high-risk AI systems","a judicial authority","its behalf","judicial authorities","researching and interpreting facts","the law","the law","a concrete set","facts","AI systems","alternative dispute resolution bodies","those purposes","high-risk","the outcomes","the alternative dispute resolution proceedings","legal effects","the parties","The use","AI tools","the decision-making power","judges","judicial independence","it","the final decision-making","a human-driven activity","The classification","AI systems","high-risk","AI systems","purely ancillary administrative activities","that","the actual administration","justice","individual cases","anonymisation","pseudonymisation","judicial decisions","documents","data","personnel","administrative tasks"],["",["61","NUM","","CARDINAL",["meta","classify"]],"",["Certain","PROPN","","",["compound","AI"],[1.1,""]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["nsubjpass","classify"]],["intended","VERB","intend","",["acl","system"]],["for","ADP","","",["prep","intend"]],["the","DET","","",["det","administration"]],["administration","NOUN","","",["pobj","for"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","administration"]],["justice","PROPN","","",["pobj","of"],[2.4,