0.077,compound=-0.5106,span=The Commission and relevant organisations and stakeholders are encouraged to take due consideration of the mitigation of risks and the negative impacts of the AI system.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=The expected level of performance metrics should be declared in the accompanying instructions of use.","neg=0.084,neu=0.656,pos=0.259,compound=0.6808,span=Providers are urged to communicate that information to deployers in a clear and easily understandable way, free of misunderstandings or misleading statements.","neg=0.0,neu=0.858,pos=0.142,compound=0.7003,span=Union law on legal metrology, including Directives 2014/31/EU and 2014/32/EU of the European Parliament and of the Council, aims to ensure the accuracy of measurements and to help the transparency and fairness of commercial transactions.","neg=0.0,neu=0.918,pos=0.082,compound=0.5106,span=In that context, in cooperation with relevant stakeholders and organisation, such as metrology and benchmarking authorities, the Commission should encourage, as appropriate, the development of benchmarks and measurement methodologies for AI systems.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=In doing so, the Commission should take note and collaborate with international partners working on metrology and relevant measurement indicators relating to AI."],["74) High-risk AI systems","their lifecycle","an appropriate level","accuracy","robustness","cybersecurity","light","their intended purpose","accordance","the generally acknowledged state","the art","The Commission","relevant organisations","stakeholders","due consideration","the mitigation","risks","the negative impacts","the AI system","The expected level","performance metrics","the accompanying instructions","use","Providers","that information","deployers","a clear and easily understandable way","misunderstandings","misleading statements","Union law","legal metrology","Directives","2014/31/EU","/EU","the European Parliament","the Coun