 of the European Parliament and of the Council on horizontal cybersecurity requirements for products with digital elements, should consider risks to the cyber resilience of an AI system as regards attempts by unauthorised third parties to alter its use, behaviour or performance, including AI specific vulnerabilities such as data poisoning or adversarial attacks, as well as, as relevant, risks to fundamental rights as required by this Regulation."],["prejudice","the requirements","robustness","accuracy","this Regulation","high-risk AI systems","which","the scope","a regulation","the European Parliament","the Council","horizontal cybersecurity requirements","products","digital elements","accordance","that regulation","compliance","the cybersecurity requirements","this Regulation","the essential cybersecurity requirements","that regulation","high-risk AI systems","the essential requirements","a regulation","the European Parliament","the Council","horizontal cybersecurity requirements","products","digital elements","they","the cybersecurity requirements","this Regulation","the achievement","those requirements","the EU declaration","conformity","parts","that regulation","that end","the assessment","the cybersecurity risks","a product","digital elements","high-risk AI system","this Regulation","a regulation","the European Parliament","the Council","horizontal cybersecurity requirements","products","digital elements","risks","the cyber resilience","an AI system","attempts","unauthorised third parties","its use","behaviour","performance","AI specific vulnerabilities","data poisoning","adversarial attacks","as relevant, risks","fundamental rights","this Regulation"],["",["77","NUM","","",["dep","demonstrate"]],"",["Without","ADP","without","",["prep","demonstrate"]],["prejudice","NOUN","","",["pobj","without"],[1.702,"Without prejudice"]],["to","ADP","","",["prep","without"]],["the","DET","","",["det","requirement"]],["requirements","NOUN","requirement","",["pobj","to"]],["r