al that providers ensure full compliance with accessibility requirements, including Directive (EU) 2016/2102 of the European Parliament and of the Council (38) and Directive (EU) 2019/882.","neg=0.0,neu=0.776,pos=0.224,compound=0.3818,span=Providers should ensure compliance with these requirements by design.","neg=0.087,neu=0.913,pos=0.0,compound=-0.2732,span=Therefore, the necessary measures should be integrated as much as possible into the design of the high-risk AI system."],["signatories","the United Nations Convention","the Rights","Persons","Disabilities","the Union","the Member States","persons","disabilities","discrimination","their equality","persons","disabilities","access","an equal basis","others","information and communications technologies","systems","respect","privacy","persons","disabilities","the growing importance","use","AI systems","the application","universal design principles","all new technologies","services","full and equal access","everyone","AI technologies","persons","disabilities","a way","that","full account","their inherent dignity","diversity","It","providers","full compliance","accessibility requirements","EU","the European Parliament","the Council","EU","Providers","compliance","these requirements","design","the necessary measures","the design","the high-risk AI system"],["",["80","NUM","","CARDINAL",["meta","oblige"]],"",["As","SCONJ","as","",["mark","oblige"]],["signatories","NOUN","signatory","",["nsubjpass","oblige"]],["to","ADP","","",["prep","signatory"]],["the","DET","","ORG",["det","Convention"]],["United","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","Nations"],[1.8,""]],["Nations","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","Convention"]],["Convention","PROPN","","ORG",["pobj","to"]],["on","ADP","","",["prep","signatory"]],["the","DET","","",["det","Rights"]],["Rights","PROPN","","",["pobj","on"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","Rights"]],["Persons","PROPN","","",["pobj","of"]],["with","ADP","","",["prep","Rights"]],["Disabilities","PROPN","","",["pobj","with"