"",["post","ADJ","","",["amod","system"]],"",["remote","ADJ","","",["amod","system"]],["biometric","ADJ","","",["amod","identification"]],["identification","NOUN","","",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["nsubjpass","use"]],["should","AUX","","",["aux","use"]],["not","PART","","",["neg","use"]],["be","AUX","","",["auxpass","use"]],["used","VERB","use","",["ROOT","use"]],["in","ADP","","",["prep","use"]],["the","DET","","",["det","framework"]],["framework","NOUN","","",["pobj","in"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","framework"]],["law","NOUN","","",["compound","enforcement"]],["enforcement","NOUN","","",["pobj","of"]],["to","PART","","",["aux","lead"]],["lead","VERB","","",["xcomp","use"]],["to","PART","","",["aux","indiscriminate"]],["indiscriminate","VERB","","",["advcl","lead"]],["surveillance","NOUN","","",["dobj","indiscriminate"]],"",["The","DET","the","",["det","condition"]],["conditions","NOUN","condition","",["nsubj","provide"]],["for","ADP","","",["prep","condition"]],["post","ADJ","","",["amod","identification"]],"",["remote","ADJ","","",["amod","identification"]],["biometric","ADJ","","",["amod","identification"]],["identification","NOUN","","",["pobj","for"]],["should","AUX","","",["aux","provide"]],["in","ADP","","",["prep","provide"]],["any","DET","","",["det","case"]],["case","NOUN","","",["pobj","in"]],["not","PART","","",["neg","provide"]],["provide","VERB","","",["ROOT","provide"]],["a","DET","","",["det","basis"]],"",["basis","NOUN","","",["dobj","provide"]],["to","PART","","",["aux","circumvent"]],["circumvent","VERB","","",["acl","basis"]],["the","DET","","",["det","condition"]],["conditions","NOUN","condition","",["dobj","circumvent"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","condition"]],["the","DET","","",["det","prohibition"]],["prohibition","NOUN","","",["pobj","of"]],["and","CCONJ","","",["cc","prohibition"]],["strict","ADJ","","",["amod","exception"]],["exceptions","NOUN","exception","",["conj","prohibition"]],["for","ADP","","",["prep","exception"]],["real","ADJ","","",["amod","time"]],["time","NOUN","","",["pobj","for"]],["remote","ADJ","","",["amod","identification"]],["biometric","ADJ","","",["amod","identification"]],["identification","NOUN","","",["dobj","circumvent"]],""],"neg=0.0,neu=0.47,pos=0.03,compound=0.182"],[["neg=0.05,neu=0.826,pos=0.123,compound=0.7269,span=(96) In order to efficiently ensure that fundamental rights are protected, deployers of high-risk AI systems that are bodies governed by public law, or private entities providing public services and deployers of certain high-risk AI systems listed in an annex to this Regulation, such as banking or insurance entities, should carry out a fundamental rights impact assessment prior to putting it into use.","neg=0.0,neu=0.899,pos=0.101,compound=0.2023,span=Services important for individuals that are of public nature may also be provided by private entities.","neg=0.0,neu=0.829,pos=0.171,compound=0.7506,span=Private entities providing such public services are linked to tasks in the public interest such as in the areas of education, healthcare, social services, housing, administration of justice.","neg=0.116,neu=0.884,pos=0.0,compound=-0.5859,span=The aim of the fundamental rights impact assessment is for the deployer to identify the specific risks to the rights of individuals or groups of individuals likely to be affected, identify measures to be taken in the case of a materialisation of those risks.","neg=0.062,neu=0.938,pos=0.0,compound=-0.2732,span=The impact assessment should be performed prior to deploying the high-risk AI system, and should be updated when the deployer considers that any of the relevant factors have changed.","neg=0.047,neu=0.894,pos=0.059,compound=0.2263,span=The impact assessment should identify the deployer’s relevant processes in which the high-risk AI system will be used in line with its intended purpose, and should include a deion of the period of time and frequency in which the system is intended to be used as well as of specific categories of natural persons and groups who are likely to be affected in the specific context of use.","neg=0.183,neu=0.817,pos=0.0,compound=-0.6808,span=The assessment should also include the identification of specific risks of harm likely to have an impact on the fundamental rights of those persons or groups.","neg=0.033,neu=0.939,pos=0.028,compound=-0.0559,span=While performing this assessment, the deployer should take into account information relevant to a proper assessment of the impact, including but not limited to the information given by the provider of the high-risk AI system in the instructions for use.","neg=0.108,neu=0.892,pos=0.0,compound=-0.7579,span=In light of the risks identified, deployers should determine measures to be taken in the case of a materialisation of those risks, including for example governance arrangements in that specific context of use, such as arrangements for human oversight according to the instructions of use or, complaint handling and redress procedures, as they could be instrumental in mitigating risks to fundamental rights in concrete use-cases.","neg=0.0,neu=0.92,pos=0.08,compound=0.0772,span=After performing that impact assessment, the deployer should notify the relevant market surveillance authority.","neg=0.068,neu=0.932,pos=0.0,compound=-0.5859,span=Where appropriate, to collect relevant information necessary to perform the impact assessment, deployers of high-risk AI system, in particular when AI systems are used in the public sector, could involve relevant stakeholders, including the representatives of groups of persons likely to be affected by the AI system, independent experts, and civil society organisations in conducting such impact assessments and designing measures to be taken in the case of materialisation of the risks.","neg=0.083,neu=0.829,pos=0.089,compound=0.0516,span=The European Artificial Intelligence Office (AI Office) should develop a template for a questionnaire in order to facilitate compliance and reduce the administrative burden for deployers."],["order","fundamental rights","deployers","high-risk AI systems","that","bodies","public law","private entities","public services","deployers","certain high-risk AI systems","an annex","this Regulation","banking or insurance entities","a fundamental rights impact assessment","it","use","Services","individuals","that","public nature","private entities","Private entities","such public services","tasks","the public interest","the areas","education","healthcare","social services","housing","administration","justice","The aim","the fundamental rights impact assessment","the deployer","the specific risks","the rights","individuals","groups","individuals","measures","the case","a materialisation","those risks","The impact assessment","the high-risk AI system","the deployer","any","the relevant factors","The impact assessment","the deployer’s relevant processes","which","the high-risk AI system","line","its intended purpose","a deion","the period","time","frequency","which","the system","specific categories","natural persons","groups","who","the specific context","use","The assessment","the identification","specific risks","harm","an impact","the fundamental rights","those persons","groups","this assessment","the deployer","account information","a proper assessment","the impact","the information","the provider","the high-risk AI system","the instructions","use","light","the risks","deployers","measures","the case","a materialisation","those risks","example governance arrangements","that specific context","use","arrangements","human oversight","the instructions","use","complaint handling and redress procedures","they","risks","fundamental rights","concrete use-cases","that impact assessment","the deployer","the relevant market surveillance authority","relevant information","the impact assessment","deployers","high-risk AI system","AI systems","the public sector","relevant stakeholders","the representati