ation or fine-tuning of a model, the obligations for providers of general-purpose AI models should be limited to that modification or fine-tuning, for example by complementing the already existing technical documentation with information on the modifications, including new training data sources, as a means to comply with the value chain obligations provided in this Regulation."],["(109) Compliance","the obligations","the providers","general-purpose AI models","the type","model provider","the need","compliance","persons","who","models","non-professional or scientific research purposes","who","these requirements","prejudice","Union copyright law","compliance","those obligations","due account","the size","the provider","simplified ways","compliance","SMEs","start-ups","that","an excessive cost","the use","such models","the case","a modification","fine-tuning","a model","the obligations","providers","general-purpose AI models","that modification","fine-tuning","example","the already existing technical documentation","information","the modifications","new training data sources","the value chain obligations","this Regulation"],["",["109","NUM","","CARDINAL",["nummod","compliance"]],"",["Compliance","NOUN","compliance","",["nsubj","be"]],["with","ADP","","",["prep","compliance"]],["the","DET","","",["det","obligation"]],["obligations","NOUN","obligation","",["pobj","with"]],["applicable","ADJ","","",["amod","obligation"]],["to","ADP","","",["prep","applicable"]],["the","DET","","",["det","provider"]],["providers","NOUN","provider","",["pobj","to"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","provider"]],["general","ADJ","","",["amod","purpose"]],"",["purpose","NOUN","","",["compound","model"]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","model"]],["models","NOUN","model","",["pobj","of"]],["should","AUX","","",["aux","be"]],["be","AUX","","",["ccomp","encourage"]],["commensurate","ADJ","","",["acomp","be"]],["and","CCONJ","","",["cc","commensurate"]],["proportionate","VERB","","",["conj","commensur