ncluding for example the capacity to control physical systems and interfere with critical infrastructure; risks from models of making copies of themselves or ‘self-replicating’ or training other models; the ways in which models can give rise to harmful bias and discrimination with risks to individuals, communities or societies; the facilitation of disinformation or harming privacy with threats to democratic values and human rights; risk that a particular event could lead to a chain reaction with considerable negative effects that could affect up to an entire city, an entire domain activity or an entire community."],["110) General-purpose AI models","systemic risks","which","any actual or reasonably foreseeable negative effects","relation","major accidents","disruptions","critical sectors","serious consequences","public health","safety","any actual or reasonably foreseeable negative effects","democratic processes","public and economic security","the dissemination","illegal, false, or discriminatory content","Systemic risks","model capabilities","model reach","the entire lifecycle","the model","conditions","misuse","model reliability","model fairness","model security","autonomy","the model","tools","modalities","release and distribution strategies","guardrails","other factors","international approaches","the need","attention","risks","potential intentional misuse","unintended issues","control","human intent","chemical, biological, radiological, and nuclear risks","the ways","which","barriers","entry","weapons development","design acquisition","offensive cyber capabilities","the ways","vulnerability discovery","exploitation","operational use","the effects","interaction","tool use","example","the capacity","physical systems","critical infrastructure","risks","models","copies","themselves","other models","the ways","which","models","rise","harmful bias","discrimination","risks","individuals","communities","societies","the facilitation","disinformation","privacy","threats