andboxes or establishing jointly a sandbox with one or more Member States’ competent authorities, insofar as this participation provides equivalent level of national coverage for the participating Member States.","neg=0.0,neu=0.913,pos=0.087,compound=0.2732,span=AI regulatory sandboxes could be established in physical, digital or hybrid form and may accommodate physical as well as digital products.","neg=0.0,neu=0.83,pos=0.17,compound=0.5423,span=Establishing authorities should also ensure that the AI regulatory sandboxes have the adequate resources for their functioning, including financial and human resources."],["138) AI","a rapidly developing family","technologies","that","regulatory oversight","a safe and controlled space","experimentation","responsible innovation","integration","appropriate safeguards","risk mitigation measures","a legal framework","that","innovation","disruption","Member States","their national competent authorities","at least one AI regulatory sandbox","national level","the development","testing","innovative AI systems","strict regulatory oversight","these systems","the market","service","Member States","this obligation","already existing regulatory sandboxes","jointly a sandbox","one or more Member States’ competent authorities","this participation","equivalent level","national coverage","the participating Member States","AI regulatory sandboxes","physical, digital or hybrid form","physical as well as digital products","authorities","the AI regulatory sandboxes","the adequate resources","their functioning","financial and human resources"],["",["138","NUM","","CARDINAL",["nummod","AI"]],"",["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["nsubj","be"]],["is","AUX","be","",["ROOT","be"]],["a","DET","","",["det","family"]],"",["rapidly","ADV","","",["advmod","develop"]],["developing","VERB","develop","",["amod","family"]],["family","NOUN","","",["attr","be"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","family"]],["technologies","NOUN","technology","",["pobj","of"]],["that","PRON","","