ew to support the development of Union expertise and capabilities at Union level and to strengthen the functioning of the digital single market.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=Furthermore, a Board composed of representatives of the Member States, a scientific panel to integrate the scientific community and an advisory forum to contribute stakeholder input to the implementation of this Regulation, at Union and national level, should be established.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=The development of Union expertise and capabilities should also include making use of existing resources and expertise, in particular through synergies with structures built up in the context of the Union level enforcement of other law and synergies with related initiatives at Union level, such as the EuroHPC Joint Undertaking and the AI testing and experimentation facilities under the Digital Europe Programme."],["This Regulation","a governance framework","that","both","the application","this Regulation","national level","capabilities","Union level","stakeholders","the field","AI","The effective implementation","enforcement","this Regulation","a governance framework","that","central expertise","Union level","The AI Office","Commission Decision","its mission","Union expertise","capabilities","the field","AI","the implementation","Union law","AI","Member States","the tasks","the AI Office","a view","the development","Union expertise","capabilities","Union level","the functioning","the digital single market","a Board","representatives","the Member States","a scientific panel","the scientific community","an advisory forum","stakeholder input","the implementation","this Regulation","Union","national level","The development","Union expertise","capabilities","use","existing resources","expertise","synergies","structures","the context","the Union level enforcement","other law","synergies","related initiatives","Union level","the EuroHPC Joint Undertaking","the AI testing an