 AI systems that can be used directly by deployers for at least one purpose that is classified as high-risk, market surveillance authorities should cooperate with the AI Office to carry out evaluations of compliance and inform the Board and other market surveillance authorities accordingly.","neg=0.104,neu=0.845,pos=0.051,compound=-0.5423,span=Furthermore, market surveillance authorities should be able to request assistance from the AI Office where the market surveillance authority is unable to conclude an investigation on a high-risk AI system because of its inability to access certain information related to the general-purpose AI model on which the high-risk AI system is built.","neg=0.0,neu=0.0,pos=0.0,compound=0.0,span=In such cases, the procedure regarding mutual assistance in cross-border cases in Chapter VI of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 should apply mutatis mutandis."],["It","the responsibilities","competences","Union","national level","AI systems","that","general-purpose AI models","overlapping competences","an AI system","a general-purpose AI model","the model","system","the same provider","the supervision","place","Union level","the AI Office","which","the powers","a market surveillance authority","the meaning","Regulation","(EU","this purpose","all other cases","national market surveillance authorities","the supervision","AI systems","general-purpose AI systems","that","deployers","at least one purpose","that","high-risk","market surveillance authorities","the AI Office","evaluations","compliance","the Board","other market surveillance authorities","market surveillance authorities","assistance","the AI Office","the market surveillance authority","an investigation","a high-risk AI system","its inability","certain information","the general-purpose AI model","which","the high-risk AI system","such cases","the procedure","mutual assistance","cross-border cases","Chapter VI","Regulation","EU","mutatis mutandis"],["",["161","NUM","","CARDINAL",["meta","be"]],"",