quired in Article 20; upon a reasoned request of a national competent authority, demonstrate the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2; ensure that the high-risk AI system complies with accessibility requirements in accordance with Directives (EU) 2016/2102 and (EU) 2019/882."],["Providers","high-risk AI systems","their high-risk AI systems","the requirements","Section","the high-risk AI system","that","its packaging","its accompanying documentation","their name","registered trade name","registered trade mark","the address","which","they","a quality management system","place","which","Article","the documentation","Article","their control","the logs","their high-risk AI systems","Article","the high-risk AI system","the relevant conformity assessment procedure","Article","its","the market","service","an EU declaration","conformity","accordance","Article","the CE","the high-risk AI system","that","its packaging","its accompanying documentation","conformity","this Regulation","accordance","Article","the registration obligations","Article 49(1","the necessary corrective actions","information","Article","a reasoned request","a national competent authority","the conformity","the high-risk AI system","the requirements","Section","the high-risk AI system","accessibility requirements","accordance","Directives","EU","(EU","2019/882"],[["Providers","NOUN","provider","",["nsubj","ensure"]],["of","ADP","","",["prep","provider"]],["high","ADJ","","",["amod","risk"]],"",["risk","NOUN","","",["compound","system"],[-1.1,""]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compound","system"]],["systems","NOUN","system","",["pobj","of"]],["shall","AUX","","",["aux","ensure"]],[":","PUNCT","","",["punct","ensure"]],["ensure","VERB","","",["ccomp","ensure"],[1.6,""]],["that","SCONJ","","",["mark","be"]],["their","PRON","","",["poss","system"]],["high","ADJ","","",["amod","risk"]],"",["risk","NOUN","","",["compound","system"],[-1.1,""]],["AI","PROPN","","ORG",["compou