s posed by the high-risk AI system; where applicable, comply with the registration obligations referred to in Article 49(1), or, if the registration is carried out by the provider itself, ensure that the information referred to in point 3 of Section A of Annex VIII is correct."],["The authorised representative","the tasks","the mandate","the provider","It","a copy","the mandate","the market surveillance authorities","request","the official languages","the institutions","the Union","the competent authority","the purposes","this Regulation","the mandate","the authorised representative","the following tasks","the EU declaration","conformity","Article","the technical documentation","Article","an appropriate conformity assessment procedure","the provider","the disposal","the competent authorities","national authorities","bodies","Article","a period","10 years","the high-risk AI system","the market","service","the contact details","the provider","that","the authorised representative","a copy","the EU declaration","conformity","Article","the technical documentation","the certificate","the notified body","a competent authority","a reasoned request","all the information","documentation","that","point","b","this subparagraph","the conformity","a high-risk AI system","the requirements","Section","access","the logs","Article 12(1","the high-risk AI system","the extent","such logs","the control","the provider","competent authorities","a reasoned request","any action","the latter take","relation","the high-risk AI system","the risks","the high-risk AI system","the registration obligations","Article 49(1","the registration","the provider","itself","the information","point","Section A","Annex VIII"],[["3","X","","CARDINAL",["ROOT","3"]],"",["The","DET","the","",["det","representative"]],["authorised","VERB","authorise","",["amod","representative"]],["representative","NOUN","","",["nsubj","perform"]],["shall","AUX","","",["aux","perform"]],["perform","VERB","","",["ROOT","perform"]]