,"perform","by","ai","system","and","include","prediction","content","recommendation","or","decision","ai","system","be","design","to","operate","with","vary","level","of","autonomy","mean","that","they","have","some degree","of","independence","of","action","from","human involvement","and","of","capability","to","operate","without","human intervention","the adaptiveness","that","an ai system","could","exhibit","after","deployment","refer","to","self","learn","capability","allow","the system","to","change","while","in","use","ai","system","can","be","use","on","a","stand","alone","basis","or","as","a","component","of","a","product","irrespective","of","whether","the system","be","physically","integrate","into","the product","embed","or","serve","the functionality","of","the product","without","be","integrate","therein","non","embedded"],"unmatched_count":170,"match_length":193,"cut_length":363},{"key":"12","text_words":[null,["13","NUM",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["notion","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["‘","PUNCT","'"],["deployer","NOUN",""],["’","PUNCT","'"],["referred","VERB","refer"],["to","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["interpreted","VERB","interpret"],["as","ADP",""],["any","DET",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["legal","ADJ",""],["person","NOUN",""],null,["including","VERB","include"],["a","DET",""],null,["public","ADJ",""],["authority","NOUN",""],null,["agency","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["other","ADJ",""],["body","NOUN",""],null,["using","VERB","use"],["an","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["under","ADP",""],["its","PRON",""],["authority","NOUN",""],null,["except","SCONJ",""],["where","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["used","VERB","use"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["course","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["personal","ADJ",""],["non","ADJ",""],null,["professional","ADJ",""],["activity","NOUN",""],null,["depending","VERB","depend"],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["type","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["system","NOUN",""],["may","AUX",""],["affect","VERB",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["other","ADJ",""],["than","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["deployer","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(13) The notion of ‘deployer’ referred to in this Regulation should be interpreted as any natural or legal person, including a public authority, agency or other body, using an AI system under its authority, except where the AI system is used in the course of a personal non-professional activity.Depending on the type of AI system, the use of the system may affect persons other than the deployer.","idx":12,"match_words":["the notion","deployer","refer","this regulation","interpret","any natural or legal person","include","public","authority","agency","other body","use","an ai system","its authority","the ai system","use","the course","personal","non","professional","activity","depend","the type","ai system","the use","the system","may","affect","person","other","the deployer"],"words":["the notion","of","deployer","refer","to","in","this regulation","should","be","interpret","as","any natural or legal person","include","a","public","authority","agency","or","other body","use","an ai system","under","its authority","except","where","the ai system","be","use","in","the course","of","a","personal","non","professional","activity","depend","on","the type","of","ai system","the use","of","the system","may","affect","person","other","than","the deployer"],"unmatched_count":19,"match_length":31,"cut_length":50},{"key":"13","text_words":[null,["14","NUM",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["notion","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["‘","PUNCT","'"],["biometric","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["’","PUNCT","'"],["used","VERB","use"],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["interpreted","VERB","interpret"],["in","ADP",""],["light","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["notion","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["as","SCONJ",""],["defined","VERB","define"],["in","ADP",""],["article","NOUN","article"],null,["4","NUM",""],null,["point","NOUN",""],null,["14","NUM",""],null,["of","ADP",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2016/679","PROPN",""],null,["article","PROPN",""],null,["3","NUM",""],null,["point","NOUN",""],null,["18","NUM",""],null,["of","ADP",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2018/1725","NUM",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["article","NOUN","article"],null,["3","NUM",""],null,["point","NOUN",""],null,["13","NUM",""],null,["of","ADP",""],["directive","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2016/680","PROPN",""],null,["biometric","ADJ","biometric"],["data","NOUN","datum"],["can","AUX",""],["allow","VERB",""],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["authentication","NOUN",""],null,["identification","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["categorisation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["and","CCONJ",""],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["recognition","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["emotions","NOUN","emotion"],["of","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],null],"text":"(14)The notion of ‘biometric data’ used in this Regulation should be interpreted in light of the notion of biometric data as defined in Article 4, point (14) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679, Article 3, point (18) of Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 and Article 3, point (13) of Directive (EU) 2016/680.Biometric data can allow for the authentication, identification or categorisation of natural persons and for the recognition of emotions of natural persons.","idx":13,"match_words":["the notion","biometric","datum","use","this regulation","interpret","light","the notion","biometric","datum","define","articl