a frown or a smile, or gestures such as the movement of hands, arms or head, or characteristics of a person’s voice, such as a raised voice or whispering.","idx":17,"match_words":["the notion","emotion","recognition","system","refer","this regulation","define","an ai system","the purpose","identify","infer","emotion","intention","natural","person","the basis","biometric","datum","the notion","refer","emotion","intention","such","include","physical","state","such","include","example","system","use","detect","the state","professional","the purpose","prevent","accident","also","include","the mere detection","readily","expression","movement","use","identify","infer","emotion","expression","basic","facial","expression","such","such","the movement","hand","characteristic","person","voice","such","raise","voice"],"words":["the notion","of","emotion","recognition","system","refer","to","in","this regulation","should","be","define","as","an ai system","for","the purpose","of","identify","or","infer","emotion","or","intention","of","natural","person","on","the basis","of","their","biometric","datum","the notion","refer","to","emotion","or","intention","such","as","happiness","sadness","anger","surprise","disgust","embarrassment","excitement","shame","contempt","satisfaction","and","amusement","it","do","not","include","physical","state","such","as","pain","or","fatigue","include","for","example","system","use","in","detect","the state","of","fatigue","of","professional","pilot","or","driver","for","the purpose","of","prevent","accident","this","do","also","not","include","the mere detection","of","readily","apparent","expression","gesture","or","movement","unless","they","be","use","for","identify","or","infer","emotion","those","expression","can","be","basic","facial","expression","such","as","a","frown","or","a","smile","or","gesture","such","as","the movement","of","hand","arm","or","head","or","characteristic","of","a","person","voice","such","as","a","raise","voice","or"