ndition","which","can","be","fulfil","by","an undetermined number","of","person","such","as","the purchase","of","a","ticket","or","title","of","transport","prior registration","or","have","a","certain","age","in","contrast","a","space","should","not","be","consider","to","be","publicly","accessible","if","access","be","limit","to","specific","and","define","natural","person","through","either union","or","national law","directly","relate","to","public safety","or","security","or","through","the clear manifestation","of","will","by","the person","have","the relevant authority","over","the space","the factual possibility","of","access","alone","such","as","an unlocked door","or","an open gate","in","a","fence","do","not","imply","that","the space","be","publicly","accessible","in","the presence","of","indication","or","circumstance","suggest","the contrary","such","as","sign","prohibit","or","restrict","access","company","and","factory","premise","as","well","as","office","and","workplace","that","be","intend","to","be","access","only","by","relevant","employee","and","service","provider","be","space","that","be","not","publicly","accessible","publicly","accessible","space","should","not","include","prison","or","border control","some","other","space","may","comprise","both","publicly","accessible","and","non","publicly","accessible","space","such","as","the hallway","of","a","private","residential","building","necessary","to","access","a","doctor","office","or","an airport","online","space","be","not","cover","as","they","be","not","physical","space","whether","a","give","space","be","accessible","to","the public","should","however","be","determine","on","a","case","by","case","basis","having","regard","to","the","specificity","of","the individual situation","at","hand"],"unmatched_count":182,"match_length":158,"cut_length":340},{"key":"19","text_words":[null,["20","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["obtain","VERB",""],["the","DET