ist","arrangement","and","special","need","for","future cooperation","with","foreign","partner","with","whom","information","and","evidence","be","exchange","this regulation","should","not","apply","to","public","authority","of","a","third","country","and","international organisation","when","act","in","the framework","of","cooperation","or","international","agreement","conclude","at","union","or","national level","for","law enforcement","and","judicial cooperation","with","the union","or","the member states","provide","that","the relevant third country","or","international","organisation","provide","adequate","safeguard","with","respect","to","the protection","of","fundamental","right","and","freedom","of","individual","where","relevant","this","may","cover","activity","of","entity","entrust","by","the","third","country","to","carry","out","specific","task","in","support","of","such law enforcement","and","judicial cooperation","such framework","for","cooperation","or","agreement","have","be","establish","bilaterally","between","member states","and","third","country","or","between","the european union","europol","and","other","union","agency","and","third","country","and","international","organisation","the","authority","competent","for","supervision","of","the law enforcement","and","judicial","authority","under","this regulation","should","assess","whether","those","framework","for","cooperation","or","international","agreement","include","adequate","safeguard","with","respect","to","the protection","of","fundamental","right","and","freedom","of","individual","recipient","national","authority","and","union","institution","body","office","and","agency","make","use","of","such","output","in","the union","remain","accountable","to","ensure","their","use","complie","with","union law","when","those","international","agreement","be","revise","or","new","one","be","conclude","in","the future","the","contracting","party","should","make","utmost","effort","to","align","th