pliance","of","the ai system","with","this regulation","unless","the system","be","already","compliant","with","this regulation","ai","system","place","on","the market","or","put","into","service","for","an","exclude","purpose","namely military","defence","or","national","security","and","or","more","non","excluded","purpose","such","as","civilian","purpose","or","law enforcement","fall","within","the scope","of","this regulation","and","provider","of","those","system","should","ensure","compliance","with","this regulation","in","those","case","the fact","that","an ai system","may","fall","within","the scope","of","this regulation","should","not","affect","the possibility","of","entity","carry","out","national","security","defence","and","military","activity","regardless","of","the type","of","entity","carry","out","those","activity","to","use","ai","system","for","national","security","military","and","defence","purpose","the use","of","which","be","exclude","from","the scope","of","this regulation","an ai system","place","on","the market","for","civilian","or","law","enforcement","purpose","which","be","use","with","or","without","modification","for","military","defence","or","national","security","purpose","should","not","fall","within","the scope","of","this regulation","regardless","of","the type","of","entity","carry","out","those","activity"],"unmatched_count":161,"match_length":212,"cut_length":373},{"key":"24","text_words":[null,["25","NUM",""],null,["this","DET","this"],["regulation","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["support","VERB",""],["innovation","NOUN",""],null,["should","AUX",""],["respect","VERB",""],["freedom","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["science","NOUN",""],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["undermine","VERB",""],["research","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["development","NOUN",""],["activity","NOUN",""],null,["it","PRON","it"],["is","AUX","be"],["therefore","ADV",""],["necessary","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["exclude","V