""],["and","CCONJ",""],["exploitative","ADJ",""],["practices","NOUN","practice"],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["affect","VERB",""],["lawful","ADJ",""],["practices","NOUN","practice"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["context","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["medical","ADJ",""],["treatment","NOUN",""],["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["psychological","ADJ",""],["treatment","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["mental","ADJ",""],["disease","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["physical","ADJ",""],["rehabilitation","NOUN",""],null,["when","SCONJ",""],["those","DET",""],["practices","NOUN","practice"],["are","AUX","be"],["carried","VERB","carry"],["out","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["applicable","ADJ",""],["law","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["medical","ADJ",""],["standards","NOUN","standard"],null,["for","ADP",""],["example","NOUN",""],["explicit","ADJ",""],["consent","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["individuals","NOUN","individual"],["or","CCONJ",""],["their","PRON",""],["legal","ADJ",""],["representatives","NOUN","representative"],null,["in","ADP","in"],["addition","NOUN",""],null,["common","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["legitimate","ADJ",""],["commercial","ADJ",""],["practices","NOUN","practice"],null,["for","ADP",""],["example","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["field","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["advertising","NOUN",""],null,["that","PRON",""],["comply","VERB",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["applicable","ADJ",""],["law","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["themselves","PRON",""],null,["be","AUX",""],["regarded","VERB","regard"],["as","ADP",""],["constituting","VERB","constitute"],["harmful","ADJ",""],["manipulative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],null,["enabled","VERB","enable"],["practices","NOUN","practice"],null],"text":"(29) AI-enabled manipulative techniques can be used to persuade persons to engage in unwanted behaviours, or to deceive them by nudging them into decisions in a way that subverts and impairs their autonomy, decision-making and free choices.The placing on the market, the putting into service or the use of certain AI systems with the objective to or the effect of materially distorting human behaviour, whereby significant harms, in particular having sufficiently important adverse impacts on physical, psychological health or financial interests are likely to occur, are particularly dangerous and should therefore be prohibited.Such AI systems deploy subliminal components such as audio, image, video stimuli that persons cannot perceive, as those stimuli are beyond human perception, or other manipulative or deceptive techniques that subvert or impair person’s autonomy, decision-making or free choice in ways that people are not consciously aware of those techniques or, where they are aware of them, can still be deceived or are not able to control or resist them.This could be facilitated, for example, by machine-brain interfaces or virtual reality as they allow for a higher degree of control of what stimuli are presented to persons, insofar as they may materially distort their behaviour in a significantly harmful manner.In addition, AI systems may also otherwise exploit the vulnerabilities of a person or a specific group of persons due to their age, disability within the meaning of Directive (EU) 2019/882 of the European Parliament and of the Council , or a specific social or economic situation that is likely to make those persons more vulnerable to exploitation such as persons living in extreme poverty, ethnic or religious minorities.Such AI systems can be placed on the market, put into service or used with the objective to or the effect of materially distorting the behaviour of a person and in a manner that causes or is reasonably likely to cause significant harm to that or another person or groups of persons, including harms that may be accumulated over time and should therefore be prohibited.It may not be possible to assume that there is an intention to distort behaviour where the distortion results from factors external to the AI system which are outside the control of the provider or the deployer, namely factors that may not be reasonably foreseeable and therefore not possible for the provider or the deployer of the AI system to mitigate.In any case, it is not necessary for the provider or the deployer to have the intention to cause significant harm, provided that such harm results from the manipulative or exploitative AI-enabled practices.The prohibitions for such AI practices are complementary to the provisions contained in Directive 2005/29/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council , in particular unfair commercial practices leading to economic or financial harms to consumers are prohibited under all circumstances, irrespective of whether they are put in place through AI systems or otherwise.The prohibitions of manipulative and exploitative practices in this Regulation should not affect lawful practices in the context of medical treatment such as psychological treatment of a mental disease or physical rehabilitation, when those practices are carried out in accordance with the applicable law and medical standards, for example explicit consent of the individuals or their legal representatives.In addition, common and legitimate commercial practices, for example in the field of advertising, that comply with the applicable law should not, in themselves, be regarded as constituting harmful manipulative AI-enabled practices.","idx":28,"match_words":["enable","manipulative","technique","use","person","engage","behaviour","decision","way","impair","their autonomy","decision","making","free","choice","the placing","the market","the putting","service","the use","certain","system","the objective","the effect","materially","distort","human","behaviour","significant harm","particular","have","sufficiently","important","adverse","impact","physical","psychological","health","financial","interest","likely","occur","particularly","therefore","prohibit","such","system","deploy","component","such","audio","image","video","stimulus","person","stimulus","human perception","other","manipulative","technique","impair","person","autonomy","decision","making","free","choice","way","people","aware","technique","aware","still","able","control","facilitate","example","machine","interface","virtual reality","allow","high","degree","control","stimulus","present","person","insofar","may","materially","distort","their behaviour","significantly","harmful","manner","addition","system","may","also","otherwise","exploit","vulnerability","person","specific","group","person","due","their age","disability","the meaning","directive","2019/882","the european parliament","the council","specific","social","economic","situation","likely","make","person","more","vulnerable","exploitation","such","person","live","extreme poverty","ethnic","religious","such","system","place","the market","put","service","use","the objective","the effect","materially","distort","the behaviour","person","manner","cause","reasonably","likely","cause","significant harm","another person","group","person","include","harm","may","over","time","therefore","prohibit","may","possible","assume","an intention","distort","behaviour","the distortion","result","factor","external","the ai system","the control","the provider","the deployer","namely","factor","may","reasonably","foreseeable","therefore","possible","the provider","the deployer","the ai system","mitigate","any case","necessary","the provider","the deployer","have","the intention","cause","significant","harm","provide","such harm","result","manipulative","exploitative","enable","practice","prohibition","such","practice","complementary","provision","contain","directive","the european parliament","the council","particular","commercial","practice","lead","economic","financial","harm","consumer","prohibit","all","circumstance","irrespective","put","place","system","otherwise","prohibition","manipulative","exploitative","practice","this regulation","affect","lawful","practice","the context","medical treatment","such","psychological treatment","physical rehabilitation","practice","carry","out","accordance","the applicable law","medical","standard","example","explicit","consent","individual","legal","representative","addition","common","legitimate","commercial","practice","example","the field","comply","applicable","law","regard","constitute","harmful","manipulative","enable","practice"],"words":["ai","enable","manipulative","technique","can","be","use","to","persuade","person","to","engage","in","unwanted","behaviour","or","to","deceive","they","by","nudge","they","into","decision","in","a","way","that","subvert","and","impair","their autonomy","decision","making","and","free","choice","the placing","on","the market","the putting","into","service","or","the use","of","certain","ai","system","with","the objective","to","or","the effect","of","materially","distort","human","behaviour","whereby","significant harm","in","particular","have","sufficiently","important","adverse","impact","on","physical","psychological","health","or","financial","interest","be","likely","to","occur","be","particularly","dangerous","and","should","therefore","be","prohibit","such","ai","system","deploy","subliminal","component","such","as","audio","image","video","stimulus","that","person","can","not","perceive","as","those","stimulus","be","beyond","human perception","or","other","manipulative","or","deceptive","technique","that","subvert","or","impair","person","autonomy","decision","making","or","free","choice","in","way","that","people","be","not","consciously","aware","of","those","technique","or","where","they","be","aware","of","they","can","still","be","deceive","or","be","not","able","to","control","or","resist","they","this","could","be","facilitate","for","example","by","machine","brain","interface","or","virtual reality","as","they","allow","for","a","high","degree","of","control","of","what","stimulus","be","present","to","person","insofar","as","they","may","materially","distort","their behaviour","in","a","significantly","harmful","manner","in","addition","ai","system","may","also","otherwise","exploit","the","vulnerability","of","a","person","or","a","specific","group","of","person","due","to","their age","disability","within","the meaning","of","directive","eu","2019/882","of","the european parliament","and","of","the council","or","a","specific","social","or","economic","situation","that","be","likely","to","make","those","person","more","vulnerable","to","exploitation","such","as","person","live","in","extreme poverty","ethnic","or","religious","minority","such","ai","system","can","be","place","on","the market","put","into","service","or","use","with","the objective","to","or","the effect","of","materially","distort","the behaviour","of","a","person","and","in","a","manner","that","cause","or","be","reasonably","likely","to","cause","significant harm","to","that","or","another person","or","group","of","person","include","harm","that","may","be","accumulate","over","time","and","should","therefore","be","prohibit","it","may","not","be","possible","to","assume","that","there","be","an intention","to","distort","behaviour","where","the distortion","result","from","factor","external","to","the ai system","which","be","outside","the control","of","the provider","or","the deployer","namely","factor","that","may","not","be","reasonably","foreseeable","and","therefore","not","possible","for","the provider","or","the deployer","of","the ai system","to","mitigate","in","any case","it","be","not","necessary","for","the provider","or","the deployer","to","have","the intention","to","cause","significant","harm","provide","that","such harm","result","from","the","manipulative","or","exploitative","ai","enable","practice","the","prohibition","for","such","ai","practice","be","complementary","to","the","provision","contain","in","directive","ec","of","the european parliament","and","of","the council","in","particular","unfair","commercial","practice","lead","to","economic","or","financial","harm","to","consumer","be","prohibit","under","all","circumstance","irrespective","of","whether","they","be","put","in","place","through","ai","system","or","otherwise","the","prohibition","of","manipulative","and","exploitative","practice","in","this regulation","should","not","affect","lawful","practice","in","the context","of","medical treatment","such","as","psychological treatment","of","a","mental","disease","or","physical rehabilitation","when","those","practice","be","carry","out","in","accordance","with","the applicable law","and","medical","standard","for","example","explicit","consent","of","the","individual","or","their","legal","representative","in","addition","common","and","legitimate","commercial","practice","for","example","in","the field","of","advertising","that","comply","with","the","applicable","law","should","not","in","themselves","be","regard","as","constitute","harmful","manipulative","ai","enable","practice"],"unmatched_count":265,"match_length":267,"cut_length":532},{"key":"29","text_words":[null,["30","NUM",""],null,["biometric","ADJ","biometric"],["categorisation","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["that","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["based","VERB","base"],["on","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["’","PART",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],null,["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["an","DET",""],["individual","ADJ",""],["person","NOUN",""],null,["face","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["fingerprint","VERB",""],null,["to","PART",""],["deduce","VERB",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["infer","VERB",""],["an","DET",""],["individuals","NOUN","individual"],["’","PART",""],["political","ADJ",""],["opinions","NOUN","opinion"],null,["trade","NOUN",""],["union","NOUN",""],["membership","NOUN",""],null,["religious","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["philosophical","ADJ",""],["beliefs","NOUN","belief"],null,["race","NOUN",""],null,["sex","NOUN",""],["life","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["sexual","ADJ",""],["orientation","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["prohibited","VERB","prohibit"],null,["that","DET","that"],["prohibition","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["cover","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["lawful","ADJ",""],["labelling","NOUN",""],null,["filtering","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["categorisation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN",""],["sets","NOUN","set"],["acquired","VERB","acquire"],["in","ADP",""],["line","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["union","PROPN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["national","ADJ",""],["law","NOUN",""],["according","VERB","accord"],["to","ADP",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],null,["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["sorting","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["images","NOUN","image"],["according","VERB","accord"],["to","ADP",""],["hair","NOUN",""],["colour","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["eye","NOUN",""],["colour","NOUN",""],null,["which","PRON",""],["can","AUX",""],["for","ADP",""],["example","NOUN",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["area","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["law","NOUN",""],["enforcement","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(30) Biometric categorisation systems that are based on natural persons’ biometric data, such as an individual person’s face or fingerprint, to deduce or infer an individuals’ political opinions, trade union membership, religious or philosophical beliefs, race, sex life or sexual orientation should be prohibited.That prohibition should not cover the lawful labelling, filtering or categorisation of biometric data sets acquired in line with Union or national law according to biometric data, such as the sorting of images according to hair colour or eye colour, which can for example be used in the area of law enforcement.","idx":29,"match_words":["biometric","categorisation","system","base","natural","person","biometric","datum","such","individual","person","infer","individual","political","opinion","trade union membership","religious","race","sex life","sexual orientation","prohibit","that prohibition","cover","the lawful labelling","filtering","categorisation","biometric data","set","acquire","line","union","national law","accord","biometric","datum","such","the sorting","image","accord","hair colour","eye colour","example","use","the area","law enforcement"],"words":["biometric","categorisation","system","that","be","base","on","natural","person","’","biometric","datum","such","as","an","individual","person","face","or","fingerprint","to","deduce","or","infer","an","individual","’","political","opinion","trade union membership","religious","or","philosophical","belief","race","sex life","or","sexual orientation","should","be","prohibit","that prohibition","should","not","cover","the lawful labelling","filtering","or","categorisation","of","biometric data","set","acquire","in","line","with","union","or","national law","accord","to","biometric","datum","such","as","the sorting","of","image","accord","to","hair colour","or","eye colour","which","can","for","example","be","use","in","the area","of","law enforcement"],"unmatched_count":38,"match_length":45,"cut_length":83},{"key":"30","text_words":[null,["31","NUM",""],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["providing","VERB","provide"],["social","ADJ",""],["scoring","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["by","ADP",""],["public","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["private","ADJ",""],["actors","NOUN","actor"],["may","AUX",""],["lead","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["discriminatory","ADJ",""],["outcomes","NOUN","outcome"],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["exclusion","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["certain","ADJ",""],["groups","NOUN","group"],null,["they","PRON","they"],["may","AUX",""],["violate","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["right","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["dignity","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["non","ADJ",""],null,["discrimination","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["values","NOUN","value"],["of","ADP",""],["equality","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["justice","NOUN",""],null,["such","ADJ","such"],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["evaluate","VERB",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["classify","VERB",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["or","CCONJ",""],["groups","NOUN","group"],["thereof","ADV",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["basis","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["multiple","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["points","NOUN","point"],["related","VERB","relate"],["to","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["social","ADJ",""],["behaviour","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["multiple","ADJ",""],["contexts","NOUN","context"],["or","CCONJ",""],["known","VERB","know"],null,["inferred","VERB","infer"],["or","CCONJ",""],["predicted","VERB","predict"],["personal","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["personality","VERB",""],["characteristics","NOUN","characteristic"],["over","ADP",""],["certain","ADJ",""],["periods","NOUN","period"],["of","ADP",""],["time","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["social","ADJ",""],["score","NOUN",""],["obtained","VERB","obtain"],["from","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["may","AUX",""],["lead","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["detrimental","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["unfavourable","ADJ",""],["treatment","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["or","CCONJ",""],["whole","ADJ",""],["groups","NOUN","group"],["thereof","ADV",""],["in","ADP",""],["social","ADJ",""],["contexts","NOUN","context"],null,["which","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["unrelated","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["context","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["which","PRON",""],["the","DET",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["was","AUX","be"],["originally","ADV",""],["generated","VERB","generate"],["or","CCONJ",""],["collected","VERB","collect"],["or","CCONJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["detrimental","ADJ",""],["treatment","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["disproportionate","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["unjustified","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["gravity","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["social","ADJ",""],["behaviour","NOUN",""],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["entailing","VERB","entail"],["such","ADJ",""],["unacceptable","ADJ",""],["scoring","NOUN",""],["practices","NOUN","practice"],["and","CCONJ",""],["leading","VERB","lead"],["to","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["detrimental","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["unfavourable","ADJ",""],["outcomes","NOUN","outcome"],["should","AUX",""],["therefore","ADV",""],["be","AUX",""],["prohibited","VERB","prohibit"],null,["that","DET","that"],["prohibition","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["affect","VERB",""],["lawful","ADJ",""],["evaluation","NOUN",""],["practices","NOUN","practice"],["of","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["that","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["carried","VERB","carry"],["out","ADP",""],["for","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["specific","ADJ",""],["purpose","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["union","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["national","ADJ",""],["law","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(31) AI systems providing social scoring of natural persons by public or private actors may lead to discriminatory outcomes and the exclusion of certain groups.They may violate the right to dignity and non-discrimination and the values of equality and justice.Such AI systems evaluate or classify natural persons or groups thereof on the basis of multiple data points related to their social behaviour in multiple contexts or known, inferred or predicted personal or personality characteristics over certain periods of time.The social score obtained from such AI systems may lead to the detrimental or unfavourable treatment of natural persons or whole groups thereof in social contexts, which are unrelated to the context in which the data was originally generated or collected or to a detrimental treatment that is disproportionate or unjustified to the gravity of their social behaviour.AI systems entailing such unacceptable scoring practices and leading to such detrimental or unfavourable outcomes should therefore be prohibited.That prohibition should not affect lawful evaluation practices of natural persons that are carried out for a specific purpose in accordance with Union and national law.","idx":30,"match_words":["system","provide","social scoring","natural","person","public","private","actor","may","lead","discriminatory","outcome","the exclusion","certain","group","may","the right","dignity","non","discrimination","value","equality","justice","such","system","evaluate","classify","natural","person","group","thereof","the basis","multiple","datum","point","relate","their social behaviour","multiple","context","know","infer","predict","personal","personality","characteristic","over","certain","period","time","the social score","obtain","such","system","may","lead","the detrimental or unfavourable treatment","natural","person","whole","group","thereof","social","context","the context","datum","originally","generate","collect","detrimental","treatment","disproportionate","unjustified","the gravity","their social behaviour","system","entail","such","unacceptable","practice","lead","such","detrimental","unfavourable","outcome","therefore","prohibit","that prohibition","affect","lawful","evaluation","practice","natural","person","carry","out","specific","purpose","accordance","union","national law"],"words":["ai","system","provide","social scoring","of","natural","person","by","public","or","private","actor","may","lead","to","discriminatory","outcome","and","the exclusion","of","certain","group","they","may","violate","the right","to","dignity","and","non","discrimination","and","the","value","of","equality","and","justice","such","ai","system","evaluate","or","classify","natural","person","or","group","thereof","on","the basis","of","multiple","datum","point","relate","to","their social behaviour","in","multiple","context","or","know","infer","or","predict","personal","or","personality","characteristic","over","certain","period","of","time","the social score","obtain","from","such","ai","system","may","lead","to","the detrimental or unfavourable treatment","of","natural","person","or","whole","group","thereof","in","social","context","which","be","unrelated","to","the context","in","which","the","datum","be","originally","generate","or","collect","or","to","a","detrimental","treatment","that","be","disproportionate","or","unjustified","to","the gravity","of","their social behaviour","ai","system","entail","such","unacceptable","scoring","practice","and","lead","to","such","detrimental","or","unfavourable","outcome","should","therefore","be","prohibit","that prohibition","should","not","affect","lawful","evaluation","practice","of","natural","person","that","be","carry","out","for","a","specific","purpose","in","accordance","with","union","and","national law"],"unmatched_count":66,"match_length":100,"cut_length":166},{"key":"31","text_words":[null,["32","NUM",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["for","ADP",""],["‘","PUNCT","'"],["real","ADJ",""],null,["time","NOUN",""],["’","PUNCT","'"],["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["in","ADP",""],["publicly","ADV",""],["accessible","ADJ",""],["spaces","NOUN","space"],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["purpose","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["law","NOUN",""],["enforcement