","ADP","in"],["addition","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["immediacy","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["impact","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["limited","ADJ",""],["opportunities","NOUN","opportunity"],["for","ADP",""],["further","ADJ",""],["checks","NOUN","check"],["or","CCONJ",""],["corrections","NOUN","correction"],["in","ADP",""],["relation","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["operating","VERB","operate"],["in","ADP",""],["real","ADJ",""],null,["time","NOUN",""],["carry","VERB",""],["heightened","VERB","heighten"],["risks","NOUN","risk"],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["rights","NOUN","right"],["and","CCONJ",""],["freedoms","NOUN","freedom"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["concerned","VERB","concern"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["context","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],null,["or","CCONJ",""],["impacted","VERB","impact"],["by","ADP",""],null,["law","NOUN",""],["enforcement","NOUN",""],["activities","NOUN","activity"],null],"text":"(32) The use of AI systems for ‘real-time’ remote biometric identification of natural persons in publicly accessible spaces for the purpose of law enforcement is particularly intrusive to the rights and freedoms of the concerned persons, to the extent that it may affect the private life of a large part of the population, evoke a feeling of constant surveillance and indirectly dissuade the exercise of the freedom of assembly and other fundamental rights.Technical inaccuracies of AI systems intended for the remote biometric identification of natural persons can lead to biased results and entail discriminatory effects.Such possible biased results and discriminatory effects are particularly relevant with regard to age, ethnicity, race, sex or disabilities.In addition, the immediacy of the impact and the limited opportunities for further checks or corrections in relation to the use of such systems operating in real-time carry heightened risks for the rights and freedoms of the persons concerned in the context of, or impacted by, law enforcement activities.","idx":31,"match_words":["the use","system","real","time","remote","biometric","identification","natural","person","publicly","accessible","space","the purpose","law enforcement","particularly","intrusive","right","freedom","concerned","person","the extent","may","affect","the private life","large","part","the population","constant surveillance","indirectly","the exercise","the freedom","other","fundamental","right","technical","system","intend","the remote biometric identification","natural","person","lead","biased","result","entail","discriminatory","effect","such","possible","biased","result","discriminatory","effect","particularly","relevant","regard","age","race","sex","disability","addition","the immediacy","the impact","limited","opportunity","further","check","correction","relation","the use","such","system","operate","real","time","carry","risk","right","freedom","person","concern","the context","impact","law","enforcement","activity"],"words":["the use","of","ai","system","for","real","time","remote","biometric","identification","of","natural","person","in","publicly","accessible","space","for","the purpose","of","law enforcement","be","particularly","intrusive","to","the","right","and","freedom","of","the","concerned","person","to","the extent","that","it","may","affect","the private life","of","a","large","part","of","the population","evoke","a","feeling","of","constant surveillance","and","indirectly","dissuade","the exercise","of","the freedom","of","assembly","and","other","fundamental","right","technical","inaccuracy","of","ai","system","intend","for","the remote biometric identification","of","natural","person","can","lead","to","biased","result","and","entail","discriminatory","effect","such","possible","biased","result","and","discriminatory","effect","be","particularly","relev