"],["include","VERB",""],["input","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["legally","ADV",""],["acquired","VERB","acquire"],["in","ADP",""],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["another","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["national","ADJ",""],["law","NOUN",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["any","DET",""],["case","NOUN",""],null,["no","DET",""],["decision","NOUN",""],["producing","VERB","produce"],["an","DET",""],["adverse","ADJ",""],["legal","ADJ",""],["effect","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["person","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["taken","VERB","take"],["based","VERB","base"],["solely","ADV",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["output","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(35) Each use of a ‘real-time’ remote biometric identification system in publicly accessible spaces for the purpose of law enforcement should be subject to an express and specific authorisation by a judicial authority or by an independent administrative authority of a Member State whose decision is binding.Such authorisation should, in principle, be obtained prior to the use of the AI system with a view to identifying a person or persons.Exceptions to that rule should be allowed in duly justified situations on grounds of urgency, namely in situations where the need to use the systems concerned is such as to make it effectively and objectively impossible to obtain an authorisation before commencing the use of the AI system.In such situations of urgency, the use of the AI system should be restricted to the absolute minimum necessary and should be subject to appropriate safeguards and conditions, as determined in national law and specified in the context of each individual urgent use case by the law enforcement authority itself.In addition, the law enforcement authority should in such situations request such authorisation while providing the reasons for not having been able to request it earlier, without undue delay and at the latest within 24 hours.If such an authorisation is rejected, the use of real-time biometric identification systems linked to that authorisation should cease with immediate effect and all the data related to such use should be discarded and deleted.Such data includes input data directly acquired by an AI system in the course of the use of such system as well as the results and outputs of the use linked to that authorisation.It should not include input that is legally acquired in accordance with another Union or national law.In any case, no decision producing an adverse legal effect on a person should be taken based solely on the output of the remote biometric identification system.","idx":34,"match_words":["each use","real","time","remote","biometric","identification","system","publicly","accessible","space","the purpose","law enforcement","subject","an express and specific authorisation","judicial","authority","an independent administrative authority","member","state","whose decision","bind","such authorisation","principle","obtain","prior","the use","the ai system","view","identify","person","person","exception","that rule","allow","duly","justify","situation","ground","urgency","namely","situation","the need","use","system","concern","such","make","effectively","obtain","an authorisation","before","commence","the use","the ai system","such","situation","urgency","the use","the ai system","restrict","the absolute minimum","necessary","subject","appropriate","safeguard","condition","determine","national law","specify","the context","each individual urgent use case","the law enforcement authority","addition","the law enforcement authority","such","situation","request","such authorisation","provide","reason","able","request","early","undue delay","late","hour","such an authorisation","reject","the use","real","time","biometric","identification","system","link","that authorisation","cease","immediate effect","all","datum","relate","such use","discard","delete","such","datum","include","input","datum","directly","acquire","an ai system","the course","the use","such system","well","result","output","the use","link","that authorisation","include","input","legally","acquire","accordance","another union","national law","any case","no decision","produce","an adverse legal effect","person","take","base","solely","the output","the remote biometric identification system"],"words":["each use","of","a","real","time","remote","biometric","identification","system","in","publicly","accessible","space","for","the purpose","of","law enforcement","should","be","subject","to","an express and specific authorisation","by","a","judicial","authority","or","by","an independent administrative authority","of","a","member","state","whose decision","be","bind","such authorisation","should","in","principle","be","obtain","prior","to","the use","of","the ai system","with","a","view","to","identify","a","person","or","person","exception","to","that rule","should","be","allow","in","duly","justify","situation","on","ground","of","urgency","namely","in","situation","where","the need","to","use","the","system","concern","be","such","as","to","make","it","effectively","and","objectively","impossible","to","obtain","an authorisation","before","commence","the use","of","the ai system","in","such","situation","of","urgency","the use","of","the ai system","should","be","restrict","to","the absolute minimum","necessary","and","should","be","subject","to","appropriate","safeguard","and","condition","as","determine","in","national law","and","specify","in","the context","of","each individual urgent use case","by","the law enforcement authority","itself","in","addition","the law enforcement authority","should","in","such","situation","request","such authorisation","while","provide","the","reason","for","not","having","be","able","to","request","it","early","without","undue delay","and","at","the","late","within","hour","if","such an authorisation","be","reject","the use","of","real","time","biometric","identification","system","link","to","that authorisation","should","cease","with","immediate effect","and","all","the","datum","relate","to","such use","should","be","discard","and","delete","such","datum","include","input","datum","directly","acquire","by","an ai system","in","the course","of","the use","of","such system","as","well","as","the","result","and","output","of","the use","link","to","that authorisation","it","should","not","include","input","that","be","legally","acquire","in","accordance","with","another union","or","national law","in","any case","no decision","produce","an adverse legal effect","on","a","person","should","be","take","base","solely","on","the output","of","the remote biometric identification system"],"unmatched_count":115,"match_length":138,"cut_length":253},{"key":"35","text_words":[null,["36","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["carry","VERB",""],["out","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["tasks","NOUN","task"],["in","ADP",""],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["requirements","NOUN","requirement"],["set","VERB",""],["out","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["as","ADV",""],["well","ADV",""],["as","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["national","ADJ",""],["rules","NOUN","rule"],null,["the","DET",""],["relevant","ADJ",""],["market","NOUN",""],["surveillance","NOUN",""],["authority","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["national","ADJ",""],["data","PROPN",""],["protection","NOUN",""],["authority","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["notified","VERB","notify"],["of","ADP",""],["each","DET",""],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["real","ADJ",""],null,["time","NOUN",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["market","NOUN","market"],["surveillance","NOUN",""],["authorities","NOUN","authority"],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["national","ADJ",""],["data","PROPN",""],["protection","NOUN",""],["authorities","NOUN","authority"],["that","PRON",""],["have","AUX",""],["been","AUX","be"],["notified","VERB","notify"],["should","AUX",""],["submit","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["commission","PROPN",""],["an","DET",""],["annual","ADJ",""],["report","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["real","ADJ",""],null,["time","NOUN",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null],"text":"(36) In order to carry out their tasks in accordance with the requirements set out in this Regulation as well as in national rules, the relevant market surveillance authority and the national data protection authority should be notified of each use of the real-time biometric identification system.Market surveillance authorities and the national data protection authorities that have been notified should submit to the Commission an annual report on the use of real-time biometric identification systems.","idx":35,"match_words":["order","carry","out","task","accordance","requirement","set","out","this regulation","well","national","rule","the relevant market surveillance authority","the national data protection authority","notify","each use","real","time","biometric","identification","system","market","surveillance","authority","national","data","protection","authority","have","notify","submit","the commission","an annual report","the use","real","time","biometric","identification","system"],"words":["in","order","to","carry","out","their","task","in","accordance","with","the","requirement","set","out","in","this regulation","as","well","as","in","national","rule","the relevant market surveillance authority","and","the national data protection authority","should","be","notify","of","each use","of","the","real","time","biometric","identification","syste