ull,["the","DET",""],["putting","NOUN",""],["into","ADP",""],["service","NOUN",""],null,["or","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["intended","VERB","intend"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["to","PART",""],["detect","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["emotional","ADJ",""],["state","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["individuals","NOUN","individual"],["in","ADP",""],["situations","NOUN","situation"],["related","VERB","relate"],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["workplace","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["education","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["prohibited","VERB","prohibit"],null,["that","DET","that"],["prohibition","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["cover","VERB",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["placed","VERB","place"],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["market","NOUN",""],["strictly","ADV",""],["for","ADP",""],["medical","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["safety","NOUN",""],["reasons","NOUN","reason"],null,["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["intended","VERB","intend"],["for","ADP",""],["therapeutical","ADJ",""],["use","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(44) There are serious concerns about the scientific basis of AI systems aiming to identify or infer emotions, particularly as expression of emotions vary considerably across cultures and situations, and even within a single individual.Among the key shortcomings of such systems are the limited reliability, the lack of specificity and the limited generalisability.Therefore, AI systems identifying or inferring emotions or intentions of natural persons on the basis of their biometric data may lead to discriminatory outcomes and can be intrusive to the rights and freedoms of the concerned persons.Considering the imbalance of power in the context of work or education, combined with the intrusive nature of these systems, such systems could lead to detrimental or unfavourable treatment of certain natural persons or whole groups thereof.Therefore, the placing on the market, the putting into service, or the use of AI systems intended to be used to detect the emotional state of individuals in situations related to the workplace and education should be prohibited.That prohibition should not cover AI systems placed on the market strictly for medical or safety reasons, such as systems intended for therapeutical use.","idx":43,"match_words":["serious","concern","the scientific basis","system","aim","identify","infer","emotion","particularly","expression","emotion","vary","situation","even","single","individual","key","shortcoming","such","system","the limited reliability","the lack","specificity","the limited generalisability","therefore","system","identify","infer","emotion","intention","natural","person","the basis","biometric","datum","may","lead","discriminatory","outcome","intrusive","right","freedom","concerned","person","consider","the imbalance","power","the context","work","education","combine","the intrusive nature","system","such","system","lead","detrimental or unfavourable treatment","certain","natural","person","whole","group","thereof","therefore","placing","the market","putting","service","the use","system","intend","use","detect","the emotional state","individual","situation","relate","the workplace","education","prohibit","that prohibition","cover","system","place","the market","strictly","medical","safety","reason","such","system","intend","therapeutical use"],"words":["there","be","serious","concern","about","the scientific basis","of","ai","system","aim","to","identify","or","infer","emotion","particularly","as","expression","of","emotion","vary","considerably","across","culture","and","situation","and","even","within","a","single","individual","among","the","key","shortcoming","of","such","system","be","the limited reliability","the lack","of","specificity","and","the limited generalisability","therefore","ai","system","id