manufacturing or personal assistance and care should be able to safely operate and performs their functions in complex environments.Similarly, in the health sector where the stakes for life and health are particularly high, increasingly sophisticated diagnostics systems and systems supporting human decisions should be reliable and accurate.","idx":46,"match_words":["system","have","an adverse impact","the health","safety","person","particular","such","system","operate","safety","component","product","consistent","objective","union harmonisation legislation","facilitate","the free movement","product","the internal market","ensure","only","safe","otherwise","compliant","product","find","their way","the market","important","safety","risk","may","generate","product","whole","due","digital","component","include","system","duly","prevent","mitigate","instance","increasingly","the context","personal assistance","care","able","safely","operate","perform","function","environment","similarly","the health sector","life","health","particularly","high","increasingly","system","system","support","human","decision","reliable"],"words":["ai","system","could","have","an adverse impact","on","the health","and","safety","of","person","in","particular","when","such","system","operate","as","safety","component","of","product","consistent","with","the","objective","of","union harmonisation legislation","to","facilitate","the free movement","of","product","in","the internal market","and","to","ensure","that","only","safe","and","otherwise","compliant","product","find","their way","into","the market","it","be","important","that","the","safety","risk","that","may","be","generate","by","a","product","as","a","whole","due","to","its","digital","component","include","ai","system","be","duly","prevent","and","mitigate","for","instance","increasingly","autonomous","robot","whether","in","the context","of","manufacturing","or","personal assistance","and","care","should","be","able","to","safely",