ion.The identification of those systems is based on the same methodology and criteria envisaged also for any future amendments of the list of high-risk AI systems that the Commission should be empowered to adopt, via delegated acts, to take into account the rapid pace of technological development, as well as the potential changes in the use of AI systems.","idx":51,"match_words":["regard","stand","alone","system","namely","high","risk","system","other","safety","component","product","product","appropriate","classify","high","risk","light","intend","purpose","pose","high","risk","harm","the health","safety","fundamental","right","person","take","account","both the severity","the possible harm","its probability","occurrence","use","number","specifically","pre","define","area","specify","this regulation","the identification","system","base","the same methodology","criterion","envisage","also","future","amendment","the list","high","risk","system","the commission","empower","adopt","delegate","act","take","account","the rapid pace","technological development","well","potential","change","the use","system"],"words":["as","regard","stand","alone","ai","system","namely","high","risk","ai","system","other","than","those","that","be","safety","component","of","product","or","that","be","themselves","product","it","be","appropriate","to","classify","they","as","high","risk","if","in","light","of","their","intend","purpose","they","pose","a","high","risk","of","harm","to","the health","and","safety","or","the","fundamental","right","of","person","take","into","account","both the severity","of","the possible harm","and","its probability","of","occurrence","and","they","be","use","in","a","number","of","specifically","pre","define","area","specify","in","this regulation","the identification","of","those","system","be","base","on","the same methodology","and","criterion","envisage","also","for","any","future","amendment","of","the list","of","high","risk","ai","system","that","th