","ADP",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["and","CCONJ",""],["property","NOUN",""],null,["components","NOUN","component"],["intended","VERB","intend"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["solely","ADV",""],["for","SCONJ",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["purposes","NOUN","purpose"],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["qualify","VERB",""],["as","ADP",""],["safety","NOUN",""],["components","NOUN","component"],null,["examples","NOUN","example"],["of","ADP",""],["safety","NOUN",""],["components","NOUN","component"],["of","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["critical","ADJ",""],["infrastructure","NOUN",""],["may","AUX",""],["include","VERB",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["for","ADP",""],["monitoring","VERB","monitor"],["water","NOUN",""],["pressure","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["fire","NOUN",""],["alarm","NOUN",""],["controlling","VERB","control"],["systems","NOUN","system"],["in","ADP",""],["cloud","ADJ",""],["computing","NOUN",""],["centres","NOUN","centre"],null],"text":"(55) As regards the management and operation of critical infrastructure, it is appropriate to classify as high-risk the AI systems intended to be used as safety components in the management and operation of critical digital infrastructure as listed in point (8) of the Annex to Directive (EU) 2022/2557, road traffic and the supply of water, gas, heating and electricity, since their failure or malfunctioning may put at risk the life and health of persons at large scale and lead to appreciable disruptions in the ordinary conduct of social and economic activities.Safety components of critical infrastructure, including critical digital infrastructure, are systems used to directly protect the physical integrity of critical infrastructure or the health and safety of persons and property but which are not necessary in order for the system to function.The failure or malfunctioning of such components might directly lead to risks to the physical integrity of critical infrastructure and thus to risks to health and safety of persons and property.Components intended to be used solely for cybersecurity purposes should not qualify as safety components.Examples of safety components of such critical infrastructure may include systems for monitoring water pressure or fire alarm controlling systems in cloud computing centres.","idx":54,"match_words":["regard","the management","operation","critical infrastructure","appropriate","classify","high","risk","system","intend","use","safety","component","the management","operation","critical digital infrastructure","list","point","the annex","directive","road traffic","the supply","water","electricity","their failure","malfunctioning","may","put","risk","the life","health","person","large scale","lead","disruption","the ordinary conduct","social","economic","activity","safety","component","critical infrastructure","include","critical digital infrastructure","system","use","directly","protect","the physical integrity","critical infrastructure","the health","safety","person","property","necessary","order","the system","function","the failure","malfunctioning","such","component","directly","lead","risk","the physical integrity","critical infrastructure","thus","risk","health","safety","person","property","component","intend","use","solely","cybersecurity","purpose","qualify","safety","component","example","safety","component","such critical infrastructure","may","include","system","monitor","water pressure","fire alarm","control","system","computing","centre"],"words":["as","regard","the management","and","operation","of","critical infrastructure","it","be","appropriate","to","classify","as","high","risk","the","ai","system","intend","to","be","use","as","safety","component","in","the management","and","operation","of","critical digital infrastructure","as","list","in","point","of","the annex","to","directive","eu","road traffic","and","the supply","of","water","gas","heating","and","electricity","since","their failure","or"