cant","ADJ",""],["impact","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["’","PART",""],["livelihood","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["if","SCONJ",""],["not","PART",""],["duly","ADV",""],["designed","VERB","design"],null,["developed","VERB","develop"],["and","CCONJ",""],["used","VERB","use"],null,["can","AUX",""],["infringe","VERB",""],["their","PRON",""],["fundamental","ADJ",""],["rights","NOUN","right"],["and","CCONJ",""],["can","AUX",""],["lead","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["serious","ADJ",""],["consequences","NOUN","consequence"],["for","ADP",""],["people","NOUN",""],null,["life","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["health","NOUN",""],null,["including","VERB","include"],["financial","ADJ",""],["exclusion","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["discrimination","NOUN",""],null,["finally","ADV","finally"],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["used","VERB","use"],["to","PART",""],["evaluate","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["classify","VERB",""],["emergency","NOUN",""],["calls","NOUN","call"],["by","ADP",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["or","CCONJ",""],["to","PART",""],["dispatch","VERB",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["establish","VERB",""],["priority","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["dispatching","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["emergency","NOUN",""],["first","ADJ",""],["response","NOUN",""],["services","NOUN","service"],null,["including","VERB","include"],["by","ADP",""],["police","NOUN",""],null,["firefighters","NOUN","firefighter"],["and","CCONJ",""],["medical","ADJ",""],["aid","NOUN",""],null,["as","ADV",""],["well","ADV",""],["as","ADP",""],["of","ADP",""],["emergency","NOUN",""],["healthcare","NOUN",""],["patient","NOUN",""],["triage","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["should","AUX",""],["also","ADV",""],["be","AUX",""],["classified","VERB","classify"],["as","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["since","SCONJ",""],["they","PRON",""],["make","VERB",""],["decisions","NOUN","decision"],["in","ADP",""],["very","ADV",""],["critical","ADJ",""],["situations","NOUN","situation"],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["life","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["health","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["and","CCONJ",""],["their","PRON",""],["property","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(58) Another area in which the use of AI systems deserves special consideration is the access to and enjoyment of certain essential private and public services and benefits necessary for people to fully participate in society or to improve one’s standard of living.In particular, natural persons applying for or receiving essential public assistance benefits and services from public authorities namely healthcare services, social security benefits, social services providing protection in cases such as maternity, illness, industrial accidents, dependency or old age and loss of employment and social and housing assistance, are typically dependent on those benefits and services and in a vulnerable position in relation to the responsible authorities.If AI systems are used for determining whether such benefits and services should be granted, denied, reduced, revoked or reclaimed by authorities, including whether beneficiaries are legitimately entitled to such benefits or services, those systems may have a significant impact on persons’ livelihood and may infringe their fundamental rights, such as the right to social protection, non-discrimination, human dignity or an effective remedy and should therefore be classified as high-risk.Nonetheless, this Regulation should not hamper the development and use of innovative approaches in the public administration, which would stand to benefit from a wider use of compliant and safe AI systems, provided that those systems do not entail a high risk to legal and natural persons.In addition, AI systems used to evaluate the credit score or creditworthiness of natural persons should be classified as high-risk AI systems, since they determine those persons’ access to financial resources or essential services such as housing, electricity, and telecommunication services.AI systems used for those purposes may lead to discrimination between persons or groups and may perpetuate historical patterns of discrimination, such as that based on racial or ethnic origins, gender, disabilities, age or sexual orientation, or may create new forms of discriminatory impacts.However, AI systems provided for by Union law for the purpose of detecting fraud in the offering of financial services and for prudential purposes to calculate credit institutions’ and insurance undertakings’ capital requirements should not be considered to be high-risk under this Regulation.Moreover, AI systems intended to be used for risk assessment and pricing in relation to natural persons for health and life insurance can also have a significant impact on persons’ livelihood and if not duly designed, developed and used, can infringe their fundamental rights and can lead to serious consequences for people’s life and health, including financial exclusion and discrimination.Finally, AI systems used to evaluate and classify emergency calls by natural persons or to dispatch or establish priority in the dispatching of emergency first response services, including by police, firefighters and medical aid, as well as of emergency healthcare patient triage systems, should also be classified as high-risk since they make decisions in very critical situations for the life and health of persons and their property.","idx":57,"match_words":["another area","the use","system","special consideration","the access","enjoyment","certain","essential","private","public","service","benefit","necessary","people","fully","participate","society","improve","standard","particular","natural","person","apply","receive","essential","public","assistance","benefit","service","public","authority","namely","healthcare","service","social","security","benefit","social","service","provide","protection","case","such","industrial","accident","old age","employment","social and housing assistance","typically","dependent","benefit","service","vulnerable","position","relation","responsible","authority","system","use","determine","such","benefit","service","grant","revoke","authority","include","entitle","such","benefit","service","system","may","have","significant","impact","person","livelihood","may","infringe","fundamental","right","such","the right","social protection","non","discrimination","human dignity","an effective remedy","therefore","classify","high","risk","nonetheless","this regulation","hamper","the development","use","innovative","approach","the public administration","stand","benefit","wide","use","compliant","safe","system","provide","system","entail","high","risk","legal","natural","person","addition","system","use","evaluate","the credit score","natural","person","classify","high","risk","system","determine","person","access","financial","resource","essential","service","such","housing","electricity","service","system","use","purpose","may","lead","discrimination","person","group","may","perpetuate","historical","pattern","discrimination","such","base","racial","ethnic","origin","gender","disability","age","sexual orientation","may","create","new","form","discriminatory","impact","however","system","provide","union law","the purpose","detect","fraud","the offering","financial","service","prudential","purpose","credit","institution","insurance","undertaking","requirement","consider","high","risk","this regulation","moreover","system","intend","use","risk assessment","relation","natural","person","health and life insurance","also","have","significant","impact","person","livelihood","duly","design","develop","use","infringe","fundamental","right","lead","serious","consequence","people","life","health","include","financial exclusion","discrimination","system","use","evaluate","classify","emergency","call","natural","person","establish","priority","the dispatching","emergency","first","response","service","include","police","medical aid","well","emergency","healthcare","system","also","classify","high","risk","make","decision","very","critical","situation","the life","health","person","their property"],"words":["another area","in","which","the use","of","ai","system","deserve","special consideration","be","the access","to","and","enjoyment","of","certain","essential","private","and","public","service","and","benefit","necessary","for","people","to","fully","participate","in","society","or","to","improve","standard","of","living","in","particular","natural","person","apply","for","or","receive","essential","public","assistance","benefit","and","service","from","public","authority","namely","healthcare","service","social","security","benefit","social","service","provide","protection","in","case","such","as","maternity","illness","industrial","accident","dependency","or","old age","and","loss","of","employment","and","social and housing assistance","be","typically","dependent","on","those","benefit","and","service","and","in","a","vulnerable","position","in","relation","to","the","responsible","authority","if","ai","system","be","use","for","determine","whether","such","benefit","and","service","should","be","grant","deny","reduced","revoke","or","reclaim","by","authority","include","whether","beneficiary","be","legitimately","entitle","to","such","benefit","or","service","those","system","may","have","a","significant","impact","on","person","’","livelihood","and","may","infringe","their","fundamental","right","such","as","the right","to","social protection","non","discrimination","human dignity","or","an effective remedy","and","should","therefore","be","classify","as","high","risk","nonetheless","this regulation","should","not","hamper","the development","and","use","of","innovative","approach","in","the public administration","which","would","stand","to","benefit","from","a","wide","use","of","compliant","and","safe","ai","system","provide","that","those","system","do","not","entail","a","high","risk","to","legal","and","natural","person","in","addition","ai","system","use","to","evaluate","the credit score","or","creditworthiness","of","natural","person","should","be","classify","as","high","risk","ai","system","since","they","determine","those","person","’","access","to","financial","resource","or","essential","service","such","as","housing","electricity","and","telecommunication","service","ai","system","use","for","those","purpose","may","lead","to","discrimination","between","person","or","group","and","may","perpetuate","historical","pattern","of","discrimination","such","as","that","base","on","racial","or","ethnic","origin","gender","disability","age","or","sexual orientation","or","may","create","new","form","of","discriminatory","impact","however","ai","system","provide","for","by","union law","for","the purpose","of","detect","fraud","in","the offering","of","financial","service","and","for","prudential","purpose","to","calculate","credit","institution","and","insurance","undertaking","’","capital","requirement","should","not","be","consider","to","be","high","risk","under","this regulation","moreover","ai","system","intend","to","be","use","for","risk assessment","and","pricing","in","relation","to","natural","person","for","health and life insurance","can","also","have","a","significant","impact","on","person","’","livelihood","and","if","not","duly","design","develop","and","use","can","infringe","their","fundamental","right","and","can","lead","to","serious","consequence","for","people","life","and","health","include","financial exclusion","and","discrimination","finally","ai","system","use","to","evaluate","and","classify","emergency","call","by","natural","person","or","to","dispatch","or","establish","priority","in","the dispatching","of","emergency","first","response","service","include","by","police","firefighter","and","medical aid","as","well","as","of","emerge