P",""],["the","DET",""],["intended","VERB","intend"],["and","CCONJ",""],["precluded","ADJ",""],["uses","NOUN","use"],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["use","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["correctly","ADV",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["enhance","VERB",""],["legibility","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["accessibility","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["information","NOUN",""],["included","VERB","include"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["instructions","NOUN","instruction"],["of","ADP",""],["use","NOUN",""],null,["where","SCONJ",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],null,["illustrative","ADJ",""],["examples","NOUN","example"],null,["for","ADP",""],["instance","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["limitations","NOUN","limitation"],["and","CCONJ",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["intended","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["precluded","ADJ",""],["uses","NOUN","use"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["included","VERB","include"],null,["providers","NOUN","provider"],["should","AUX",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["all","DET",""],["documentation","NOUN",""],null,["including","VERB","include"],["the","DET",""],["instructions","NOUN","instruction"],["for","ADP",""],["use","NOUN",""],null,["contains","VERB","contain"],["meaningful","ADJ",""],null,["comprehensive","ADJ",""],null,["accessible","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["understandable","ADJ",""],["information","NOUN",""],null,["taking","VERB","take"],["into","ADP",""],["account","NOUN",""],["the","DET",""],["needs","NOUN","need"],["and","CCONJ",""],["foreseeable","ADJ",""],["knowledge","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["target","NOUN",""],["deployers","NOUN","deployer"],null,["instructions","NOUN","instruction"],["for","ADP",""],["use","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["made","VERB","make"],["available","ADJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["language","NOUN",""],["which","PRON",""],["can","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["easily","ADV",""],["understood","VERB","understand"],["by","ADP",""],["target","NOUN",""],["deployers","NOUN","deployer"],null,["as","SCONJ",""],["determined","VERB","determine"],["by","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["member","PROPN",""],["state","PROPN",""],["concerned","VERB","concern"],null],"text":"(72) To address concerns related to opacity and complexity of certain AI systems and help deployers to fulfil their obligations under this Regulation, transparency should be required for high-risk AI systems before they are placed on the market or put it into service.High-risk AI systems should be designed in a manner to enable deployers to understand how the AI system works, evaluate its functionality, and comprehend its strengths and limitations.High-risk AI systems should be accompanied by appropriate information in the form of instructions of use.Such information should include the characteristics, capabilities and limitations of performance of the AI system.Those would cover information on possible known and foreseeable circumstances related to the use of the high-risk AI system, including deployer action that may influence system behaviour and performance, under which the AI system can lead to risks to health, safety, and fundamental rights, on the changes that have been pre-determined and assessed for conformity by the provider and on the relevant human oversight measures, including the measures to facilitate the interpretation of the outputs of the AI system by the deployers.Transparency, including the accompanying instructions for use, should assist deployers in the use of the system and support informed decision making by them.Deployers should, inter alia, be in a better position to make the correct choice of the system that they intend to use in light of the obligations applicable to them, be educated about the intended and precluded uses, and use the AI system correctly and as appropriate.In order to enhance legibility and accessibility of the information included in the instructions of use, where appropriate, illustrative examples, for instance on the limitations and on the intended and precluded uses of the AI system, should be included.Providers should ensure that all documentation, including the instructions for use, contains meaningful, comprehensive, accessible and understandable information, taking into account the needs and foreseeable knowledge of the target deployers.Instructions for use should be made available in a language which can be easily understood by target deployers, as determined by the Member State concerned.","idx":71,"match_words":["address","concern","relate","complexity","certain","system","help","deployer","fulfil","obligation","this regulation","transparency","require","high","risk","system","before","place","the market","put","service","high","risk","system","design","manner","enable","deployer","understand","the ai system","work","evaluate","its functionality","limitation","high","risk","system","accompany","appropriate information","the form","instruction","use","such information","include","characteristic","capability","limitation","performance","the ai system","cover","information","possible","known","foreseeable","circumstance","relate","the use","high","risk","system","include","deployer action","may","influence","system behaviour","performance","the ai system","lead","risk","health","safety","fundamental","right","change","have","pre","determined","assess","conformity","the provider","relevant","human","oversight","measure","include","measure","facilitate","the interpretation","output","the ai system","deployer","transparency","include","accompany","instruction","use","assist","deployer","the use","the system","support","informed decision","make","deployer","inter","alia","well","position","make","the correct choice","the system","int