],["or","CCONJ",""],["otherwise","ADV",""],["undesirable","ADJ",""],["behaviour","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["may","AUX",""],["result","VERB",""],["from","ADP",""],["limitations","NOUN","limitation"],["within","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["or","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["environment","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["which","PRON",""],["the","DET",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["operate","VERB",""],null,["e.g.","ADV",""],["errors","NOUN","error"],null,["faults","NOUN","fault"],null,["inconsistencies","NOUN","inconsistency"],null,["unexpected","ADJ",""],["situations","NOUN","situation"],null,null,["therefore","ADV","therefore"],null,["technical","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["organisational","ADJ",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["taken","VERB","take"],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["robustness","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["for","ADP",""],["example","NOUN",""],["by","ADP",""],["designing","VERB","design"],["and","CCONJ",""],["developing","VERB","develop"],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["technical","ADJ",""],["solutions","NOUN","solution"],["to","PART",""],["prevent","VERB",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["minimise","VERB",""],["harmful","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["otherwise","ADV",""],["undesirable","ADJ",""],["behaviour","NOUN",""],null,["those","DET","those"],["technical","ADJ",""],["solution","NOUN",""],["may","AUX",""],["include","VERB",""],["for","ADP",""],["instance","NOUN",""],["mechanisms","NOUN","mechanism"],["enabling","VERB","enable"],["the","DET",""],["system","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["safely","ADV",""],["interrupt","VERB",""],["its","PRON",""],["operation","NOUN",""],null,["fail","ADJ",""],null,["safe","ADJ",""],["plans","NOUN","plan"],null,["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["presence","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["certain","ADJ",""],["anomalies","NOUN","anomaly"],["or","CCONJ",""],["when","SCONJ",""],["operation","NOUN",""],["takes","VERB","take"],["place","NOUN",""],["outside","ADP",""],["certain","ADJ",""],["predetermined","VERB","predetermine"],["boundaries","NOUN","boundary"],null,["failure","NOUN","failure"],["to","PART",""],["protect","VERB",""],["against","ADP",""],["these","DET",""],["risks","NOUN","risk"],["could","AUX",""],["lead","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["safety","NOUN",""],["impacts","NOUN","impact"],["or","CCONJ",""],["negatively","ADV",""],["affect","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["fundamental","ADJ",""],["rights","NOUN","right"],null,["for","ADP",""],["example","NOUN",""],["due","ADP",""],["to","ADP",""],["erroneous","ADJ",""],["decisions","NOUN","decision"],["or","CCONJ",""],["wrong","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["biased","ADJ",""],["outputs","NOUN","output"],["generated","VERB","generate"],["by","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(75) Technical robustness is a key requirement for high-risk AI systems.They should be resilient in relation to harmful or otherwise undesirable behaviour that may result from limitations within the systems or the environment in which the systems operate (e.g. errors, faults, inconsistencies, unexpected situations).Therefore, technical and organisational measures should be taken to ensure robustness of high-risk AI systems, for example by designing and developing appropriate technical solutions to prevent or minimise harmful or otherwise undesirable behaviour.Those technical solution may include for instance mechanisms enabling the system to safely interrupt its operation (fail-safe plans) in the presence of certain anomalies or when operation takes place outside certain predetermined boundaries.Failure to protect against these risks could lead to safety impacts or negatively affect the fundamental rights, for example due to erroneous decisions or wrong or biased outputs generated by the AI system.","idx":74,"match_words":["technical robustness","key","requirement","high","risk","system","resilient","relation","harmful or otherwise undesirable behaviour","may","result","limitation","the system","the environment","system","operate","e.g.","error","inconsistency","situation","therefore","technical","organisational","measure","take","ensure","robustness","high","risk","system","example","design","develop","appropriate","technical","solution","prevent","minimise","harmful or otherwise undesirable behaviour","those technical solution","may","include","instance","mechanism","enable","system","safely","its operation","fail","safe","plan","the presence","certain","anomaly","operation","take","place","certain","failure","protect","risk","lead","safety","impact","affect","fundamental","right","example","due","decision","biased","output","generate","the ai system"],"words":["technical robustness","be","a","key","requirement","for","high","risk","ai","system","they","should","be","resilient","in","relation","to","harmful or otherwise undesirable behaviour","that","may","result","from","limitation","within","the system","or","the environment","in","which","the","system","operate","e.g.","error","fault","inconsistency","unexpected","situation","therefore","technical","and","organisational","measure","should","be","take","to","ensure","robustness","of","high","risk","ai","system","for","example","by","design","and","develop","appropriate","technical","solution","to","prevent","or","minimise","harmful or otherwise undesirable behaviour","those technical solution","may","include","for","instance","mechanism","enable","the","system","to","safely","interrupt","its operation","fail","safe","plan","in","the presence","of","certain","anomaly","or","when","operation","take","place","outside","certain","predetermine","boundary","failure","to","protect","against","these","risk","could","lead","to","safety","impact","or","negatively","affect","the","fundamental","right","for","example","due","to","erroneous","decision","or","wrong","or","biased","output","generate","by","the ai system"],"unmatched_count":55,"match_length":74,"cut_length":129},{"key":"75","text_words":[null,["76","NUM",""],null,["cybersecurity","NOUN","cybersecurity"],["plays","VERB","play"],["a","DET",""],null,["crucial","ADJ",""],["role","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["ensuring","VERB","ensure"],["that","SCONJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["are","AUX","be"],["resilient","ADJ",""],["against","ADP",""],["attempts","NOUN","attempt"],["to","PART",""],["alter","VERB",""],["their","PRON",""],["use","NOUN",""],null,["behaviour","NOUN",""],null,["performance","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["compromise","VERB",""],["their","PRON",""],["security","NOUN",""],["properties","NOUN","property"],["by","ADP",""],["malicious","ADJ",""],["third","ADJ",""],["parties","NOUN","party"],["exploiting","VERB","exploit"],["the","DET",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["vulnerabilities","NOUN","vulnerability"],null,["cyberattacks","NOUN","cyberattack"],["against","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["can","AUX",""],["leverage","VERB",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["specific","ADJ",""],["assets","NOUN","asset"],null,["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["training","NOUN",""],["data","NOUN",""],["sets","NOUN","set"],null,["e.g.","ADV",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["poisoning","NOUN",""],null,["or","CCONJ",""],["trained","VERB","train"],["models","NOUN","model"],null,["e.g.","ADV",""],["adversarial","ADJ",""],["attacks","NOUN","attack"],["or","CCONJ",""],["membership","NOUN",""],["inference","NOUN",""],null,null,["or","CCONJ",""],["exploit","VERB",""],["vulnerabilities","NOUN","vulnerability"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["digital","ADJ",""],["assets","NOUN","asset"],["or","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["underlying","ADJ",""],["ict","PROPN",""],["infrastructure","NOUN",""],null,["to","PART","to"],["ensure","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["level","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["risks","NOUN","risk"],null,["suitable","ADJ",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],null,["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["security","NOUN",""],["controls","NOUN","control"],null,["should","AUX",""],["therefore","ADV",""],["be","AUX",""],["taken","VERB","take"],["by","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["of","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["also","ADV",""],["taking","VERB","take"],["into","ADP",""],["account","NOUN",""],["as","ADP",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["the","DET",""],["underlying","ADJ",""],["ict","PROPN",""],["infrastructure","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(76) Cybersecurity plays a crucial role in ensuring that AI systems are resilient against attempts to alter their use, behaviour, performance or compromise their security properties by malicious third parties exploiting the system’s vulnerabilities.Cyberattacks against AI systems can leverage AI specific assets, such as training data sets (e.g. data poisoning) or trained models (e.g. adversarial attacks or membership inference), or exploit vulnerabilities in the AI system’s digital assets or the underlying ICT infrastructure.To ensure a level of cybersecurity appropriate to the risks, suitable measures, such as security controls, should therefore be taken by the providers of high-risk AI systems, also taking into account as appropriate the underlying ICT infrastructure.","idx":75,"match_words":["cybersecurity","play","role","ensure","system","resilient","attempt","alter","their use","behaviour","performance","security","property","third","party","exploit","system","vulnerability","system","specific","asset","such","training","data","set","e.g.","datum","poisoning","train","model","e.g.","adversarial","attack","membership inference","exploit","vulnerability","system","digital","asset","the underlying ict infrastructure","ensure","level","cybersecurity","appropriate","risk","