,"ADP",""],["an","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["therefore","ADV","therefore"],null,["prior","ADV",""],["to","ADP",""],["making","VERB","make"],["their","PRON",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["available","ADJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],null,["providers","NOUN","provider"],["established","VERB","establish"],["in","ADP",""],["third","ADJ",""],["countries","NOUN","country"],["should","AUX",""],null,["by","ADP",""],["written","VERB","write"],["mandate","NOUN",""],null,["appoint","VERB",""],["an","DET",""],["authorised","VERB","authorise"],["representative","NOUN",""],["established","VERB","establish"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],null,["this","DET","this"],["authorised","ADJ",""],["representative","NOUN",""],["plays","VERB","play"],["a","DET",""],null,["pivotal","ADJ",""],["role","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["ensuring","VERB","ensure"],["the","DET",""],["compliance","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["placed","VERB","place"],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["market","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["put","VERB",""],["into","ADP",""],["service","NOUN",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["by","ADP",""],["those","DET",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["who","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["not","PART",""],["established","VERB","establish"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["serving","VERB","serve"],["as","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["contact","NOUN",""],["person","NOUN",""],["established","VERB","establish"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],null],"text":"(82) To enable enforcement of this Regulation and create a level playing field for operators, and, taking into account the different forms of making available of digital products, it is important to ensure that, under all circumstances, a person established in the Union can provide authorities with all the necessary information on the compliance of an AI system.Therefore, prior to making their AI systems available in the Union, providers established in third countries should, by written mandate, appoint an authorised representative established in the Union.This authorised representative plays a pivotal role in ensuring the compliance of the high-risk AI systems placed on the market or put into service in the Union by those providers who are not established in the Union and in serving as their contact person established in the Union.","idx":81,"match_words":["enable","enforcement","this regulation","create","level","playing","field","operator","take","account","different","form","make","available","digital","product","important","ensure","all","circumstance","person","establish","the union","provide","authority","all the necessary information","the compliance","an ai system","therefore","prior","make","system","available","the union","provider","establish","third","country","write","mandate","appoint","authorise","representative","establish","the union","this authorised representative","play","role","ensure","the compliance","high","risk","system","place","the market","put","service","the union","provider","establish","the union","serve","their contact person","establish","the union"],"words":["to","enable","enforcement","of","this regulation","and","create","a","level","playing","field","for","operator","and","take","into","account","the","different","form","of","make","available","of","digital","product","it","be","important","to","ensure","that","under","all","circumstance","a","person","establish","in","the union","can","provide","authority","with","all the necessary information","on","the compliance","of","an ai system","therefore","prior","to","make","their","ai","system","available","in","the union","provider","establish","in","third","country","should","by","write","mandate","appoint