g","VERB","establish"],["that","SCONJ",""],["certain","ADJ",""],["changes","NOUN","change"],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["considered","VERB","consider"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["modifications","NOUN","modification"],["of","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["device","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["could","AUX",""],["affect","VERB",""],["its","PRON",""],["compliance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["applicable","ADJ",""],["requirements","NOUN","requirement"],null,["should","AUX",""],["continue","VERB",""],["to","PART",""],["apply","VERB",""],["to","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["that","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["medical","ADJ",""],["devices","NOUN","device"],["within","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["meaning","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["that","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null],"text":"(84) To ensure legal certainty, it is necessary to clarify that, under certain specific conditions, any distributor, importer, deployer or other third-party should be considered to be a provider of a high-risk AI system and therefore assume all the relevant obligations.This would be the case if that party puts its name or trademark on a high-risk AI system already placed on the market or put into service, without prejudice to contractual arrangements stipulating that the obligations are allocated otherwise.This would also be the case if that party makes a substantial modification to a high-risk AI system that has already been placed on the market or has already been put into service in a way that it remains a high-risk AI system in accordance with this Regulation, or if it modifies the intended purpose of an AI system, including a general-purpose AI system, which has not been classified as high-risk and has already been placed on the market or put into service, in a way that the AI system becomes a high-risk AI system in accordance with this Regulation.Those provisions should apply without prejudice to more specific provisions established in certain Union harmonisation legislation based on the New Legislative Framework, together with which this Regulation should apply.For example, Article 16(2) of Regulation (EU) 2017/745, establishing that certain changes should not be considered to be modifications of a device that could affect its compliance with the applicable requirements, should continue to apply to high-risk AI systems that are medical devices within the meaning of that Regulation.","idx":83,"match_words":["ensure","legal certainty","necessary","clarify","certain","specific","condition","any distributor","importer","deployer","other","third","party","consider","provider","high","risk","system","therefore","assume","all","relevant","obligation","the case","that party","put","its name","trademark","high","risk","system","already","place","the market","put","service","prejudice","contractual","arrangement","obligation","allocate","otherwise","also","the case","that party","make","substantial","modification","high","risk","system","have","already","place","the market","have","already","put","service","way","remain","high","risk","system","accordance","this regulation","modify","intend","purpose","an ai system","include","general","purpose","system","have","classify","high","risk","have","already","place","the market","put","service","way","the ai system","become","high","risk","system","accordance","this regulation","provision","apply","prejudice","more","specific","provision","establish","certain union harmonisation legislation","base","the new legislative framework","together","this regulation","apply","example","article","regulation","2017/745","establish","certain","change","consider","modification","device","affect","its compliance","applicable","requirement","continue","apply","high","risk","system","medical","device","the meaning","that regulation"],"words":["to","ensure","legal certainty","it","be","necessary","to","clarify","that","under","certain","specific","condition","any distributor","importer","deployer","or","other","third","party","should","be","consider","to","be","a","provider","of","a","high","risk","ai","system","and","therefore","assume","all","the","relevant","obligation","this","would","be","the case","if","that party","put","its name","or","trademark","on","a","high","risk","ai","system","already","place","on","the market","or","put","into","service","without","prejudice","to","contractual","arrangement","stipulate","that","the","obligation","be","allocate","otherwise","this","would","also","be","the case","if","that party","make","a","substantial","modification","to","a","high","risk","ai","system","that","have","already","be","place","on","the market","or","have","already","be","put","into","service","in","a","way","that","it","remain","a","high","risk","ai","system","in","accordance","with","this regulation","or","if","it","modify","the","intend","purpose","of","an ai system","include","a","general","purpose","ai","system","which","have","not","be","classify","as","high","risk","and","have","already","be","place","on","the market","or","put","into","service","in","a","way","that","the ai system","become","a","high","risk","ai","system","in","accordance","with","this regulation","those","provision","should","apply","without","prejudice","to","more","specific","provision","establish","in","certain union harmonisation legislation","base","on","the new legislative framework","together","with","which","this regulation","should","apply","for","example","article","of","regulation","eu","2017/745","establish","that","certain","change","should","not","be","consider","to","be","modification","of","a","device","that","could","affect","its compliance","with","the","applicable","requirement","should","continue","to","apply","to","high","risk","ai","system","that","be","medical","device","within","the meaning","of","that regulation"],"unmatched_count":111,"match_length":128,"cut_length":239},{"key":"84","text_words":[null,["85","NUM",""],null,["general","ADJ","general"],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["may","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["as","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["by","ADP",""],["themselves","PRON",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["be","AUX",""],["components","NOUN","component"],["of","ADP",""],["other","ADJ",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["therefore","ADV","therefore"],null,["due","ADP",""],["to","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["nature","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["fair","ADJ",""],["sharing","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["responsibilities","NOUN","responsibility"],["along","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["value","NOUN",""],["chain","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["of","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],null,["irrespective","ADV",""],["of","ADP",""],["whether","SCONJ",""],["they","PRON",""],["may","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["as","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["as","ADP",""],["such","ADJ",""],["by","ADP",""],["other","ADJ",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["or","CCONJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["components","NOUN","component"],["of","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["and","CCONJ",""],["unless","SCONJ",""],["provided","VERB","provide"],["otherwise","ADV",""],["under","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["closely","ADV",""],["cooperate","VERB",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["relevant","ADJ",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["to","PART",""],["enable","VERB",""],["their","PRON",""],["compliance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["relevant","ADJ",""],["obligations","NOUN","obligation"],["under","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["competent","ADJ",""],["authorities","NOUN","authority"],["established","VERB","establish"],["under","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null],"text":"(85) General-purpose AI systems may be used as high-risk AI systems by themselves or be components of other high-risk AI systems.Therefore, due to their particular nature and in order to ensure a fair sharing of responsibilities along the AI value chain, the providers of such systems should, irrespective of whether they may be used as high-risk AI systems as such by other providers or as components of high-risk AI systems and unless provided otherwise under this Regulation, closely cooperate with the providers of the relevant high-risk AI systems to enable their compliance with the relevant obligations under this Regulation and with the competent authorities established under this Regulation.","idx":84,"match_words":["general","purpose","system","may","use","high","risk","system","component","other","high","risk","system","therefore","due","their particular nature","order","ensure","fair","sharing","responsibility","the ai value chain","provider","such","system","irrespective","may","use","high","risk","system","such","other","provider","component","high","risk","system","provide","otherwise","this regulation","closely","cooperate","provider","relevant","high","risk","system","enable","their compliance","relevant","obligation","this regulation","competent","authority","establish","this regulation"],"words":["general","purpose","ai","system","may","be","use","as","high","risk","ai","system","by","themselves","or","be","component","of","other","high","risk","ai","system","therefore","due","to","their particular nature","and","in","order","to","ensure","a","fair","sharing","of","responsibility","along","the ai value chain","the","provider","of","such","system","should","irrespective","of","whether","they","may","be","use","as","high","risk","ai","system","as","such","by","other","provider","or","as","component","of","high","risk","ai","system","and","unless","provide","otherwise","under","this regulation","closely","cooperate","with","the","provider","of","the","relevant","high","risk","ai","system","to","enable","their compliance","with","the","relevant","obligation","under","this regulation","and","with","the","competent","authority","establish","under","this regulation"],"unmatched_count":48,"match_length":57,"cut_length":105},{"key":"85","text_words":[null,["86","NUM",""],null,["where","SCONJ","where"],null,["under","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["conditions","NOUN","condition"],["laid","VERB","lay"],["down","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["provider","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["initially","ADV",""],["placed","VERB","place"],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["market","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["put","VERB",""],["it","PRON",""],["into","ADP",""],["service","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["no","ADV",""],["longer","ADV","long"],["be","AUX",""],["considered","VERB","consider"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["the","DET",""],["provider","NOUN",""],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["purposes","NOUN","purpose"],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["when","SCONJ",""],["that","DET",""],["provider","NOUN",""],["has","AUX","have"],["not","PART",""],["expressly","ADV",""],["excluded","VERB","exclude"],["the","DET",""],["change","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["into","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["former","ADJ",""],["provider","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["nonetheless","ADV",""],["closely","ADV",""],["cooperate","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["make","VERB",""],["available","ADJ",""],["the","DET",""],["necessary","ADJ",""],["information","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["provide","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["reasonably","ADV",""],["expected","VERB","expect"],["technical","ADJ",""],["access","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["other","ADJ",""],["assistance","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["are","AUX","be"],["required","VERB","require"],["for","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["fulfilment","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["obligations","NOUN","obligation"],["set","VERB",""],["out","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["regarding","VERB","regard"],["the","DET",""],["compliance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["conformity","NOUN",""],["assessment","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null],"text":"(86) Where, under the conditions laid down in this Regulation, the provider that initially placed the AI system on the market or put it into service should no longer be considered to be the provider for the purposes of this Regulation, and when that provider has not expressly excluded the change of the AI system into a high-risk AI system, the former provider should nonetheless closely cooperate and make available the necessary information and provide the reasonably expected technical access and other assistance that are required for the fulfilment of the obligations set out in this Regulation, in particular regarding the compliance with the conformity assessment of high-risk AI systems.","idx":85,"match_words":["condition","lay","down","this regulation","the provider","place","the ai system","the market","put","service","long","consider","the provider","purpose","this regulation","that provider","have","expressly","exclude","the change","the ai system","high","risk","system","the former provider","nonetheless","closely","cooperate","make","available the necessary information","provide","reasonably","expect","technical","access","other assistance","require","the fulfilment","obligation","set","out","this regulation","particular","regard","the compliance","the conformity assessment","high","risk","system"],"words":["where","under","the","condition","lay","down","in","this regulation","the provider","that","initially","place","the ai system","on","the market","or","put","it","into","service","should","no","long","be","consider","to","be","the provider","for","the","purpose","of","this regulation","and","when","that provider","have","not","expressly","exclude","the change","of","the ai system","into","a","high","risk","ai","system","the former provider","should","nonetheless","closely","cooperate","and","make","available the necessary information","and","provide","the","reasonably","expect","technical","access","and","other assistance","that","be","require","for","the fulfilment","of","the","obligation","set","out","in","this regulation","in","particular","regard","the compliance","with","the conformity assessment","of","high","risk","ai","system"],"unmatched_count":40,"match_length":49,"cut_length":89},{"key":"86","text_words":[null,["87","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["addition","NOUN",""],null,["where","SCONJ",""],["a","DET",""],null,["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["a","DET",""],null,["safety","NOUN",""],["component","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["product","NOUN",""],["which","PRON",""],["falls","VERB","fall"],["within","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["scope","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["union","PROPN",""],["harmonisation","NOUN",""],["legislation","NOUN",""],["based","VERB","base"],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["new","PROPN",""],["legislative","PROPN",""],["framework","PROPN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["not","PART",""],["placed","VERB","place"],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["market","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["put","VERB",""],["into","ADP",""],["service","NOUN",""],["independently","ADV",""],["from","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["product","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["product","NOUN",""],["manufacturer","NOUN",""],["defined","VERB","define"],["in","ADP",""],["that","DET",""],["legislation","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["comply","VERB",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["obligations","NOUN","obligation"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["provider","NOUN",""],["established","VERB","establish"],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["should","AUX",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],null,["ensure","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],["embedded","VERB","embed"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["final","ADJ",""],["product","NOUN",""],["complies","NOUN","complie"],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["requirements","NOUN","requirement"],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null],"text":"(87) In addition, where a high-risk AI system that is a safety component of a product which falls within the scope of Union harmonisation legislation based on the New Legislative Framework is not placed on the market or put into service independently from the product, the product manufacturer defined in that legislation should comply with the obligations of the provider established in this Regulation and should, in particular, ensure that the AI system embedded in the final product complies with the requirements of this Regulation.","idx":86,"match_words":["addition","high","risk","system","safety","component","product","fall","the scope","union harmonisation legislation","base",