N",""],["own","ADJ",""],["intellectual","ADJ",""],["property","NOUN",""],["rights","NOUN","right"],["or","CCONJ",""],["trade","NOUN",""],["secrets","NOUN","secret"],null],"text":"(88) Along the AI value chain multiple parties often supply AI systems, tools and services but also components or processes that are incorporated by the provider into the AI system with various objectives, including the model training, model retraining, model testing and evaluation, integration into software, or other aspects of model development.Those parties have an important role to play in the value chain towards the provider of the high-risk AI system into which their AI systems, tools, services, components or processes are integrated, and should provide by written agreement this provider with the necessary information, capabilities, technical access and other assistance based on the generally acknowledged state of the art, in order to enable the provider to fully comply with the obligations set out in this Regulation, without compromising their own intellectual property rights or trade secrets.","idx":87,"match_words":["value","chain","multiple","party","often","supply","system","tool","service","also","component","process","incorporate","the provider","the ai system","various","objective","include","model","training","model","model","testing","evaluation","integration","software","other","aspect","model development","party","have","an important role","play","the value chain","the provider","high","risk","system","system","tool","service","component","process","integrate","provide","write","agreement","this provider","the necessary information","capability","technical access","other assistance","base","generally","acknowledge","state","the art","order","enable","the provider","fully","comply","obligation","set","out","this regulation","own","intellectual","property","right","trade","secret"],"words":["along","the","ai","value","chain","multiple","party","often","supply","ai","system",