,"NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["this","DET","this"],["information","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["include","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["intended","VERB","intend"],["purpose","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["type","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["decisions","NOUN","decision"],["it","PRON",""],["makes","VERB","make"],null,["the","DET","the"],["deployer","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["also","ADV",""],["inform","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["natural","ADJ",""],["persons","NOUN","person"],["about","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["right","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["an","DET",""],["explanation","NOUN",""],["provided","VERB","provide"],["under","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["with","ADP","with"],["regard","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["used","VERB","use"],["for","ADP",""],["law","NOUN",""],["enforcement","NOUN",""],["purposes","NOUN","purpose"],null,["that","DET",""],["obligation","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["implemented","VERB","implement"],["in","ADP",""],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["article","NOUN","article"],null,["13","NUM",""],["of","ADP",""],["directive","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2016/680","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(93) Whilst risks related to AI systems can result from the way such systems are designed, risks can as well stem from how such AI systems are used.Deployers of high-risk AI system therefore play a critical role in ensuring that fundamental rights are protected, complementing the obligations of the provider when developing the AI system.Deployers are best placed to understand how the high-risk AI system will be used concretely and can therefore identify potential significant risks that were not foreseen in the development phase, due to a more precise knowledge of the context of use, the persons or groups of persons likely to be affected, including vulnerable groups.Deployers of high-risk AI systems listed in an annex to this Regulation also play a critical role in informing natural persons and should, when they make decisions or assist in making decisions related to natural persons, where applicable, inform the natural persons that they are subject to the use of the high-risk AI system.This information should include the intended purpose and the type of decisions it makes.The deployer should also inform the natural persons about their right to an explanation provided under this Regulation.With regard to high-risk AI systems used for law enforcement purposes, that obligation should be implemented in accordance with Article 13 of Directive (EU) 2016/680.","idx":92,"match_words":["risk","relate","system","result","the way","such","system","design","risk","well","stem","such","system","use","deployer","high","risk","system","therefore","play","critical","role","ensure","fundamental","right","protect","complement","obligation","the provider","develop","the ai system","deployer","well","place","understand","high","risk","system","will","use","therefore","identify","potential","significant","risk","the development phase","due","more","knowledge","the context","use","person","group","person","likely","affect","include","vulnerable","group","deployer","high","risk","system","list","an annex","this regulation","also","play","critical","role","inform","natural","person","make","decision","assist","make","decision","relate","natural","person","applicable","inform","natural","person","subject","the use","high","risk","system","this information","include","intend","purpose","the type","decision","make","the deployer","also","inform","natural","person","their right","an explanation","provide","this regulation","regard","high","risk","system","use","law","enforcement","purpose","that obligation","implement","accordance","article","directive","2016/680"],"words":["whilst","risk","relate","to","ai","system","can","result","from","