6/680, that allows such processing only where strictly necessary, subject to appropriate safeguards for the rights and freedoms of the data subject, and where authorised by Union or Member State law.Such use, when authorised, also needs to respect the principles laid down in Article 4 (1) of Directive (EU) 2016/680 including lawfulness, fairness and transparency, purpose limitation, accuracy and storage limitation.","idx":93,"match_words":["any processing","biometric","datum","involve","the use","system","biometric identification","the purpose","law enforcement","need","comply","article","directive","2016/680","allow","such processing","only","strictly","necessary","subject","appropriate","safeguard","right","freedom","datum","subject","authorise","union or member state law","such use","authorise","also","need","respect","principle","lay","down","article","directive","2016/680","include","fairness","transparency","purpose limitation","accuracy","storage limitation"],"words":["any processing","of","biometric","datum","involve","in","the use","of","ai","system","for","biometric identification","for","the purpose","of","law enforcement","need","to","comply","with","article","of","directive","eu","2016/680","that","allow","such processing","only","where","strictly","necessary","subject","to","appropriate","safeguard","for","the","right","and","freedom","of","the","datum","subject","and","where","authorise","by","union or member state law","such use","when","authorise","also","need","to","respect","the","principle","lay","down","in","article","of","directive","eu","2016/680","include","lawfulness","fairness","and","transparency","purpose limitation","accuracy","and","storage limitation"],"unmatched_count":31,"match_length":45,"cut_length":76},{"key":"94","text_words":[null,["95","NUM",""],null,["without","ADP","without"],["prejudice","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["applicable","VERB",""],["union","PROPN",""],["law","NOUN",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2016/679","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["directive","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2016/680","NOUN",""],null,["considering","VERB","consider"],["the","DET",""],["intrusive","ADJ",""],["nature","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["post","ADJ",""],null,["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["the","DET",""],["use","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["post","ADJ",""],null,["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["subject","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["safeguards","NOUN","safeguard"],null,["post","ADJ","post"],null,["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],["always","ADV",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["in","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["way","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["proportionate","ADJ",""],null,["legitimate","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["strictly","ADV",""],["necessary","ADJ",""],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["thus","ADV",""],["targeted","VERB","target"],null,["in","ADP",""],["terms","NOUN","term"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["individuals","NOUN","individual"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["identified","VERB","identify"],null,["the","DET",""],["location","NOUN",""],null,["temporal","ADJ",""],["scope","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["based","VERB","base"],["on","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["closed","VERB","close"],["data","NOUN","datum"],["set","VERB",""],["of","ADP",""],["legally","ADV",""],["acquired","VERB","acquire"],["video","NOUN",""],["footage","NOUN",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["any","DET",""],["case","NOUN",""],null,["post","ADJ",""],null,["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["used","VERB","use"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["framework","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["law","NOUN",""],["enforcement","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["lead","VERB",""],["to","PART",""],["indiscriminate","VERB",""],["surveillance","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["conditions","NOUN","condition"],["for","ADP",""],["post","ADJ",""],null,["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["in","ADP",""],["any","DET",""],["case","NOUN",""],["not","PART",""],["provide","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["basis","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["circumvent","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["conditions","NOUN","condition"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["prohibition","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["strict","ADJ",""],["exceptions","NOUN","exception"],["for","ADP",""],["real","ADJ",""],["time","NOUN",""],["remote","ADJ",""],["biometric","ADJ",""],["identification","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(95) Without prejudice to applicable Union law, in particular Regulation (EU) 2016/679 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, considering the intrusive nature of post-remote biometric identification systems, the use of post-remote biometric identification systems should be subject to safeguards.Post-remote biometric identification systems should always be used in a way that is proportionate, legitimate and strictly necessary, and thus targeted, in terms of the individuals to be identified, the location, temporal scope and based on a closed data set of legally acquired video footage.In any case, post-remote biometric identification systems should not be used in the framework of law enforcement to lead to indiscriminate surveillance.The conditions for post-remote biometric identification should in any case not provide a basis to circumvent the conditions of the prohibition and strict exceptions for real time remote biometric identification.","idx":94,"match_words":["prejudice","applicable","union law","particular","regulation","2016/679","directive","2016/680","consider","the intrusive nature","post","remote biometric identification","system","the use","post","remote","biometric","identification","system","subject","safeguard","post","remote","biometric","identification","system","always","use","way","proportionate","legitimate","strictly","necessary","thus","target","term","individual","identify","the location","temporal scope","base","datum","set","legally","acquire","video","footage","any case","post","remote","biometric","identification","system","use","the framework","law enforcement","lead","surveillance","condition","post","remote","biometric","identification","any case","provide","basis","circumvent","condition","the prohibition","strict","exception","real time","remote","biometric","identification"],"words":["without","prejudice","to","applicable","union law","in","particular","regulation","eu","2016/679","and","directive","eu","2016/680","consider","the intrusive nature","of","post","remote biometric identification","system","the use","of","post","remote","biometric","identification","system","should","be","subject","to","safeguard","post","remote","biometric","identification","system","should","always","be","use","in","a","way","that","be","proportionate","legitimate","and","strictly","necessary","and","thus","target","in","term","of","the","individual","to","be","identify","the location","temporal scope","and","base","on","a","close","datum","set","of","legally","acquire","video","footage","in","any case","post","remote","biometric","identification","system","should","not","be","use","in","the framework","of","law enforcement","to","lead","to","indiscriminate","surveillance","the","condition","for","post","remote","biometric","identification","should","in","any case","not","provide","a","basis","to","circumvent","the","condition","of","the prohibition","and","strict","exception","for","real time","remote","biometric","identification"],"unmatched_count":49,"match_length":75,"cut_length":124},{"key":"95","text_words":[null,["96","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP