use"],["self","NOUN",""],null,["supervision","NOUN",""],["at","ADP",""],["scale","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["considered","VERB","consider"],["to","PART",""],["display","VERB",""],["significant","ADJ",""],["generality","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["to","PART",""],["competently","ADV",""],["perform","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["wide","ADJ",""],["range","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["distinctive","ADJ",""],["tasks","NOUN","task"],null],"text":"(98) Whereas the generality of a model could, inter alia, also be determined by a number of parameters, models with at least a billion of parameters and trained with a large amount of data using self-supervision at scale should be considered to display significant generality and to competently perform a wide range of distinctive tasks.","idx":97,"match_words":["the generality","model","inter","alia","also","determine","number","parameter","model","least","parameter","train","large","amount","datum","use","self","supervision","scale","consider","display","significant generality","competently","perform","wide","range","task"],"words":["whereas","the generality","of","a","model","could","inter","alia","also","be","determine","by","a","number","of","parameter","model","with","at","least","of","parameter","and","train","with","a","large","amount","of","datum","use","self","supervision","at","scale","should","be","consider","to","display","significant generality","and","to","competently","perform","a","wide","range","of","distinctive","task"],"unmatched_count":24,"match_length":27,"cut_length":51},{"key":"98","text_words":[null,["99","NUM",""],null,["large","ADJ","large"],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["models","NOUN","model"],["are","AUX","be"],["a","DET",""],null,["typical","ADJ",""],["example","NOUN",""],["for","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["model","NOUN",""],null,["given","VERB","give"],["that","SCONJ",""],["they","PRON",""],["allow","VERB",""],["for","ADP",""],["flexible","ADJ",""],["generation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["content","NOUN",""],null,["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["form","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["text","NOUN",""],null,["audio","ADJ",""],null,["images","NOUN","image"],["or","CCONJ",""],["video","NOUN",""],null,["that","PRON",""],["can","AUX",""],["readily","ADV",""],["accommodate","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["wide","ADJ",""],["range","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["distinctive","ADJ",""],["tasks","NOUN","task"],null],"text":"(99) Large generative AI models are a typical example for a general-purpose AI model, given that they allow for flexible generation of content, such as in the form of text, audio, images or video, that can readily accommodate a wide range of distinctive tasks.","idx":98,"match_words":["large","model","example","general","purpose","model","give","allow","flexible generation","content","such","the form","text","audio","image","video","readily","accommodate","wide","range","task"],"words":["large","generative","ai","model","be","a","typical","example","for","a","general","purpose","ai","model","give","that","they","allow","for","flexible generation","of","content","such","as","in","the form","of","text","audio","image","or","video","that","can","readily","accommodate","a","wide","range","of","distinctive","task"],"unmatched_count":21,"match_length":21,"cut_length":42},{"key":"99","text_words":[null,["100","NUM",""],null,["when","SCONJ","when"],["a","DET",""],null,["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["model","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["integrated","VERB","integrate"],["into","ADP",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["forms","NOUN","form"],["part","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["an","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["system","NOUN",""],null,["this","DET",""],["system","NOUN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["considered","VERB","consider"],["to","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["general","ADJ",""],null,["p