ource","licence","allow","share","user","freely","access","use","modify","modify","version","thereof","contribute","research","innovation","the market","provide","significant","growth","opportunity","the union economy","general","purpose","model","release","free","open","source","licence","consider","ensure","high","level","transparency","parameter","include","weight","the information","the model architecture","the information","model usage","make","publicly","available","the licence","consider","free","open","source","also","allow","user","run","copy","distribute","change","improve","software","datum","include","model","the condition","the original provider","the model","credit","term","distribution","respect"],"words":["software","and","datum","include","model","release","under","a","free","and","open","source","licence","that","allow","they","to","be","openly","share","and","where","user","can","freely","access","use","modify","and","redistribute","they","or","modify","version","thereof","can","contribute","to","research","and","innovation","in","the market","and","can","provide","significant","growth","opportunity","for","the union economy","general","purpose","ai","model","release","under","free","and","open","source","licence","should","be","consider","to","ensure","high","level","of","transparency","and","openness","if","their","parameter","include","the","weight","the information","on","the model architecture","and","the information","on","model usage","be","make","publicly","available","the licence","should","be","consider","to","be","free","and","open","source","also","when","it","allow","user","to","run","copy","distribute","study","change","and","improve","software","and","datum","include","model","under","the condition","that","the original provider","of","the model","be","credit","the","identical","or","comparable","term","of","distribution","be","respect"],"unmatched_count":60,"match_length":75,"cut_length":135},{"key":"102","text_words":[null,["103",