should not benefit from the exceptions provided to free and open-source AI components.The fact of making AI components available through open repositories should not, in itself, constitute a monetisation.","idx":102,"match_words":["free","open","source","component","cover","the software","datum","include","model","general","purpose","model","tool","service","process","an ai system","free","open","source","component","provide","different","channel","include","their development","open","purpose","regulation","component","provide","otherwise","include","the provision","technical support","other","service","include","software","platform","relate","the ai component","the use","personal","datum","reason","other","exclusively","improve","the security","the software","the exception","transaction","microenterprise","benefit","exception","provide","free","open","source","component","the fact","make","component","available","open","constitute"],"words":["free","and","open","source","ai","component","cover","the software","and","datum","include","model","and","general","purpose","ai","model","tool","service","or","process","of","an ai system","free","and","open","source","ai","component","can","be","provide","through","different","channel","include","their development","on","open","repository","for","the","purpose","of","this","regulation","ai","component","that","be","provide","against","a","price","or","otherwise","monetise","include","through","the provision","of","technical support","or","other","service","include","through","a","software","platform","relate","to","the ai component","or","the use","of","personal","datum","for","reason","other","than","exclusively","for","improve","the security","compatibility","or","interoperability","of","the software","with","the exception","of","transaction","between","microenterprise","should","not","benefit","from","the","exception","provide","to","free","and","open","source","ai","component","the fact","of","make","ai","component","av