"],["content","NOUN",""],["used","VERB","use"],["for","ADP",""],["model","NOUN",""],["training","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["obligation","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["put","VERB",""],["in","ADP",""],["place","NOUN",""],["a","DET",""],null,["policy","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["comply","VERB",""],["with","ADP",""],["union","PROPN",""],["copyright","NOUN",""],["law","NOUN",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["identify","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["comply","VERB",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["reservation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["rights","NOUN","right"],["pursuant","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["article","NOUN","article"],null,["4(3","NUM",""],null,["of","ADP",""],["directive","PROPN",""],null,["eu","PROPN",""],null,["2019/790","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["european","PROPN",""],["parliament","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["council","PROPN",""],null,null,["40","NUM",""],null,null],"text":"(104) The providers of general-purpose AI models that are released under a free and open-source licence, and whose parameters, including the weights, the information on the model architecture, and the information on model usage, are made publicly available should be subject to exceptions as regards the transparency-related requirements imposed on general-purpose AI models, unless they can be considered to present a systemic risk, in which case the circumstance that the model is transparent and accompanied by an open-source license should not be considered to be a sufficient reason to exclude compliance with the obligations under this Regulation.In any case, given that the release of general-purpose AI models under free and open-source licence does not necessarily reveal substantial information on the data set used for the training or fine-tuning of the model and on how compliance of copyright law was thereby ensured, the exception provided for general-purpose AI models from compliance with the transparency-related requirements should not concern the obligation to produce a summary about the content used for model training and the obligation to put in place a policy to comply with Union copyright law, in particular to identify and comply with the reservation of rights pursuant to Article 4(3) of Directive (EU) 2019/790 of the European Parliament and of the Council (40).","idx":103,"match_words":["provider","general","purpose","model","release","free","open","source","licence","parameter","include","weight","the information","the model architecture","the information","model usage","make","publicly","available","subject","exception","regard","transparency","relate","requirement","impose","general","purpose","model","consider","present","systemic","risk","which case","the circumstance","the model","transparent","accompany","open","source","consider","sufficient","reason","exclude","compliance","the obligation","this regulation","any case","give","the release","general","purpose","model","free","open","source","licence","necessarily","substantial information","datum","set","use","the training","fine","tuning","the model","compliance","copyright law","thereby","ensure","the exception","provide","general","purpose","model","compliance","transparency","relate","requirement","concern","the obligation","produce","summary","the content","use","model training","obligation","put","place","policy","comply","union copyright law","particular","identify","comply","the reservation","right","pursuant","article","directive","2019/790","the european parliament","the council"],"words":["the","provider","of","general","purpose","ai","model","that","be","release","under","a","free","and","open","source","licence","and","whose","parameter","include","the","weight","the information","on","the model architecture","and","the information","on","model usage","be","make","publicly","available","should","be","subject","to","exception","as","regard","the","transparency","relate","requirement","impose","on","general","purpose","ai","model","unless","they","can","be","consider","to","present","a","systemic","risk","in","which case","the circumstance","that","the model","be","transparent","and","accompany","by","an","open","source","license","should","not","be","consider","to","be","a","sufficient","reason","to","exclude","compliance","with","the obligation","under","this regulation","in","any case","give","that","the release","of","general","purpose","ai","model","under","free","and","open","source","licence","do","not","necessarily","reveal","substantial information","on","the","datum","set","use","for","the training","or","fine","tuning","of","the model","and","on","how","compliance","of","copyright law","be","thereby","ensure","the exception","provide","for","general","purpose","ai","model","from","compliance","with","the","transparency","relate","requirement","should","not","concern","the obligation","to","produce","a","summary","about","the content","use","for","model training","and","the","obligation","to","put","in","place","a","policy","to","comply","with","union copyright law","in","particular","to","identify","and","comply","with","the reservation","of","right","pursuant","to","article","of","directive","eu","2019/790","of","the european parliament","and","of","the council"],"unmatched_count":92,"match_length":103,"cut_length":195},{"key":"104","text_words":[null,["105","NUM",""],null,["general","ADJ","general"],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["models","NOUN","model"],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["large","ADJ",""],["generative","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["models","NOUN","model"],null,["capable","ADJ",""],["of","ADP",""],["generating","NOUN",""],["text","NOUN",""],null,["images","NOUN","image"],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["other","ADJ",""],["content","NOUN",""],null,["present","ADJ",""],["unique","ADJ",""],["innovation","NOUN",""],["opportunities","NOUN","opportunity"],["but","CCONJ",""]