regard to the obligations imposed on providers of general-purpose AI models to put in place a policy to comply with Union copyright law and make publicly available a summary of the content used for the training, the AI Office should monitor whether the provider has fulfilled those obligations without verifying or proceeding to a work-by-work assessment of the training data in terms of copyright compliance.This Regulation does not affect the enforcement of copyright rules as provided for under Union law.","idx":107,"match_words":["regard","obligation","impose","provider","general","purpose","model","put","place","policy","comply","union copyright law","make","publicly","available","summary","the content","use","the training","the ai office","monitor","the provider","have","fulfil","obligation","verify","work","work","assessment","training","datum","term","copyright compliance","this regulation","affect","the enforcement","copyright","rule","provide","union law"],"words":["with","regard","to","the","obligation","impose","on","provider","of","general","purpose","ai","model","to","put","in","place","a","policy","to","comply","with","union copyright law","and","make","publicly","available","a","summary","of","the content","use","for","the training","the ai office","should","monitor","whether","the provider","have","fulfil","those","obligation","without","verify","or","proceed","to","a","work","by","work","assessment","of","the","training","datum","in","term","of","copyright compliance","this regulation","do","not","affect","the enforcement","of","copyright","rule","as","provide","for","under","union law"],"unmatched_count":34,"match_length":40,"cut_length":74},{"key":"108","text_words":[null,["109","NUM",""],null,["compliance","NOUN","compliance"],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["obligations","NOUN","obligation"],["applicable","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["of","ADP",""],["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["a