e case of a modification or fine-tuning of a model, the obligations for providers of general-purpose AI models should be limited to that modification or fine-tuning, for example by complementing the already existing technical documentation with information on the modifications, including new training data sources, as a means to comply with the value chain obligations provided in this Regulation.","idx":108,"match_words":["compliance","obligation","applicable","the provider","general","purpose","model","proportionate","the type","model provider","exclude","the need","compliance","person","develop","use","model","non","professional","scientific","research","purpose","nevertheless","encourage","comply","requirement","prejudice","union copyright law","compliance","obligation","take","due account","the size","provider","allow","simplified","way","compliance","sme","include","start","represent","an excessive cost","the use","such","model","the case","modification","fine","tuning","model","obligation","provider","general","purpose","model","limit","that modification","fine","tuning","example","complement","already","exist","technical","documentation","information","modification","include","new","training","datum","source","mean","comply","value","chain","obligation","provide","this regulation"],"words":["compliance","with","the","obligation","applicable","to","the provider","of","general","purpose","ai","model","should","be","commensurate","and","proportionate","to","the type","of","model provider","exclude","the need","for","compliance","for","person","who","develop","or","use","model","for","non","professional","or","scientific","research","purpose","who","should","nevertheless","be","encourage","to","voluntarily","comply","with","these","requirement","without","prejudice","to","union copyright law","compliance","with","those","obligation","should","take","due account","of","the size","of","the","provider","and","allow","simplified","way","of","compliance","for","sme","i