,"condition","of","misuse","model reliability","model fairness","and","model security","the","level","of","autonomy","of","the model","its","access","to","tool","novel","or","combined","modality","release","and","distribution","strategy","the","potential","to","remove","guardrail","and","other","factor","in","particular","international","approach","have","so","far","identify","the need","to","pay","attention","to","risk","from","potential intentional misuse","or","unintended","issue","of","control","relate","to","alignment","with","human intent","chemical","biological","radiological","and","nuclear","risk","such","as","the","way","in","which","barrier","to","entry","can","be","lower","include","for","weapon","development","design acquisition","or","use","offensive","cyber","capability","such","as","the","way","in","vulnerability discovery","exploitation","or","operational use","can","be","enable","the","effect","of","interaction","and","tool use","include","for","example","the capacity","to","control","physical","system","and","interfere","with","critical infrastructure","risk","from","model","of","make","copy","of","themselves","or","self","replicate","or","train","other","model","the","way","in","which","model","can","give","rise","to","harmful bias","and","discrimination","with","risk","to","individual","community","or","society","the facilitation","of","disinformation","or","harm","privacy","with","threat","to","democratic","value","and","human","right","risk","that","a","particular","event","could","lead","to","a","chain","reaction","with","considerable","negative","effect","that","could","affect","up","to","an entire city","an entire domain activity","or","an entire community"],"unmatched_count":121,"match_length":146,"cut_length":267},{"key":"110","text_words":[null,["111","NUM",""],null,["it","PRON","it"],["is","AUX","be"],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["establish","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["methodology","NOUN",""],["for","ADP",""],["the","