l,["including","VERB","include"],["through","ADP",""],["disinformation","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(120) Furthermore, obligations placed on providers and deployers of certain AI systems in this Regulation to enable the detection and disclosure that the outputs of those systems are artificially generated or manipulated are particularly relevant to facilitate the effective implementation of Regulation (EU) 2022/2065.This applies in particular as regards the obligations of providers of very large online platforms or very large online search engines to identify and mitigate systemic risks that may arise from the dissemination of content that has been artificially generated or manipulated, in particular risk of the actual or foreseeable negative effects on democratic processes, civic discourse and electoral processes, including through disinformation.","idx":119,"match_words":["furthermore","obligation","place","provider","deployer","certain","system","this regulation","enable","the detection","disclosure","output","system","artificially","generate","manipulate","particularly","relevant","facilitate","the effective implementation","regulation","apply","particular","regard","obligation","provider","very","large","online","platform","very","large","online","search","engine","identify","mitigate","systemic","risk","may","arise","the dissemination","content","have","artificially","generate","manipulate","particular risk","actual","foreseeable","negative","effect","democratic","process","civic discourse","process","include","disinformation"],"words":["furthermore","obligation","place","on","provider","and","deployer","of","certain","ai","system","in","this regulation","to","enable","the detection","and","disclosure","that","the","output","of","those","system","be","artificially","generate","or","manipulate","be","particularly","relevant","to","facilitate","the effective implementation","of","regulation","eu","this","apply","in","particular","as","regard","the","obligation","of"