""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["requirement","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["in","ADP",""],["so","ADV",""],["far","ADV",""],["as","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["certificate","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["statement","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["conformity","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["parts","NOUN","part"],["thereof","ADV",""],["cover","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["requirement","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["this","PRON","this"],["remains","VERB","remain"],["without","ADP",""],["prejudice","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["voluntary","ADJ",""],["nature","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["that","DET",""],["cybersecurity","NOUN",""],["scheme","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(122) It is appropriate that, without prejudice to the use of harmonised standards and common specifications, providers of a high-risk AI system that has been trained and tested on data reflecting the specific geographical, behavioural, contextual or functional setting within which the AI system is intended to be used, should be presumed to comply with the relevant measure provided for under the requirement on data governance set out in this Regulation.Without prejudice to the requirements related to robustness and accuracy set out in this Regulation, in accordance with Article 54(3) of Regulation (EU) 2019/881, high-risk AI systems that have been certified or for which a statement of conformity has been issued under a cybersecurity scheme pursuant to that Regulation and the references of which have been published in the Official Journal of the European Union should be presumed to comply with the cybersecurity requirement of this Regulation in so far as the cybersecurity certificate or statement of conformity or parts thereof cover the cybersecurity requirement of this Regulation.This remains without prejudice to the voluntary nature of that cybersecurity scheme.","idx":121,"match_words":["appropriate","prejudice","the use","harmonised","standard","common","specification","provider","high","risk","system","have","train","test","datum","reflect","specific","geographical","behavioural","contextual","functional","setting","the ai system","intend","use","presume","comply","the relevant measure","provide","the requirement","data governance","set","out","this regulation","prejudice","requirement","relate","robustness","accuracy","set","out","this regulation","accordance","article","regulation","high","risk","system","have","certify","statement","conformity","have","issue","cybersecurity","scheme","pursuant","that regulation","reference","have","publish","official","journal","the european union","presume","comply","the cybersecurity requirement","this regulation","far","the cybersecurity certificate","statement","conformity","part","thereof","cover","the cybersecurity requirement","this regulation","remain","prejudice","the voluntary nature","that cybersecurity scheme"],"words":["it","be","appropriate","that","without","prejudice","to","the use","of","harmonised","standard","and","common","specification","provider","of","a","high","risk","ai","system","that","have","be","train","and","test","on","datum","reflect","the","specific","geographical","behavioural","contextual","or","functional","setting","within","which","the ai system","be","intend","to","be","use","should","be","presume","to","comply","with","the relevant measure","provide","for","under","the requirement","on","data governance","set","out","in","this regulation","without","prejudice","to","the","requirement","relate","to","robustness","and","accuracy","set","out","in","this regulation","in","accordance","with","article","of","regulation","eu","high","risk","ai","system","that","have","be","certify","or","for","which","a","statement","of","conformity","have","be","issue","under","a","cybersecurity","scheme","pursuant","to","that regulation","and","the","reference","of","which","have","be","publish","in","the","official","journal","of","the european union","should","be","presume","to","comply","with","the cybersecurity requirement","of","this regulation","in","so","far","as","the cybersecurity certificate","or","statement","of","conformity","or","part","thereof","cover","the cybersecurity requirement","of","this regulation","this","remain","without","prejudice","to","the voluntary nature","of","that cybersecurity scheme"],"unmatched_count":75,"match_length":81,"cut_length":156},{"key":"122","text_words":[null,["123","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["a","DET",""],null,["high","ADJ",""],["level","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["trustworthiness","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],null,["those","DET",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["subject","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["conformity","NOUN",""],["assessment","NOUN",""],["prior","ADV",""],["to","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["placing","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["market","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["putting","VERB","put"],["into","ADP",""],["service","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(123) In order to ensure a high level of trustworthiness of high-risk AI systems, those systems should be subject to a conformity assessment prior to their placing on the market or putting into service.","idx":122,"match_words":["order","ensure","high","level","high","risk","system","system","subject","conformity","assessment","prior","their placing","the market","put","service"],"words":["in","order","to","ensure","a","high","level","of","trustworthiness","of","high","risk","ai","system","those","system","should","be","subject","to","a","conformity","assessment","prior","to","their placing","on","the market","or","put","into","service"],"unmatched_count":16,"match_le