third-party conformity assessments when so required, notified bodies should be notified under this Regulation by the national competent authorities, provided that they comply with a set of requirements, in particular on independence, competence, absence of conflicts of interests and suitable cybersecurity requirements.Notification of those bodies should be sent by national competent authorities to the Commission and the other Member States by means of the electronic notification tool developed and managed by the Commission pursuant to Article R23 of Annex I to Decision No 768/2008/EC.","idx":125,"match_words":["order","carry","out","third","party","conformity","assessment","require","notify","body","notify","this regulation","national","competent","authority","provide","comply","set","requirement","particular","independence","competence","conflict","interest","suitable","cybersecurity","requirement","notification","body","send","national","competent","authority","the commission","the other member states","mean","the electronic notification tool","develop","manage","the commission","pursuant","article r23","annex","decision"],"words":["in","order","to","carry","out","third","party","conformity","assessment","when","so","require","notify","body","should","be","notify","under","this regulation","by","the","national","competent","authority","provide","that","they","comply","with","a","set","of","requirement","in","particular","on","independence","competence","absence","of","conflict","of","interest","and","suitable","cybersecurity","requirement","notification","of","those","body","should","be","send","by","national","competent","authority","to","the commission","and","the other member states","by","mean","of","the electronic notification tool","develop","and","manage","by","the commission","pursuant","to","article r23","of","annex","i","to","decision","no","ec"],"unmatched_count":37,"match_length":44,"cut_length":81},{"key":"126","text_words":[null,["127","NUM",""],null