["the","DET",""],["placing","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["market","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["putting","NOUN",""],["into","ADP",""],["service","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["that","PRON",""],["comply","VERB",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["requirements","NOUN","requirement"],["laid","VERB","lay"],["down","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["bear","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["ce","PROPN",""],["marking","VERB","mark"],null],"text":"(129) High-risk AI systems should bear the CE marking to indicate their conformity with this Regulation so that they can move freely within the internal market.For high-risk AI systems embedded in a product, a physical CE marking should be affixed, and may be complemented by a digital CE marking.For high-risk AI systems only provided digitally, a digital CE marking should be used.Member States should not create unjustified obstacles to the placing on the market or the putting into service of high-risk AI systems that comply with the requirements laid down in this Regulation and bear the CE marking.","idx":128,"match_words":["high","risk","system","bear","the ce","mark","indicate","their conformity","this regulation","freely","the internal market","high","risk","system","embed","product","physical","mark","affix","may","complement","digital","mark","high","risk","system","only","provide","digital","mark","use","member states","create","unjustified","the placing","the market","the putting","service","high","risk","system","comply","requirement","lay","down","this regulation","bear","mark"],"words":["high","risk","ai","system","should","bear","the ce","mark","to","indicate","their conformity","with","this regulation","so","that","they","can","move","freely","within","the internal market","for","high","risk","ai","system","embed","in","a","product","a","physical