et surveillance authorities could authorise the placing on the market or the putting into service of AI systems which have not undergone a conformity assessment.In duly justified situations, as provided for in this Regulation, law enforcement authorities or civil protection authorities may put a specific high-risk AI system into service without the authorisation of the market surveillance authority, provided that such authorisation is requested during or after the use without undue delay.","idx":129,"match_words":["certain","condition","rapid availability","innovative","technology","may","health","safety","person","protection","the environment","climate","change","society","whole","thus","appropriate","exceptional","reason","public security","protection","life","health","natural","person","environmental","protection","protection","key","industrial","asset","market","surveillance","authority","authorise","the placing","the market","the putting","service","system","have","undergo","conformity","assessment","duly","justify","situation","provide","this regulation","law","enforcement","authority","civil","protection","authority","may","put","specific","high","risk","system","service","the authorisation","the market surveillance authority","provide","such authorisation","request","the use","undue delay"],"words":["under","certain","condition","rapid availability","of","innovative","technology","may","be","crucial","for","health","and","safety","of","person","the","protection","of","the environment","and","climate","change","and","for","society","as","a","whole","it","be","thus","appropriate","that","under","exceptional","reason","of","public security","or","protection","of","life","and","health","of","natural","person","environmental","protection","and","the","protection","of","key","industrial","and","infrastructural","asset","market","surveillance","authority","could","authorise","the placing","on","the market","or","the putting","into","service","of","ai","system","whi