","small","scale","member states","should","possibly","ensure","that","of","the","language","determine","and","accept","by","they","for","relevant","provider","’","documentation","and","for","communication","with","operator","be","which","be","broadly","understand","by","the","large","possible","number","of","cross","border","deployer","in","order","to","address","the","specific","need","of","sme","include","start","up","the commission","should","provide","standardised","template","for","the","area","cover","by","this regulation","upon","request","of","the board","additionally","the commission","should","complement","member","states","’","effort","by","provide","a","single","information","platform","with","easy","to","use","information","with","regard","to","this regulation","for","all","provider","and","deployer","by","organise","appropriate","communication","campaign","to","raise","awareness","about","the","obligation","arise","from","this regulation","and","by","evaluate","and","promote","the convergence","of","good","practice","in","public","procurement","procedure","in","relation","to","ai","system","medium","sized","enterprise","which","until","recently","qualified","as","small","enterprise","within","the meaning","of","the annex","to","commission","recommendation","2003/361","ec","should","have","access","to","those","support","measure","as","those","new","medium","sized","enterprise","may","sometimes","lack","the","legal","resource","and","training","necessary","to","ensure","proper understanding","of","and","compliance","with","this regulation"],"unmatched_count":187,"match_length":247,"cut_length":434},{"key":"143","text_words":[null,["144","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["promote","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["protect","VERB",""],["innovation","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],null,["on","ADP",""],null,["demand","NOUN",""],["platform","NOUN",""],null,["all","DET",""],["relevant","ADJ",""],["union",