,""],["surveillance","NOUN",""],["authority","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["act","VERB",""],["as","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["single","ADJ",""],["point","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["contact","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(153) Member States hold a key role in the application and enforcement of this Regulation.In that respect, each Member State should designate at least one notifying authority and at least one market surveillance authority as national competent authorities for the purpose of supervising the application and implementation of this Regulation.Member States may decide to appoint any kind of public entity to perform the tasks of the national competent authorities within the meaning of this Regulation, in accordance with their specific national organisational characteristics and needs.In order to increase organisation efficiency on the side of Member States and to set a single point of contact vis-à-vis the public and other counterparts at Member State and Union levels, each Member State should designate a market surveillance authority to act as a single point of contact.","idx":152,"match_words":["member states","hold","key","role","the application","enforcement","this regulation","that respect","each member state","designate","least","notifying","authority","least","market","surveillance","authority","national","competent","authority","the purpose","supervise","the application","implementation","this regulation","member states","may","decide","appoint","any kind","public entity","perform","task","national","competent","authority","the meaning","this regulation","accordance","specific","national","organisational","characteristic","need","order","increase","organisation efficiency","the side","member states","set","single","point","contact","public","other","member","state","union","level","each member state","designate","market","surveillance","authority","act","single","point","contact"],"words":["member states","hold","a","key","role","in","the applicatio