DET",""],["authorities","NOUN","authority"],["should","AUX",""],["refrain","VERB",""],["from","ADP",""],["any","DET",""],["action","NOUN",""],["incompatible","ADJ",""],["with","ADP",""],["their","PRON",""],["duties","NOUN","duty"],["and","CCONJ",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["subject","ADJ",""],["to","ADP",""],["confidentiality","NOUN",""],["rules","NOUN","rule"],["under","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null],"text":"(154) The national competent authorities should exercise their powers independently, impartially and without bias, so as to safeguard the principles of objectivity of their activities and tasks and to ensure the application and implementation of this Regulation.The members of these authorities should refrain from any action incompatible with their duties and should be subject to confidentiality rules under this Regulation.","idx":153,"match_words":["national","competent","authority","exercise","power","independently","impartially","bias","safeguard","principle","objectivity","activity","task","ensure","the application","implementation","this regulation","member","authority","any action","duty","subject","confidentiality","rule","this regulation"],"words":["the","national","competent","authority","should","exercise","their","power","independently","impartially","and","without","bias","so","as","to","safeguard","the","principle","of","objectivity","of","their","activity","and","task","and","to","ensure","the application","and","implementation","of","this regulation","the","member","of","these","authority","should","refrain","from","any action","incompatible","with","their","duty","and","should","be","subject","to","confidentiality","rule","under","this regulation"],"unmatched_count":31,"match_length":25,"cut_length":56},{"key":"154","text_words":[null,["155","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["of","ADP",""],["high",