 to specific categories of high-risk AI systems that are found to present a serious risk across two or more Member States.Joint activities to promote compliance should be carried out in accordance with Article 9 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.The AI Office should provide coordination support for joint investigations.","idx":159,"match_words":["market","surveillance","authority","the commission","able","propose","joint","activity","include","joint","investigation","conduct","market","surveillance","authority","market","surveillance","authority","jointly","the commission","have","the aim","promote","compliance","identify","non","compliance","raise","awareness","provide","guidance","relation","this regulation","respect","specific","category","high","risk","system","find","present","serious","risk","more","member","states","joint","activity","promote","compliance","carry","out","accordance","article","regulation","the ai office","provide","coordination support","joint","investigation"],"words":["the","market","surveillance","authority","and","the commission","should","be","able","to","propose","joint","activity","include","joint","investigation","to","be","conduct","by","market","surveillance","authority","or","market","surveillance","authority","jointly","with","the commission","that","have","the aim","of","promote","compliance","identify","non","compliance","raise","awareness","and","provide","guidance","in","relation","to","this regulation","with","respect","to","specific","category","of","high","risk","ai","system","that","be","find","to","present","a","serious","risk","across","or","more","member","states","joint","activity","to","promote","compliance","should","be","carry","out","in","accordance","with","article","of","regulation","eu","the ai office","should","provide","coordination support","for","joint","investigation"],"unmatched_count":34,"match_length":60,"cut_length":94},{"key":"160","text_words":[null,["161","NUM",""],null,["it","PRON","it"],["is","AUX","be"