ortant that AI systems related to products that are not high-risk in accordance with this Regulation and thus are not required to comply with the requirements set out for high-risk AI systems are nevertheless safe when placed on the market or put into service.To contribute to this objective, Regulation (EU) 2023/988 of the European Parliament and of the Council (53) would apply as a safety net.","idx":165,"match_words":["important","system","relate","product","high","risk","accordance","this regulation","thus","require","comply","requirement","set","out","high","risk","system","nevertheless","safe","place","the market","put","service","contribute","this objective","regulation","the european parliament","the council","apply","safety"],"words":["it","be","important","that","ai","system","relate","to","product","that","be","not","high","risk","in","accordance","with","this regulation","and","thus","be","not","require","to","comply","with","the","requirement","set","out","for","high","risk","ai","system","be","nevertheless","safe","when","place","on","the market","or","put","into","service","to","contribute","to","this objective","regulation","eu","of","the european parliament","and","of","the council","would","apply","as","a","safety","net"],"unmatched_count":33,"match_length":30,"cut_length":63},{"key":"166","text_words":[null,["167","NUM",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["trustful","ADJ",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["constructive","ADJ",""],["cooperation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["competent","ADJ",""],["authorities","NOUN","authority"],["on","ADP",""],["union","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["national","ADJ",""],["level","NOUN",""],null,["all","DET",""],["parties","NOUN","party"],["involved","VERB","involve"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["application","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["respect","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["confidentiality","NOUN",""],["o