ts, the effective implementation of this Regulation, public and national security interests, the integrity of criminal and administrative proceedings, and the integrity of classified information.","idx":166,"match_words":["order","ensure","trustful and constructive cooperation","competent","authority","union","national level","all","party","involve","the application","this regulation","respect","the confidentiality","information","datum","obtain","carry","out","task","accordance","union","national law","carry","out","task","activity","such","manner","protect","particular","intellectual","property","right","confidential","business","information","trade","secret","the effective implementation","this regulation","public","national","security","interest","the integrity","criminal","administrative","proceeding","the integrity","classified information"],"words":["in","order","to","ensure","trustful and constructive cooperation","of","competent","authority","on","union","and","national level","all","party","involve","in","the application","of","this regulation","should","respect","the confidentiality","of","information","and","datum","obtain","in","carry","out","their","task","in","accordance","with","union","or","national law","they","should","carry","out","their","task","and","activity","in","such","a","manner","as","to","protect","in","particular","intellectual","property","right","confidential","business","information","and","trade","secret","the effective implementation","of","this regulation","public","and","national","security","interest","the integrity","of","criminal","and","administrative","proceeding","and","the integrity","of","classified information"],"unmatched_count":31,"match_length":51,"cut_length":82},{"key":"167","text_words":[null,["168","NUM",""],null,["compliance","NOUN","compliance"],["with","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["should","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["enforceable","ADJ",""],["by","ADP",""],["means","NOUN","mean"],["of",