r infringement of this Regulation, the upper limits for setting the administrative fines for certain specific infringements should be laid down.When assessing the amount of the fines, Member States should, in each individual case, take into account all relevant circumstances of the specific situation, with due regard in particular to the nature, gravity and duration of the infringement and of its consequences and to the size of the provider, in particular if the provider is an SME, including a start-up.The European Data Protection Supervisor should have the power to impose fines on Union institutions, agencies and bodies falling within the scope of this Regulation.","idx":167,"match_words":["compliance","this regulation","enforceable","mean","the imposition","penalty","other","enforcement","measure","member states","take","all","necessary","measure","ensure","provision","this regulation","implement","include","lay","down","effective","proportionate","dissuasive","penalty","their infringement","respect","principle","order","strengthen","harmonise","administrative","penalty","infringement","this regulation","limit","set","administrative","fine","certain","specific","infringement","lay","down","assess","the amount","fine","member states","each individual case","take","account","all","relevant","circumstance","the specific situation","due regard","particular","the nature","gravity","duration","the infringement","consequence","the size","the provider","particular","the provider","an sme","include","start","the european data protection supervisor","have","the power","impose","fine","union","institution","agency","body","fall","the scope","this regulation"],"words":["compliance","with","this regulation","should","be","enforceable","by","mean","of","the imposition","of","penalty","and","other","enforcement","measure","member states","should","take","all","necessary","measure","to","ensure","that","the","provision","of","this regulation","be","implement","include","by","lay"