ation, subject to appropriate limitation periods in accordance with the principle of proportionality.All decisions taken by the Commission under this Regulation are subject to review by the Court of Justice of the European Union in accordance with the TFEU, including the unlimited jurisdiction of the Court of Justice with regard to penalties pursuant to Article 261 TFEU.","idx":168,"match_words":["compliance","obligation","provider","general","purpose","model","impose","this regulation","enforceable","inter","alia","mean","fine","that end","appropriate","level","fine","also","lay","down","infringement","obligation","include","the failure","comply","measure","request","the commission","accordance","this regulation","subject","appropriate","limitation","period","accordance","the principle","proportionality","all","decision","take","the commission","this regulation","subject","review","the court","justice","the european union","accordance","the tfeu","include","the unlimited jurisdiction","the court","justice","regard","penalty","pursuant","article","tfeu"],"words":["compliance","with","the","obligation","on","provider","of","general","purpose","ai","model","impose","under","this regulation","should","be","enforceable","inter","alia","by","mean","of","fine","to","that end","appropriate","level","of","fine","should","also","be","lay","down","for","infringement","of","those","obligation","include","the failure","to","comply","with","measure","request","by","the commission","in","accordance","with","this regulation","subject","to","appropriate","limitation","period","in","accordance","with","the principle","of","proportionality","all","decision","take","by","the commission","under","this regulation","be","subject","to","review","by","the court","of","justice","of","the european union","in","accordance","with","the tfeu","include","the unlimited jurisdiction","of","the court","of","justice","with","regard","to","penalty","pursuant","to","article","tfeu"],"unmatched_count":