gful and should provide a basis on which the affected persons are able to exercise their rights.The right to obtain an explanation should not apply to the use of AI systems for which exceptions or restrictions follow from Union or national law and should apply only to the extent this right is not already provided for under Union law.","idx":170,"match_words":["affect","person","have","the right","obtain","an explanation","deployer","decision","base","the output","certain","high","risk","system","fall","the scope","this regulation","that decision","produce","legal","effect","similarly","significantly","affect","person","way","consider","have","an adverse impact","their health","safety","fundamental","right","that explanation","clear","meaningful","provide","basis","affected","person","able","exercise","right","the right","obtain","an explanation","apply","the use","system","exception","restriction","follow","union","national law","apply","only","the extent","this right","already","provide","union law"],"words":["affect","person","should","have","the right","to","obtain","an explanation","where","a","deployer","decision","be","base","mainly","upon","the output","from","certain","high","risk","ai","system","that","fall","within","the scope","of","this regulation","and","where","that decision","produce","legal","effect","or","similarly","significantly","affect","those","person","in","a","way","that","they","consider","to","have","an adverse impact","on","their health","safety","or","fundamental","right","that explanation","should","be","clear","and","meaningful","and","should","provide","a","basis","on","which","the","affected","person","be","able","to","exercise","their","right","the right","to","obtain","an explanation","should","not","apply","to","the use","of","ai","system","for","which","exception","or","restriction","follow","from","union","or","national law","and","should","apply","only","to","the extent","this right","be","not","already","provide","for","under",