rliament and of the Council (56).","idx":174,"match_words":["order","ensure","uniform","condition","the implementation","this regulation","implement","power","confer","the commission","power","exercise","accordance","regulation","the european parliament","the council"],"words":["in","order","to","ensure","uniform","condition","for","the implementation","of","this regulation","implement","power","should","be","confer","on","the commission","those","power","should","be","exercise","in","accordance","with","regulation","eu","no","of","the european parliament","and","of","the council"],"unmatched_count":17,"match_length":16,"cut_length":33},{"key":"175","text_words":[null,["176","NUM",""],null,["since","SCONJ","since"],["the","DET",""],["objective","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["namely","ADV",""],["to","PART",""],["improve","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["functioning","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["internal","ADJ",""],["market","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["to","PART",""],["promote","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["uptake","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["human","ADJ",""],["centric","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["trustworthy","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],null,["while","SCONJ",""],["ensuring","VERB","ensure"],["a","DET",""],null,["high","ADJ",""],["level","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["protection","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["health","NOUN",""],null,["safety","NOUN",""],null,["fundamental","ADJ",""],["rights","NOUN","right"],["enshrined","VERB","enshrine"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["charter","PROPN",""],null,["including","VERB","include"],["democracy","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["rule","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["law","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["environmental","ADJ",""],["protection","NOUN",""],["against","ADP",""],["harmful","ADJ",""],["effects","NOUN","effect"],["of","ADP",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["supporting","VERB","support"],["innovation","NOUN",""],null,["can","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["sufficiently","ADV",""],["achieved","VERB","achieve"],["by","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["member","PROPN",""],["states","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["can","AUX",""],["rather","ADV",""],null,["by","ADP",""],["reason","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["scale","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["effects","NOUN","effect"],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["action","NOUN",""],null,["be","AUX",""],["better","ADV","well"],["achieved","VERB","achieve"],["at","ADP",""],["union","PROPN",""],["level","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["may","AUX",""],["adopt","VERB",""],["measures","NOUN","measure"],["in","ADP",""],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["principle","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["subsidiarity","NOUN",""],["as","SCONJ",""],["set","VERB",""],["out","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["article","PROPN",""],null,["5","NUM",""],["teu","PROPN",""],null,["in","ADP","in"],["accordance","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["principle","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["proportionality","NOUN",""],["as","SCONJ",""],["set","VERB",""],["out","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["that","DET",""],["article","NOUN","article"],null,["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],["does","AUX","do"],["not","PART",""],["go","VERB",""],["beyond","ADP",""],["what","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["necessary","ADJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["order","NOUN",""],["to","PART",""],["achieve","VERB",""],["that","DET",""],["objective","NOUN",""],null],"text":"(176) Since the objective of this Regulation, namely to improve the functioning of the internal market and to promote the uptake of human centric and trustworthy AI, while ensuring a high level of protection of health, safety, fundamental rights enshrined in the Charter, including democracy, the rule of law and environmental protection against harmful effects of AI systems in the Union and supporting innovation, cannot be sufficiently achieved by the Member States and can rather, by reason of the scale or effects of the action, be better achieved at Union level, the Union may adopt measures in accordance with the principle of subsidiarity as set out in Article 5 TEU.In accordance with the principle of proportionality as set out in that Article, this Regulation does not go beyond what is necessary in order to achieve that objective.","idx":175,"match_words":["the objective","this regulation","namely","improve","the functioning","the internal market","promote","the uptake","human centric","trustworthy ai","ensure","high","level","protection","health","safety","fundamental","right","enshrine","the charter","include","democracy","the rule","law and environmental protection","harmful","effect","system","the union","support","innovation","sufficiently","achieve","the member states","reason","the scale","effect","the action","well","achieve","union level","the union","may","adopt","measure","accordance","the principle","set","out","article","teu","accordance","the principle","proportionality","set","out","that article","this regulation","necessary","order","achieve","that objective"],"words":["since","the objective","of","this regulation","namely","to","improve","the functioning","of","the internal market","and","to","promote","the uptake","of","human centric","and","trustworthy ai","while","ensure","a","high","level","of","protection","of","health","safety","fundamental","right","enshrine","in","the charter","include","democracy","the rule","of","law and environmental protection","against","harmful","effect","of","ai","system","in","the union","and","support","innovation","can","not","be","sufficiently","achieve","by","the member states","and","can","rather","by","reason","of","the scale","or","effect","of","the action","be","well","achieve","at","union level","the union","may","adopt","measure","in","accordance","with","the principle","of","subsidiarity","as","set","out