cation systems in publicly accessible spaces for law enforcement purposes pursuant to paragraph 4 shall submit to the Commission annual reports on such use.For that purpose, the Commission shall provide Member States and national market surveillance and data protection authorities with a template, including information on the number of the decisions taken by competent judicial authorities or an independent administrative authority whose decision is binding upon requests for authorisations in accordance with paragraph 3 and their result.","idx":274,"match_words":["national market surveillance","authority","national","data","protection","authority","member states","have","notify","the use","real","time","remote","biometric","identification","system","publicly","accessible","space","law","enforcement","purpose","pursuant","paragraph","submit","the commission","annual","report","such use","that purpose","commission","provide","member states","national","market","surveillance","datum","protection","authority","template","include","information","the number","decision","take","competent","judicial","authority","an independent administrative authority","whose decision","bind","request","authorisation","accordance","paragraph","their result"],"words":["national market surveillance","authority","and","the","national","data","protection","authority","of","member states","that","have","be","notify","of","the use","of","real","time","remote","biometric","identification","system","in","publicly","accessible","space","for","law","enforcement","purpose","pursuant","to","paragraph","shall","submit","to","the commission","annual","report","on","such use","for","that purpose","the","commission","shall","provide","member states","and","national","market","surveillance","and","datum","protection","authority","with","a","template","include","information","on","the number","of","the","decision","take","by","competent","judicial","authority","or","an independent administrative authority","