gislation listed in Section A of Annex I.","idx":293,"match_words":["product","contain","an ai system","requirement","this regulation","well","requirement","the union harmonisation legislation","list","section a","annex","apply","provider","responsible","ensure","their product","fully","compliant","all","applicable","requirement","applicable union harmonisation legislation","ensure","the compliance","high","risk","system","refer","paragraph","requirement","set","out","this section","order","ensure","consistency","avoid","duplication","minimise","additional","burden","provider","have","choice","appropriate","necessary","testing","reporting","process","information","documentation","provide","regard","their product","documentation","procedure","already","exist","require","the union harmonisation legislation","list","section a","annex"],"words":["where","a","product","contain","an ai system","to","which","the","requirement","of","this regulation","as","well","as","requirement","of","the union harmonisation legislation","list","in","section a","of","annex","i","apply","provider","shall","be","responsible","for","ensure","that","their product","be","fully","compliant","with","all","applicable","requirement","under","applicable union harmonisation legislation","in","ensure","the compliance","of","high","risk","ai","system","refer","to","in","paragraph","with","the","requirement","set","out","in","this section","and","in","order","to","ensure","consistency","avoid","duplication","and","minimise","additional","burden","provider","shall","have","a","choice","of","integrating","as","appropriate","the","necessary","testing","and","reporting","process","information","and","documentation","they","provide","with","regard","to","their product","into","documentation","and","procedure","that","already","exist","and","be","require","under","the union harmonisation legislation","list","in","section a","of","annex","i."],"unmatched_count":51,"match_length":63,"cut_length":114},{"key":"2