tect, prevent and mitigate possible biases identified according to point (f); the identification of relevant data gaps or shortcomings that prevent compliance with this Regulation, and how those gaps and shortcomings can be addressed.","idx":308,"match_words":["training","validation","testing","data","set","subject","data governance","management","practice","appropriate","intend","purpose","high","risk","system","practice","concern","particular","relevant","design","choice","datum","collection","process","the origin","datum","the case","personal","datum","the original purpose","datum","collection","relevant","data","preparation","processing","operation","such","labelling","assumption","particular","respect","the information","datum","measure","represent","an assessment","the availability","datum","set","need","examination","view","possible","bias","likely","affect","the health","safety","person","have","negative","impact","fundamental","right","lead","discrimination","prohibit","union law","especially","datum","output","influence","input","future","operation","appropriate","measure","detect","prevent","mitigate","possible","bias","identify","accord","point","identification","relevant","datum","shortcoming","prevent","compliance","this regulation","shortcoming","address"],"words":["training","validation","and","testing","data","set","shall","be","subject","to","data governance","and","management","practice","appropriate","for","the","intend","purpose","of","the","high","risk","ai","system","those","practice","shall","concern","in","particular","the","relevant","design","choice","datum","collection","process","and","the origin","of","datum","and","in","the case","of","personal","datum","the original purpose","of","the","datum","collection","relevant","data","preparation","processing","operation","such","as","annotation","labelling","cleaning","updating","enrichment","and","aggregation","the","formulation","of","assumption","in","particular","with","respect","to","the 