ch; the identification of the natural persons involved in the verification of the results, as referred to in Article 14(5).","idx":320,"match_words":["high","risk","system","refer","point","annex","iii","log","capability","provide","minimum","recording","the period","each use","the system","start","date","time and end date","time","each use","the reference database","input","datum","have","check","the system","input","datum","the search","have","lead","match","the identification","natural","person","involve","the verification","result","refer","article"],"words":["for","high","risk","ai","system","refer","to","in","point","a","of","annex","iii","the","log","capability","shall","provide","at","a","minimum","recording","of","the period","of","each use","of","the system","start","date","and","time and end date","and","time","of","each use","the reference database","against","which","input","datum","have","be","check","by","the system","the","input","datum","for","which","the search","have","lead","to","a","match","the identification","of","the","natural","person","involve","in","the verification","of","the","result","as","refer","to","in","article","14(5"],"unmatched_count":34,"match_length":40,"cut_length":74},{"key":"324","text_words":[["transparency","NOUN","transparency"],["and","CCONJ",""],["provision","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["information","NOUN",""],["to","ADP",""],["deployers","NOUN","deployer"]],"text":"Transparency and provision of information to deployers","idx":321,"match_words":["transparency","provision","information","deployer"],"words":["transparency","and","provision","of","information","to","deployer"],"unmatched_count":3,"match_length":4,"cut_length":7},{"key":"325","text_words":[["1","X",""],null,["high","ADJ","high"],null,["risk","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["shall","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["designed","VERB","design"],["and","CCONJ",""],["developed","VERB","develop"],["in","ADP",""],["such","DET",""],["a","DET",""]