ith the risks, level of autonomy and context of use of the high-risk AI system, and shall be ensured through either one or both of the following types of measures: measures identified and built, when technically feasible, into the high-risk AI system by the provider before it is placed on the market or put into service; measures identified by the provider before placing the high-risk AI system on the market or putting it into service and that are appropriate to be implemented by the deployer.","idx":327,"match_words":["oversight","measure","risk","level","autonomy","context","use","high","risk","system","ensure","follow","type","measure","measure","identify","build","technically","feasible","high","risk","system","the provider","before","place","the market","put","service","measure","identify","the provider","before","place","high","risk","system","the market","put","service","appropriate","implement","the deployer"],"words":["the","oversight","measure","shall","be","commensurate","with","the","risk","level","of","autonomy","and","context","of","use","of","the","high","risk","ai","system","and","shall","be","ensure","through","either","or","both","of","the","follow","type","of","measure","measure","identify","and","build","when","technically","feasible","into","the","high","risk","ai","system","by","the provider","before","it","be","place","on","the market","or","put","into","service","measure","identify","by","the provider","before","place","the","high","risk","ai","system","on","the market","or","put","it","into","service","and","that","be","appropriate","to","be","implement","by","the deployer"],"unmatched_count":46,"match_length":42,"cut_length":88},{"key":"332","text_words":[["4","X",""],null,["for","ADP","for"],["the","DET",""],["purpose","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["implementing","VERB","implement"],["paragraphs","NOUN","paragraph"],null,["1","NUM",""],null,["2","NUM",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["3","NUM",""],null,["the","DET",""],["high","ADJ",""],null,["risk","