,"DET",""],["effect","NOUN",""],null],"text":"2. Where a distributor considers or has reason to consider, on the basis of the information in its possession, that a high-risk AI system is not in conformity with the requirements set out in Section 2, it shall not make the high-risk AI system available on the market until the system has been brought into conformity with those requirements.Furthermore, where the high-risk AI system presents a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1), the distributor shall inform the provider or the importer of the system, as applicable, to that effect.","idx":377,"match_words":["distributor","consider","have","reason","consider","the basis","the information","its possession","high","risk","system","conformity","requirement","set","out","section","make","high","risk","system","available","the market","the system","have","bring","conformity","requirement","furthermore","high","risk","system","present","risk","the meaning","article","79(1","the distributor","inform","the provider","the importer","the system","applicable","that effect"],"words":["where","a","distributor","consider","or","have","reason","to","consider","on","the basis","of","the information","in","its possession","that","a","high","risk","ai","system","be","not","in","conformity","with","the","requirement","set","out","in","section","it","shall","not","make","the","high","risk","ai","system","available","on","the market","until","the system","have","be","bring","into","conformity","with","those","requirement","furthermore","where","the","high","risk","ai","system","present","a","risk","within","the meaning","of","article","79(1","the distributor","shall","inform","the provider","or","the importer","of","the system","as","applicable","to","that effect"],"unmatched_count":38,"match_length":43,"cut_length":81},{"key":"383","text_words":[["3","X",""],null,["distributors","NOUN","distributor"],["shall","AUX",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],null,["while","SCONJ",""],[