t are required for the fulfilment of the obligations set out in this Regulation, in particular regarding the compliance with the conformity assessment of high-risk AI systems.This paragraph shall not apply in cases where the initial provider has clearly specified that its AI system is not to be changed into a high-risk AI system and therefore does not fall under the obligation to hand over the documentation.","idx":384,"match_words":["circumstance","refer","paragraph","occur","the provider","place","the ai system","the market","put","service","long","consider","provider","that specific ai system","purpose","this regulation","that initial provider","closely","cooperate","new","provider","make","available","the necessary information","provide","reasonably","expect","technical","access","other assistance","require","the fulfilment","the obligation","set","out","this regulation","particular","regard","the compliance","the conformity assessment","high","risk","system","this paragraph","apply","case","the initial provider","have","clearly","specify","its ai system","change","high","risk","system","therefore","fall","obligation","hand","over","the documentation"],"words":["where","the","circumstance","refer","to","in","paragraph","occur","the provider","that","initially","place","the ai system","on","the market","or","put","it","into","service","shall","no","long","be","consider","to","be","a","provider","of","that specific ai system","for","the","purpose","of","this regulation","that initial provider","shall","closely","cooperate","with","new","provider","and","shall","make","available","the necessary information","and","provide","the","reasonably","expect","technical","access","and","other assistance","that","be","require","for","the fulfilment","of","the obligation","set","out","in","this regulation","in","particular","regard","the compliance","with","the conformity assessment","of","high","risk","ai","system","this paragraph","shall","not","apply","in","case","where","