e, or without undue delay and no later than 48 hours, by a judicial authority or an administrative authority whose decision is binding and subject to judicial review, for the use of that system, except when it is used for the initial identification of a potential suspect based on objective and verifiable facts directly linked to the offence.Each use shall be limited to what is strictly necessary for the investigation of a specific criminal offence.","idx":401,"match_words":["prejudice","directive","2016/680","the framework","an investigation","target","search","person","suspect","commit","criminal","offence","the deployer","high","risk","system","post","remote","biometric","identification","request","an authorisation","ex ante","undue delay","later","hour","judicial","authority","an administrative authority","whose decision","bind","subject","judicial review","the use","that system","use","the initial identification","potential","suspect","base","objective","verifiable","fact","directly","link","the offence","each use","limit","strictly","necessary","the investigation","specific","criminal","offence"],"words":["without","prejudice","to","directive","eu","2016/680","in","the framework","of","an investigation","for","the","target","search","of","a","person","suspect","or","convict","of","having","commit","a","criminal","offence","the deployer","of","a","high","risk","ai","system","for","post","remote","biometric","identification","shall","request","an authorisation","ex ante","or","without","undue delay","and","no","later","than","hour","by","a","judicial","authority","or","an administrative authority","whose decision","be","bind","and","subject","to","judicial review","for","the use","of","that system","except","when","it","be","use","for","the initial identification","of","a","potential","suspect","base","on","objective","and","verifiable","fact","directly","link","to","the offence","each use","shall","be","limit","to","what","be","strictly","necessary","for","the i