eriod of nine months after cessation of the notified body’s activities, on condition that another notified body has confirmed in writing that it will assume responsibilities for the high-risk AI systems covered by those certificates.The latter notified body shall complete a full assessment of the high-risk AI systems affected by the end of that nine-month-period before issuing new certificates for those systems.Where the notified body has ceased its activity, the notifying authority shall withdraw the designation.","idx":466,"match_words":["notify","body","decide","cease","conformity","assessment","activity","inform","the notifying authority","provider","concern","soon","possible","the case","plan","least","year","before","cease","its activity","certificate","notify","body","may","remain","valid","period","month","notify","body","activity","condition","notify","body","have","confirm","writing","will","assume","responsibility","high","risk","system","cover","certificate","latter","notify","body","complete","full","assessment","high","risk","system","affect","the end","month","period","before","issue","new","certificate","system","notify","body","have","cease","activity","the notifying authority","withdraw","the designation"],"words":["where","a","notify","body","decide","to","cease","its","conformity","assessment","activity","it","shall","inform","the notifying authority","and","the","provider","concern","as","soon","as","possible","and","in","the case","of","a","plan","cessation","at","least","year","before","cease","its activity","the","certificate","of","the","notify","body","may","remain","valid","for","a","period","of","month","after","cessation","of","the","notify","body","activity","on","condition","that","another","notify","body","have","confirm","in","writing","that","it","will","assume","responsibility","for","the","high","risk","ai","system","cover","by","those","certificate","the","latter","notify","body","shall","complete","a","full","assessment","of","t