w the designation as appropriate, depending on the seriousness of the failure to meet those requirements or fulfil those obligations.It shall immediately inform the Commission and the other Member States accordingly.","idx":467,"match_words":["notifying","authority","have","sufficient reason","consider","notify","body","long","meet","requirement","lay","down","article","fail","fulfil","obligation","the notifying authority","delay","investigate","the matter","the utmost diligence","that context","inform","notify","body","concern","objection","raise","give","the possibility","make","view","know","the notifying authority","come","the conclusion","notify","body","long","meet","requirement","lay","down","article","fail","fulfil","obligation","restrict","suspend","withdraw","the designation","appropriate","depend","the seriousness","the failure","meet","requirement","fulfil","obligation","immediately","inform","the commission","the other member states","accordingly"],"words":["where","a","notifying","authority","have","sufficient reason","to","consider","that","a","notify","body","no","long","meet","the","requirement","lay","down","in","article","or","that","it","be","fail","to","fulfil","its","obligation","the notifying authority","shall","without","delay","investigate","the matter","with","the utmost diligence","in","that context","it","shall","inform","the","notify","body","concern","about","the","objection","raise","and","give","it","the possibility","to","make","its","view","know","if","the notifying authority","come","to","the conclusion","that","the","notify","body","no","long","meet","the","requirement","lay","down","in","article","or","that","it","be","fail","to","fulfil","its","obligation","it","shall","restrict","suspend","or","withdraw","the designation","as","appropriate","depend","on","the seriousness","of","the failure","to","meet","those","requirement","or","fulfil","those","obligation","it","shall","immediately","inform","the commission","and","the other 