 suspension or restriction; or the notifying authority has confirmed that no certificates relevant to the suspension will be issued, amended or re-issued during the course of the suspension or restriction, and states whether the notified body has the capability of continuing to monitor and remain responsible for existing certificates issued for the period of the suspension or restriction; in the event that the notifying authority determines that the notified body does not have the capability to support existing certificates issued, the provider of the system covered by the certificate shall confirm in writing to the national competent authorities of the Member State in which it has its registered place of business, within three months of the suspension or restriction, that another qualified notified body is temporarily assuming the functions of the notified body to monitor and remain responsible for the certificates during the period of suspension or restriction.","idx":471,"match_words":["the exception","certificate","unduly","issue","designation","have","suspend","restrict","the certificate","remain","valid","follow","circumstance","the notifying authority","have","confirm","month","the suspension","restriction","no risk","health","safety","fundamental","right","relation","certificate","affect","the suspension","restriction","the notifying authority","have","outline","action","remedy","the suspension","restriction","the notifying authority","have","confirm","certificate","relevant","the suspension","will","issue","amend","issue","the course","the suspension","restriction","state","notify","body","have","the capability","continue","monitor","remain","responsible","exist","certificate","issue","the period","the suspension","restriction","the event","the notifying authority","determine","notify","body","have","the capability","support","exist","certificate","issue","the provider","the system","cover","certificate","confirm","writing","national","competent","authority