 contribute to strengthening global cooperation on standardisation and taking into account existing international standards in the field of AI that are consistent with Union values, fundamental rights and interests, and to enhance multi-stakeholder governance ensuring a balanced representation of interests and the effective participation of all relevant stakeholders in accordance with Articles 5, 6, and 7 of Regulation (EU) No 1025/2012.","idx":491,"match_words":["participant","the standardisation process","seek","promote","innovation","include","increase","legal","certainty","well","the competitiveness","growth","the union market","contribute","strengthen","global cooperation","standardisation","take","account","exist","international","standard","the field","consistent","union","value","fundamental","right","interest","enhance","stakeholder","governance","ensure","balanced","representation","interest","the effective participation","all","relevant","stakeholder","accordance","articles","regulation"],"words":["the","participant","in","the standardisation process","shall","seek","to","promote","investment","and","innovation","in","ai","include","through","increase","legal","certainty","as","well","as","the competitiveness","and","growth","of","the union market","to","contribute","to","strengthen","global cooperation","on","standardisation","and","take","into","account","exist","international","standard","in","the field","of","ai","that","be","consistent","with","union","value","fundamental","right","and","interest","and","to","enhance","multi","stakeholder","governance","ensure","a","balanced","representation","of","interest","and","the effective participation","of","all","relevant","stakeholder","in","accordance","with","articles","and","of","regulation","eu","no"],"unmatched_count":38,"match_length":43,"cut_length":81},{"key":"498","text_words":[["common","ADJ","common"],["specifications","NOUN","specification"]],"text":"Common specifications","idx":492,"match_words