 from the scientific panel, it has capabilities or an impact equivalent to those set out in point (a) having regard to the criteria set out in Annex XIII.","idx":560,"match_words":["general","purpose","model","classify","general","purpose","model","systemic risk","meet","follow","condition","have","high","impact","capability","evaluate","the basis","appropriate","technical","tool","methodology","include","indicator","benchmark","base","decision","the commission","follow","qualified","alert","the scientific panel","have","capability","an impact","equivalent","set","out","point","have","regard","criterion","set","out","annex","xiii"],"words":["a","general","purpose","ai","model","shall","be","classify","as","a","general","purpose","ai","model","with","systemic risk","if","it","meet","any","of","the","follow","condition","it","have","high","impact","capability","evaluate","on","the basis","of","appropriate","technical","tool","and","methodology","include","indicator","and","benchmark","base","on","a","decision","of","the commission","or","follow","a","qualified","alert","from","the scientific panel","it","have","capability","or","an impact","equivalent","to","those","set","out","in","point","have","regard","to","the","criterion","set","out","in","annex","xiii"],"unmatched_count":32,"match_length":45,"cut_length":77},{"key":"571","text_words":[["2","X",""],null,["a","DET","a"],["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["model","NOUN",""],["shall","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["presumed","VERB","presume"],["to","PART",""],["have","VERB",""],["high","ADJ",""],["impact","NOUN",""],["capabilities","NOUN","capability"],["pursuant","ADJ",""],["to","PART",""],["paragraph","VERB",""],null,["1","NUM",""],null,["point","NOUN",""],null,["a","X",""],null,null,["when","SCONJ",""],["the","DET",""],["cumulative","ADJ",""],["amount","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["computation","NOUN",""],["used","VERB","use"],["for","ADP",""],["its","PRON",""],["training","NOUN",""],[