 be met.That notification shall include the information necessary to demonstrate that the relevant requirement has been met.If the Commission becomes aware of a general-purpose AI model presenting systemic risks of which it has not been notified, it may decide to designate it as a model with systemic risk.","idx":563,"match_words":["general","purpose","model","meet","the condition","refer","article","point","the relevant provider","notify","the commission","delay","any event","week","that requirement","meet","know","will","meet","that notification","include","the information","necessary","demonstrate","the relevant requirement","have","meet","the commission","become","aware","general","purpose","model","present","systemic risk","have","notify","may","decide","designate","model","systemic","risk"],"words":["where","a","general","purpose","ai","model","meet","the condition","refer","to","in","article","point","a","the relevant provider","shall","notify","the commission","without","delay","and","in","any event","within","week","after","that requirement","be","meet","or","it","becomes","know","that","it","will","be","meet","that notification","shall","include","the information","necessary","to","demonstrate","that","the relevant requirement","have","be","meet","if","the commission","become","aware","of","a","general","purpose","ai","model","present","systemic risk","of","which","it","have","not","be","notify","it","may","decide","to","designate","it","as","a","model","with","systemic","risk"],"unmatched_count":38,"match_length":43,"cut_length":81},{"key":"575","text_words":[["2","X",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["provider","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["model","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["meets","VERB","meet"],["the","DET",""],["condition","NOUN",""],["referred","VERB","refer"],["to","ADP",""],["in","ADP",""],["article","NOUN","article"],null,["51(1","NUM",""],null,null,["point","NOUN",""],null,["a","X",""],null,null,["may","AUX",""],["present","VERB",""],null,["with","ADP",""],["its","PRON",""],["notification","NOUN",""],null,["sufficiently","ADV",""],["substantiated","ADJ",""],["arguments","NOUN","argument"],["to","PART",""],["demonstrate","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],null,["exceptionally","ADV",""],null,["although","SCONJ",""],["it","PRON",""],["meets","VERB","meet"],["that","DET",""],["requirement","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["model","NOUN",""],["does","AUX","do"],["not","PART",""],["present","VERB",""],null,["due","ADP",""],["to","ADP",""],["its","PRON",""],["specific","ADJ",""],["characteristics","NOUN","characteristic"],null,["systemic","ADJ",""],["risks","NOUN","risk"],["and","CCONJ",""],["therefore","ADV",""],["should","AUX",""],["not","PART",""],["be","AUX",""],["classified","VERB","classify"],["as","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["general","ADJ",""],null,["purpose","NOUN",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["model","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["systemic","ADJ",""],["risk","NOUN",""],null],"text":"2. The provider of a general-purpose AI model that meets the condition referred to in Article 51(1), point (a), may present, with its notification, sufficiently substantiated arguments to demonstrate that, exceptionally, although it meets that requirement, the general-purpose AI model does not present, due to its specific characteristics, systemic risks and therefore should not be classified as a general-purpose AI model with systemic risk.","idx":564,"match_words":["the provider","general","purpose","model","meet","the condition","refer","article","point","may","present","its notification","sufficiently","argument","demonstrate","exceptionally","meet","that requirement","general","purpose","model","present","due","specific","characteristic","systemic risk","therefore","classify","general","purpose","model","systemic","risk"],"words":["the provider","of","a","general","purpose","ai"