pose AI models not presenting systemic risks this adherence may be limited to the obligations provided for in Article 53, unless they declare explicitly their interest to join the full code.","idx":597,"match_words":["the ai office","may","invite","all","provider","general","purpose","model","adhere","code","practice","provider","general","purpose","model","present","systemic","risk","this adherence","may","limit","obligation","provide","article","declare","explicitly","their interest","the full code"],"words":["the ai office","may","invite","all","provider","of","general","purpose","ai","model","to","adhere","to","the","code","of","practice","for","provider","of","general","purpose","ai","model","not","present","systemic","risk","this adherence","may","be","limit","to","the","obligation","provide","for","in","article","unless","they","declare","explicitly","their interest","to","join","the full code"],"unmatched_count":19,"match_length":28,"cut_length":47},{"key":"609","text_words":[["8","X",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["ai","PROPN",""],["office","PROPN",""],["shall","AUX",""],null,["as","ADP",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],null,["also","ADV",""],["encourage","VERB",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["facilitate","VERB",""],["the","DET",""],["review","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["adaptation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["codes","NOUN","code"],["of","ADP",""],["practice","NOUN",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["in","ADP",""],["light","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["emerging","VERB","emerge"],["standards","NOUN","standard"],null,["the","DET","the"],["ai","PROPN",""],["office","PROPN",""],["shall","AUX",""],["assist","VERB",""],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["assessment","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["available","ADJ",""],["standards","NOUN","standard"],null],"text":"8.The AI Office shall, as appropriate, also encourage and facilitate the review and adaptation of the codes of practice, in particular in light of emerging standards.The AI Office sha