 the participation in the sandbox if no effective mitigation is possible, and shall inform the AI Office of such decision.National competent authorities shall exercise their supervisory powers within the limits of the relevant law, using their discretionary powers when implementing legal provisions in respect of a specific AI regulatory sandbox project, with the objective of supporting innovation in AI in the Union.","idx":614,"match_words":["regulatory","sandbox","affect","supervisory","corrective","power","competent","authority","supervise","the sandbox","include","regional or local level","significant","risk","health","safety","fundamental","right","identify","the development","testing","such","system","result","an adequate mitigation","national","competent","authority","have","the power","temporarily","permanently","suspend","the testing process","the participation","sandbox","no effective mitigation","possible","inform","the ai office","such decision","national","competent","authority","exercise","supervisory","power","limit","the relevant law","use","power","implement","legal","provision","respect","specific","regulatory","sandbox","project","the objective","support","innovation","the union"],"words":["the","ai","regulatory","sandbox","shall","not","affect","the","supervisory","or","corrective","power","of","the","competent","authority","supervise","the sandbox","include","at","regional or local level","any","significant","risk","to","health","and","safety","and","fundamental","right","identify","during","the development","and","testing","of","such","ai","system","shall","result","in","an adequate mitigation","national","competent","authority","shall","have","the power","to","temporarily","or","permanently","suspend","the testing process","or","the participation","in","the","sandbox","if","no effective mitigation","be","possible","and","shall","inform","the ai office","of","such decision","national","competent","authority","shall","exercise","their","superviso