nal competent authorities shall make those annual reports or abstracts thereof available to the public, online.The Commission shall, where appropriate, take the annual reports into account when exercising its tasks under this Regulation.","idx":619,"match_words":["national","competent","authority","submit","annual","report","the ai office","the board","year","the establishment","the ai regulatory sandbox","year","thereafter","its termination","final","report","report","provide","information","the progress","result","the implementation","sandbox","include","good","practice","incident","learn","recommendation","their setup","relevant","the application","possible revision","this regulation","include","delegate","implement","act","the application","other union law","supervise","competent","authority","the sandbox","national","competent","authority","make","annual","report","thereof","available","public","online","the commission","appropriate","take","annual","report","account","exercise","task","this regulation"],"words":["national","competent","authority","shall","submit","annual","report","to","the ai office","and","to","the board","from","year","after","the establishment","of","the ai regulatory sandbox","and","every","year","thereafter","until","its termination","and","a","final","report","those","report","shall","provide","information","on","the progress","and","result","of","the implementation","of","those","sandbox","include","good","practice","incident","lesson","learn","and","recommendation","on","their setup","and","where","relevant","on","the application","and","possible revision","of","this regulation","include","its","delegate","and","implement","act","and","on","the application","of","other union law","supervise","by","the","competent","authority","within","the sandbox","the","national","competent","authority","shall","make","those","annual","report","or","abstract","thereof","available","to","the","public","online","the commission","shall","where","approp