es to allow stakeholders to interact with AI regulatory sandboxes and to raise enquiries with competent authorities, and to seek non-binding guidance on the conformity of innovative products, services, business models embedding AI technologies, in accordance with Article 62(1), point (c).The Commission shall proactively coordinate with national competent authorities, where relevant.","idx":620,"match_words":["the commission","develop","single","dedicated","interface","contain","all relevant information","relate","regulatory","sandbox","allow","stakeholder","interact","regulatory","sandbox","raise","competent","authority","seek","non","guidance","the conformity","innovative","product","service","business","model","embed","technology","accordance","article","point","the commission","coordinate","national","competent","authority","relevant"],"words":["the commission","shall","develop","a","single","and","dedicated","interface","contain","all relevant information","relate","to","ai","regulatory","sandbox","to","allow","stakeholder","to","interact","with","ai","regulatory","sandbox","and","to","raise","enquiry","with","competent","authority","and","to","seek","non","binding","guidance","on","the conformity","of","innovative","product","service","business","model","embed","ai","technology","in","accordance","with","article","point","c","the commission","shall","proactively","coordinate","with","national","competent","authority","where","relevant"],"unmatched_count":26,"match_length":38,"cut_length":64},{"key":"632","text_words":[["detailed","ADJ","detailed"],["arrangements","NOUN","arrangement"],["for","ADP",""],null,["and","CCONJ",""],["functioning","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],null,["ai","PROPN",""],["regulatory","ADJ",""],["sandboxes","NOUN","sandbox"]],"text":"Detailed arrangements for, and functioning of, AI regulatory sandboxes","idx":621,"match_words":["detailed","arrangement","functioning","regulatory","sandbox"],"words":["detailed","arrangement","for","and","functi