h","the","public","and","private","sector","that","procedure","process","and","administrative","requirement","for","application","selection","participation","and","exit","the","ai","regulatory","sandbox","be","simple","easily","intelligible","and","clearly","communicate","in","order","to","facilitate","the participation","of","sme","include","start","up","with","limited","legal","and","administrative","capacity","and","be","streamline","across","the union","in","order","to","avoid","fragmentation","and","that participation","in","an ai regulatory sandbox","establish","by","a","member","state","or","by","the european data protection supervisor","be","mutually","and","uniformly","recognise","and","carry","the","same","legal","effect","across","the union","that","participation","in","the","ai","regulatory","sandbox","be","limit","to","a","period","that","be","appropriate","to","the complexity","and","scale","of","the project","and","that","may","be","extend","by","the national competent authority","that","ai","regulatory","sandbox","facilitate","the development","of","tool","and","infrastructure","for","testing","benchmarking","assess","and","explain","dimension","of","ai","system","relevant","for","regulatory learning","such","as","accuracy","robustness","and","cybersecurity","as","well","as","measure","to","mitigate","risk","to","fundamental","right","and","society","at","large"],"unmatched_count":163,"match_length":207,"cut_length":370},{"key":"636","text_words":[["3","X",""],null,["prospective","ADJ","prospective"],["providers","NOUN","provider"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["regulatory","ADJ",""],["sandboxes","NOUN","sandbox"],null,["in","ADP",""],["particular","ADJ",""],["smes","NOUN","sme"],["and","CCONJ",""],["start","NOUN",""],null,["ups","NOUN","up"],null,["shall","AUX",""],["be","AUX",""],["directed","VERB","direct"],null,["where","SCONJ",""],["relevant","ADJ",""],null,["to","PART",""],["pre","ADJ",""],null,["deployment","ADJ",""],["services","NOUN","service"],["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["guidance","NOUN",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["implementation","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["this","DET",""],["regulation","PROPN",""],null,["to","ADP",""],["other","ADJ",""],["value","NOUN",""],null,["adding","VERB","add"],["services","NOUN","service"],["such","ADJ",""],["as","ADP",""],["help","NOUN",""],["with","ADP",""],["standardisation","NOUN",""],["documents","NOUN","document"],["and","CCONJ",""],["certification","NOUN",""],null,["testing","NOUN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["experimentation","NOUN",""],["facilities","NOUN","facility"],null,["european","PROPN",""],["digital","PROPN",""],["innovation","PROPN",""],["hubs","PROPN",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["centres","NOUN","centre"],["of","ADP",""],["excellence","NOUN",""],null],"text":"3. Prospective providers in the AI regulatory sandboxes, in particular SMEs and start-ups, shall be directed, where relevant, to pre-deployment services such as guidance on the implementation of this Regulation, to other value-adding services such as help with standardisation documents and certification, testing and experimentation facilities, European Digital Innovation Hubs and centres of excellence.","idx":625,"match_words":["prospective","provider","regulatory","sandbox","particular","sme","start","direct","relevant","pre","deployment","service","such","guidance","the implementation","this regulation","other","value","add","service","such","help","standardisation","document","certification","testing","experimentation","facility","european","digital","innovation","hubs","centre"],"words":["prospective","provider","in","the","ai","regulatory","sandbox","in","particular","sme","and","start","up","shall","be","direct","where","relevant","to","pre","deployment","service","such","as","guidance","on","the implementation","of","this regulation","to","other","value","add","service","such","as","help","with","standardisation","document","and","certification","testing","and",