es consider authorising testing in real world conditions supervised within the framework of an AI regulatory sandbox to be established under this Article, they shall specifically agree the terms and conditions of such testing and, in particular, the appropriate safeguards with the participants, with a view to protecting fundamental rights, health and safety.Where appropriate, they shall cooperate with other national competent authorities with a view to ensuring consistent practices across the Union.","idx":626,"match_words":["national","competent","authority","consider","authorise","testing","real","world","condition","supervise","the framework","an ai regulatory sandbox","establish","this article","specifically","agree","term","condition","such testing","particular","appropriate","safeguard","participant","view","protect","fundamental","right","health","safety","appropriate","cooperate","other","national","competent","authority","view","ensure","consistent","practice","union"],"words":["where","national","competent","authority","consider","authorise","testing","in","real","world","condition","supervise","within","the framework","of","an ai regulatory sandbox","to","be","establish","under","this article","they","shall","specifically","agree","the","term","and","condition","of","such testing","and","in","particular","the","appropriate","safeguard","with","the","participant","with","a","view","to","protect","fundamental","right","health","and","safety","where","appropriate","they","shall","cooperate","with","other","national","competent","authority","with","a","view","to","ensure","consistent","practice","across","the","union"],"unmatched_count":30,"match_length":40,"cut_length":70},{"key":"638","text_words":[["further","ADJ","further"],["processing","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["personal","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["for","ADP",""],["developing","VERB","develop"],["certain","ADJ",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["in","ADP",""],["the","DET",""]