s of SMEs including start-ups, deployers and, as appropriate, local public authorities; utilise existing dedicated channels and where appropriate, establish new ones for communication with SMEs including start-ups, deployers, other innovators and, as appropriate, local public authorities to provide advice and respond to queries about the implementation of this Regulation, including as regards participation in AI regulatory sandboxes; facilitate the participation of SMEs and other relevant stakeholders in the standardisation development process.","idx":647,"match_words":["member states","undertake","follow","action","provide","sme","include","start","have","register","office","the union","priority access","the ai regulatory sandbox","the extent","fulfil","eligibility","condition","selection","criterion","the priority access","preclude","other","sme","include","start","other","refer","this paragraph","access","regulatory","sandbox","provide","also","fulfil","eligibility","condition","selection","criterion","organise","specific","awareness","raise","training","activity","the application","this regulation","need","sme","include","start","deployer","appropriate","local","public","authority","exist","dedicated","channel","appropriate","establish","new","one","communication","sme","include","start","deployer","other","innovator","appropriate","local","public","authority","provide","advice","respond","the implementation","this regulation","include","regard","participation","regulatory","sandbox","facilitate","the participation","sme","other","relevant","stakeholder","the standardisation development process"],"words":["member states","shall","undertake","the","follow","action","provide","sme","include","start","up","have","a","register","office","or","a","branch","in","the union","with","priority access","to","the ai regulatory sandbox","to","the extent","that","they","fulfil","the","eligibility","condition","and","selection","criterion","the priority access","shall","not","