,["out","ADP",""],["activities","NOUN","activity"],["diligently","ADV",""],null,["accurately","ADV",""],["and","CCONJ",""],["objectively","ADV",""],null],"text":"2. The scientific panel shall consist of experts selected by the Commission on the basis of up-to-date scientific or technical expertise in the field of AI necessary for the tasks set out in paragraph 3, and shall be able to demonstrate meeting all of the following conditions: having particular expertise and competence and scientific or technical expertise in the field of AI; independence from any provider of AI systems or general-purpose AI models; an ability to carry out activities diligently, accurately and objectively.","idx":680,"match_words":["the scientific panel","consist","expert","select","the commission","the basis","date","scientific or technical expertise","the field","necessary","task","set","out","paragraph","able","demonstrate","meeting","all","follow","condition","have","particular expertise","competence","scientific","technical","expertise","the field","independence","any provider","system","general","purpose","model","ability","carry","out","activity"],"words":["the scientific panel","shall","consist","of","expert","select","by","the commission","on","the basis","of","up","to","date","scientific or technical expertise","in","the field","of","ai","necessary","for","the","task","set","out","in","paragraph","and","shall","be","able","to","demonstrate","meeting","all","of","the","follow","condition","have","particular expertise","and","competence","and","scientific","or","technical","expertise","in","the field","of","ai","independence","from","any provider","of","ai","system","or","general","purpose","ai","model","an","ability","to","carry","out","activity","diligently","accurately","and","objectively"],"unmatched_count":36,"match_length":37,"cut_length":73},{"key":"694","text_words":[["the","DET","the"],["commission","PROPN",""],null,["in","ADP",""],["consultation","NOUN",""],["with","ADP","