ial","ADJ",""],["capacity","NOUN",""],null],"text":"8.For high-risk AI systems listed in point 1 of Annex III to this Regulation, in so far as the systems are used for law enforcement purposes, border management and justice and democracy, and for high-risk AI systems listed in points 6, 7 and 8 of Annex III to this Regulation, Member States shall designate as market surveillance authorities for the purposes of this Regulation either the competent data protection supervisory authorities under Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Directive (EU) 2016/680, or any other authority designated pursuant to the same conditions laid down in Articles 41 to 44 of Directive (EU) 2016/680.Market surveillance activities shall in no way affect the independence of judicial authorities, or otherwise interfere with their activities when acting in their judicial capacity.","idx":736,"match_words":["high","risk","system","list","point","annex","iii","this regulation","far","system","use","law","enforcement","purpose","border management","justice","democracy","high","risk","system","list","point","annex","iii","this regulation","member states","designate","market","surveillance","authority","purpose","this regulation","competent","data","protection","supervisory","authority","regulation","directive","2016/680","any other authority","designate","pursuant","same","condition","lay","down","articles","directive","2016/680","market","surveillance","activity","no way","affect","the independence","judicial","authority","otherwise","interfere","activity","act","their judicial capacity"],"words":["for","high","risk","ai","system","list","in","point","of","annex","iii","to","this regulation","in","so","far","as","the","system","be","use","for","law","enforcement","purpose","border management","and","justice","and","democracy","and","for","high","risk","ai","system","list","in","point","and","of","annex","iii","to","this regulation","member states","shall","designate","as","market","surveillance","authority"