ablish whether a high-risk AI system is non-compliant.Market surveillance authorities shall safeguard the confidentiality of the information that they obtain in accordance with Article 78 of this Regulation.The procedure provided for in Chapter VI of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 shall apply mutatis mutandis.","idx":746,"match_words":["market","surveillance","authority","unable","conclude","its investigation","high","risk","system","its inability","access","certain information","relate","general","purpose","model","make","all","appropriate","effort","obtain","that information","may","submit","reason","request","the ai office","access","that information","enforce","that case","the ai office","supply","the applicant authority","delay","any event","day","information","the ai office","consider","relevant","order","establish","high","risk","system","non","compliant","market","surveillance","authority","safeguard","the confidentiality","the information","obtain","accordance","article","this regulation","the procedure","provide","chapter","regulation","apply","mutatis","mutandi"],"words":["where","a","market","surveillance","authority","be","unable","to","conclude","its investigation","of","the","high","risk","ai","system","because","of","its inability","to","access","certain information","relate","to","the","general","purpose","ai","model","despite","having","make","all","appropriate","effort","to","obtain","that information","it","may","submit","a","reason","request","to","the ai office","by","which","access","to","that information","shall","be","enforce","in","that case","the ai office","shall","supply","to","the applicant authority","without","delay","and","in","any event","within","day","any","information","that","the ai office","consider","to","be","relevant","in","order","to","establish","whether","a","high","risk","ai","system","be","non","compliant","market","surveillance","authority","shall","safeguard","the confidentiality","of","the information","that","they","obta