hall verify the compliance with Article 60 as part of their supervisory role for the AI regulatory sandbox.Those authorities may, as appropriate, allow the testing in real world conditions to be conducted by the provider or prospective provider, in derogation from the conditions set out in Article 60(4), points (f) and (g).","idx":749,"match_words":["test","real","world","condition","conduct","system","supervise","an ai regulatory sandbox","article","market","surveillance","authority","verify","the compliance","article","part","their supervisory role","the ai regulatory sandbox","authority","may","appropriate","allow","the testing","real","world","condition","conduct","the provider","prospective provider","derogation","condition","set","out","article","60(4","point"],"words":["where","test","in","real","world","condition","be","conduct","for","ai","system","that","be","supervise","within","an ai regulatory sandbox","under","article","the","market","surveillance","authority","shall","verify","the compliance","with","article","as","part","of","their supervisory role","for","the ai regulatory sandbox","those","authority","may","as","appropriate","allow","the testing","in","real","world","condition","to","be","conduct","by","the provider","or","prospective provider","in","derogation","from","the","condition","set","out","in","article","60(4","point","and","g"],"unmatched_count":28,"match_length":36,"cut_length":64},{"key":"763","text_words":[["3","X",""],null,["where","SCONJ","where"],["a","DET",""],null,["market","NOUN",""],["surveillance","NOUN",""],["authority","NOUN",""],["has","AUX","have"],["been","AUX","be"],["informed","VERB","inform"],["by","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["prospective","ADJ",""],["provider","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["provider","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["any","DET",""],["third","ADJ",""],["party","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["a","DET",""],null,["serious","ADJ",""],["incident","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["has","VERB","have"],["other","AD