",""],null,["state","PROPN",""],["concerned","ADJ",""],["of","ADP",""],["any","DET",""],["such","ADJ",""],["request","NOUN",""],null],"text":"1. National public authorities or bodies which supervise or enforce the respect of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights, including the right to non-discrimination, in relation to the use of high-risk AI systems referred to in Annex III shall have the power to request and access any documentation created or maintained under this Regulation in accessible language and format when access to that documentation is necessary for effectively fulfilling their mandates within the limits of their jurisdiction.The relevant public authority or body shall inform the market surveillance authority of the Member State concerned of any such request.","idx":754,"match_words":["national","public","authority","body","supervise","enforce","the respect","obligation","union law","protect","fundamental","right","include","the right","non","discrimination","relation","the use","high","risk","system","refer","annex","iii","have","the power","request","access","any documentation","create","maintain","this regulation","accessible language","format","access","that documentation","necessary","effectively","fulfil","mandate","limit","their jurisdiction","the relevant public authority","body","inform","the market surveillance authority","member","state","concerned","any such request"],"words":["national","public","authority","or","body","which","supervise","or","enforce","the respect","of","obligation","under","union law","protect","fundamental","right","include","the right","to","non","discrimination","in","relation","to","the use","of","high","risk","ai","system","refer","to","in","annex","iii","shall","have","the power","to","request","and","access","any documentation","create","or","maintain","under","this regulation","in","accessible language","and","format","when","access","to","that documentation","be","necessary","for","effectivel