,""],["a","DET",""],null,["reasonable","ADJ",""],["time","NOUN",""],["following","VERB","follow"],["the","DET",""],["request","NOUN",""],null],"text":"3. Where the documentation referred to in paragraph 1 is insufficient to ascertain whether an infringement of obligations under Union law protecting fundamental rights has occurred, the public authority or body referred to in paragraph 1 may make a reasoned request to the market surveillance authority, to organise testing of the high-risk AI system through technical means.The market surveillance authority shall organise the testing with the close involvement of the requesting public authority or body within a reasonable time following the request.","idx":756,"match_words":["the documentation","refer","paragraph","insufficient","an infringement","obligation","union law","protect","fundamental","right","have","occur","the public authority","body","refer","paragraph","may","make","reason","request","the market surveillance authority","organise","testing","high","risk","system","technical","mean","the market surveillance authority","organise","the testing","the close involvement","the request","public","authority","body","reasonable","time","follow","request"],"words":["where","the documentation","refer","to","in","paragraph","be","insufficient","to","ascertain","whether","an infringement","of","obligation","under","union law","protect","fundamental","right","have","occur","the public authority","or","body","refer","to","in","paragraph","may","make","a","reason","request","to","the market surveillance authority","to","organise","testing","of","the","high","risk","ai","system","through","technical","mean","the market surveillance authority","shall","organise","the testing","with","the close involvement","of","the request","public","authority","or","body","within","a","reasonable","time","follow","the","request"],"unmatched_count":26,"match_length":40,"cut_length":66},{"key":"770","text_words":[["4","X",""],null,["any","DET