","NOUN",""],["authorities","NOUN","authority"],null],"text":"3.Without prejudice to paragraphs 1 and 2, information exchanged on a confidential basis between the national competent authorities or between national competent authorities and the Commission shall not be disclosed without prior consultation of the originating national competent authority and the deployer when high-risk AI systems referred to in point 1, 6 or 7 of Annex III are used by law enforcement, border control, immigration or asylum authorities and when such disclosure would jeopardise public and national security interests.This exchange of information shall not cover sensitive operational data in relation to the activities of law enforcement, border control, immigration or asylum authorities.","idx":760,"match_words":["prejudice","paragraph","information","exchange","confidential","basis","national","competent","authority","national","competent","authority","the commission","disclose","prior consultation","national","competent","authority","the deployer","high","risk","system","refer","point","annex","iii","use","law enforcement","border control","immigration","asylum","authority","such disclosure","jeopardise","public","national","security","interest","this exchange","information","cover","sensitive","operational","datum","relation","activity","law enforcement","border control","immigration","asylum","authority"],"words":["without","prejudice","to","paragraph","and","information","exchange","on","a","confidential","basis","between","the","national","competent","authority","or","between","national","competent","authority","and","the commission","shall","not","be","disclose","without","prior consultation","of","the","originate","national","competent","authority","and","the deployer","when","high","risk","ai","system","refer","to","in","point","or","of","annex","iii","be","use","by","law enforcement","border control","immigration","or","asylum","authority","and","when","such disclosure","would","je