e national public authority referred to in Article 77(1), finds that the AI system does not comply with the requirements and obligations laid down in this Regulation, it shall without undue delay require the relevant operator to take all appropriate corrective actions to bring the AI system into compliance, to withdraw the AI system from the market, or to recall it within a period the market surveillance authority may prescribe, and in any event within the shorter of 15 working days, or as provided for in the relevant Union harmonisation legislation.","idx":767,"match_words":["the course","that evaluation","the market surveillance authority","applicable","the market surveillance authority","cooperation","the national public authority","refer","article","find","the ai system","comply","requirement","obligation","lay","down","this regulation","undue delay","require","the relevant operator","take","all","appropriate","corrective","action","bring","the ai system","compliance","withdraw","the ai system","the market","recall","period","the market surveillance authority","may","prescribe","any event","short","work","day","provide","the relevant union harmonisation legislation"],"words":["where","in","the course","of","that evaluation","the market surveillance authority","or","where","applicable","the market surveillance authority","in","cooperation","with","the national public authority","refer","to","in","article","find","that","the ai system","do","not","comply","with","the","requirement","and","obligation","lay","down","in","this regulation","it","shall","without","undue delay","require","the relevant operator","to","take","all","appropriate","corrective","action","to","bring","the ai system","into","compliance","to","withdraw","the ai system","from","the market","or","to","recall","it","within","a","period","the market surveillance authority","may","prescribe","and","in","any event","within","the","short","of","work","day","or","as","provide","for","in","the relevant u