ferred to in Article 5; a failure of a high-risk AI system to meet requirements set out in Chapter III, Section 2; shortcomings in the harmonised standards or common specifications referred to in Articles 40 and 41 conferring a presumption of conformity; non-compliance with Article 50.","idx":772,"match_words":["the notification","refer","paragraph","include","all","available","detail","particular","the information","necessary","the identification","non","compliant","system","the origin","the ai system","the supply chain","the nature","non","compliance","the risk","involve","the nature","duration","national","measure","take","argument","put","the relevant operator","particular","market","surveillance","authority","indicate","non","compliance","due","more","follow","non","compliance","the prohibition","practice","refer","article","a failure","high","risk","system","meet","requirement","set","out","chapter","iii","section","shortcoming","harmonised","standard","common","specification","refer","articles","confer","presumption","conformity","non","compliance","article"],"words":["the notification","refer","to","in","paragraph","shall","include","all","available","detail","in","particular","the information","necessary","for","the identification","of","the","non","compliant","ai","system","the origin","of","the ai system","and","the supply chain","the nature","of","the","non","compliance","allege","and","the risk","involve","the nature","and","duration","of","the","national","measure","take","and","the","argument","put","forward","by","the relevant operator","in","particular","the","market","surveillance","authority","shall","indicate","whether","the","non","compliance","be","due","to","or","more","of","the","follow","non","compliance","with","the prohibition","of","the","ai","practice","refer","to","in","article","a failure","of","a","high","risk","ai","system","to","meet","requirement","set","out","in","chapter","iii","section","shortcoming","in","the","harmonised","sta