uirements and obligations laid down in this Regulation.Where the provider of an AI system concerned does not bring the AI system into compliance with those requirements and obligations within the period referred to in paragraph 2 of this Article, the provider shall be subject to fines in accordance with Article 99.","idx":780,"match_words":["the provider","ensure","all necessary action","take","bring","the ai system","compliance","requirement","obligation","lay","down","this regulation","the provider","an ai system","concern","bring","the ai system","compliance","requirement","obligation","the period","refer","paragraph","this article","the provider","subject","fine","accordance","article"],"words":["the provider","shall","ensure","that","all necessary action","be","take","to","bring","the ai system","into","compliance","with","the","requirement","and","obligation","lay","down","in","this regulation","where","the provider","of","an ai system","concern","do","not","bring","the ai system","into","compliance","with","those","requirement","and","obligation","within","the period","refer","to","in","paragraph","of","this article","the provider","shall","be","subject","to","fine","in","accordance","with","article"],"unmatched_count":26,"match_length":29,"cut_length":55},{"key":"795","text_words":[["5","X",""],null,["the","DET","the"],["provider","NOUN",""],["shall","AUX",""],["ensure","VERB",""],["that","SCONJ",""],["all","DET",""],["appropriate","ADJ",""],["corrective","ADJ",""],["action","NOUN",""],["is","AUX","be"],["taken","VERB","take"],["in","ADP",""],["respect","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["all","DET",""],["the","DET",""],["ai","PROPN",""],["systems","NOUN","system"],["concerned","VERB","concern"],["that","SCONJ",""],["it","PRON",""],["has","AUX","have"],["made","VERB","make"],["available","ADJ",""],["on","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["market","NOUN",""],null],"text":"5.The provider shall ensure that all appropriate corrective action is taken in re