rsons, including as regards accessibility for persons with a disability, as well as on gender equality.","idx":841,"match_words":["the ai office","the member states","facilitate","the drawing","code","conduct","concern","the voluntary application","include","deployer","specific","requirement","all","system","the basis","clear","objective","key","performance","indicator","measure","the achievement","objective","include","element","such","limit","applicable","element","provide","union","ethical","guideline","trustworthy ai","assess","minimise","the impact","system","environmental sustainability","include","regard","energy","efficient","programming","technique","the efficient design","training","use","promote","ai literacy","particular","person","deal","the development","operation","use","facilitate","an inclusive and diverse design","system","include","the establishment","inclusive","diverse","development","the promotion","stakeholder","participation","that process","assess","prevent","the negative impact","system","vulnerable","person","group","vulnerable","person","include","regard","accessibility","person","disability","well","gender equality"],"words":["the ai office","and","the member states","shall","facilitate","the drawing","up","of","code","of","conduct","concern","the voluntary application","include","by","deployer","of","specific","requirement","to","all","ai","system","on","the basis","of","clear","objective","and","key","performance","indicator","to","measure","the achievement","of","those","objective","include","element","such","as","but","not","limit","to","applicable","element","provide","for","in","union","ethical","guideline","for","trustworthy ai","assess","and","minimise","the impact","of","ai","system","on","environmental sustainability","include","as","regard","energy","efficient","programming","and","technique","for","the efficient design","training","and","use","of","ai","promote","ai literacy","in","particular","that","of","person","deal","wit