ET",""],["extent","NOUN",""],null,["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["institution","NOUN",""],null,["body","NOUN",""],null,["office","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["agency","NOUN",""],["notified","VERB","notify"],["the","DET",""],["infringement","NOUN",""],[";","PUNCT",""],["the","DET",""],["annual","ADJ",""],["budget","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["union","PROPN",""],["institution","NOUN",""],null,["body","NOUN",""],null,["office","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["agency","NOUN",""],null],"text":"1.The European Data Protection Supervisor may impose administrative fines on Union institutions, bodies, offices and agencies falling within the scope of this Regulation.When deciding whether to impose an administrative fine and when deciding on the amount of the administrative fine in each individual case, all relevant circumstances of the specific situation shall be taken into account and due regard shall be given to the following: the nature, gravity and duration of the infringement and of its consequences, taking into account the purpose of the AI system concerned, as well as, where appropriate, the number of affected persons and the level of damage suffered by them; the degree of responsibility of the Union institution, body, office or agency, taking into account technical and organisational measures implemented by them; any action taken by the Union institution, body, office or agency to mitigate the damage suffered by affected persons; the degree of cooperation with the European Data Protection Supervisor in order to remedy the infringement and mitigate the possible adverse effects of the infringement, including compliance with any of the measures previously ordered by the European Data Protection Supervisor against the Union institution, body, office or agency concerned with regard to the same subject matter; any similar previous infringements by the Union institution, body, office or agency; the manner in which the infringement became known to the European Data Protection Supervisor, in particular whether, and if so to what extent, the Union institution, body, office or agency notified the infringement; the annual budget of the Union institution, body, office or agency.","idx":870,"match_words":["the european data protection supervisor","may","impose","administrative","fine","union","institution","body","office","agency","fall","the scope","this regulation","decide","impose","an administrative fine","decide","the amount","the administrative fine","each individual case","all","relevant","circumstance","the specific situation","take","account","due regard","give","the following","the nature","gravity","duration","the infringement","consequence","take","account","the purpose","the ai system","concern","well","appropriate","the number","affected","person","the level","damage","suffer","the degree","responsibility","the union institution","body","office","agency","take","account","technical","organisational","measure","implement","any action","take","the union institution","body","office","agency","mitigate","the damage","suffer","affected","person","the degree","cooperation","the european data protection supervisor","order","remedy","the infringement","mitigate","possible","adverse","effect","the infringement","include","compliance","measure","previously","order","the european data protection supervisor","the union institution","body","office","agency","concern","regard","the same subject matter","similar","infringement","the union institution","body","office","agency","the manner","the infringement","know","the european data protection supervisor","particular","what extent","the union institution","body","office","agency","notify","the infringement","the annual budget","the union institution","body","office","agency"],"words":["the european data protection supervisor","may","impose","administrative","fine","on","union","institution","body","office","and","agency","fall","within","the scope","of","this regulation"