anagement system which shall cover all the aspects listed under Article 17; a deion of the procedures in place to ensure that the quality management system remains adequate and effective; a written declaration that the same application has not been lodged with any other notified body.The quality management system shall be assessed by the notified body, which shall determine whether it satisfies the requirements referred to in Article 17.The decision shall be notified to the provider or its authorised representative.The notification shall contain the conclusions of the assessment of the quality management system and the reasoned assessment decision.The quality management system as approved shall continue to be implemented and maintained by the provider so that it remains adequate and efficient.Any intended change to the approved quality management system or the list of AI systems covered by the latter shall be brought to the attention of the notified body by the provider.","idx":986,"match_words":["quality management system","the application","the provider","include","the name","address","the provider","the application","lodge","authorise","representative","also their name","address","the list","system","cover","the same quality management system","technical","documentation","each ai system","cover","the same quality management system","documentation","concern","the quality management system","cover","all","aspect","list","article","deion","procedure","place","ensure","the quality management system","remain","adequate","effective","write","declaration","the same application","have","lodge","other","notify","body","the quality management system","assess","notify","body","determine","satisfy","requirement","refer","article","decision","notify","the provider","its authorised representative","the notification","contain","conclusion","the assessment","the quality management system","reason","assessment","decision","the quality management system","approve","continue","impl