f tasks without additional training, adaptability to learn new, distinct tasks, its level of autonomy and scalability, the tools it has access to; whether it has a high impact on the internal market due to its reach, which shall be presumed when it has been made available to at least 10 000 registered business users established in the Union; the number of registered end-users.","idx":1014,"match_words":["the purpose","determine","general","purpose","model","have","capability","an impact","equivalent","set","out","article","point","the commission","take","account","following","criterion","the number","parameter","the model","the quality","size","datum","set","example","measure","the amount","computation","use","train","the model","measure","float","point","operation","indicate","combination","other","such","estimate","cost","training","estimate","time","require","the training","estimate","energy","consumption","the training","the input","output","modality","the model","such","text","text","large","language","model","text","image","modality","state","art","threshold","determine","high","impact","capability","each modality","specific","type","input","output","e.g.","benchmark","evaluation","capability","the model","include","consider","the number","task","additional training","learn","new","distinct","task","its level","autonomy","tool","have","access","have","high","impact","the internal market","due","its reach","presume","have","make","available","least","register","business","user","establish","the union","number","register","end","user"],"words":["for","the purpose","of","determine","that","a","general","purpose","ai","model","have","capability","or","an impact","equivalent","to","those","set","out","in","article","51(1","point","the commission","shall","take","into","account","the","following","criterion","the number","of","parameter","of","the model","the quality","or","size","of","the","datum","set","for","example","measure","through","token","the amount","of",